<!-- Chat (design-drawers-commons.md §13 Chat), the component Chat.xml serves in the qvue render mode: the rail (my status with
    its presets, New direct message (one person, several with an optional name that makes a private room, or a phone
    number to text for a user with a number that texts), New room, Browse rooms, a find line, the filter chips All, Unread,
    Mentions, Activity, Threads, Direct, Rooms, Records and Phone (with a phone-number room), the groups Pinned, Recent, Phone
    (CrtExternal) and Bridged, each folding (kept per user in this browser), each room by its last message with its avatar or
    presence dot, last message, draft pen and unread and mention badges, and on a person's direct chat their latest mail
    thread, which opens in the Inbox and says that email is not end-to-end encrypted (find#DirectChatMail, the mailLines
    transition; Comms-Messaging §3, §6.1 rule 7); Activity lists my mentions, replies and reactions to my messages across
    rooms and Threads the threads I am in (the activity transition, find#ChatActivity, more as it scrolls, an encrypted
    room's text decrypted here), each opening its message) and the room view (chat-room, below in the script, which the tray's Chat
    tab also shows). The room is in the URL (chatRoomId, eventSeq, thread; dm and recordEntity with recordId to start a direct
    message or open a record's room), read from $root.currentParameters, so a room is a link and Back works; below 1024 px
    the rail is the screen and a room opens over it with a back arrow. The live parts come from the page's chat store
    (moqui.chat.on: events, room changes, read markers, typing), the rest from the JSON transitions of Chat.xml. The Chat key
    scope: Alt+Up and Alt+Down change room, with Shift the unread ones, Esc marks the room read and closes the side pane,
    Shift+Esc marks every room read, Up in an empty composer edits my last message. Back (moqui.back: Esc, the shell's Back,
    Android's back) closes the message sheet, an edit and the side pane; with bubbles a swipe to the right on a message
    replies to it and Attach offers the camera, the gallery or a file. A message's actions are one list (chat-message-menu,
    Comms-Messaging §4): the phone's long-press sheet, the hover toolbar's More and a right click on a desktop row, the sheet
    and the right click with the quick reactions and "+" (m-emoji-picker, WebrootEmoji.js) first; a long press on a reaction
    chip or a poll option lists who reacted or voted (a tap still reacts or votes); Info says when the message was sent, its
    delivery per network when it went out on a bridge, and who has read up to it (moqui.chat.messageInfo: not in a thread,
    none where either side's read receipts are off). A message is sent through the chat
    store's outbox (moqui.chat.send), so one sent offline waits in the page and goes when the page is back: its row shows
    Sending, Waiting or Not sent (Retry, Delete), and after a reconnect the room reads what it missed. The side panes:
    a thread, the room's threads, search, the record and the room's details (Comms-Messaging §5.1), one pane with tabs, each
    a side value: People (members), Media (a grid; the viewer swipes), Files, Voice (players), Links, Reactions and Pinned,
    each paged by its server cursor and more as it scrolls; an encrypted room's files are decrypted and sorted into them
    here, its links found in the messages opened here. With no text the composer's Send is a microphone: a voice note
    (MediaRecorder) goes up as a sound file and is sent, and plays in the message. A message may be a poll
    (/poll or the composer's poll button), a forward (Forward… in its menu: the server quotes it) and has text cards of
    its links (no pictures; its sender removes them). An encrypted room (C7, New room's Encrypted; docs/interfaces/Chat-Keys.md
    "Encrypted rooms") is encrypted and decrypted in this browser (moqui.chat.sealMessage, openEvents, openEvent over
    moqui.crypto): its outbox items and drafts keep no text, its files go up encrypted and show from decrypted blobs, and
    it has no forward, filing, app actions or polls; its header and settings say what it gives up. Every room shows its E2EE
    label (moqui.chat.e2eeLabel, Comms-Messaging §6.2): the lock in the header and the rail for an encrypted room only (with
    a check when every device is verified), else the open lock; a banner under the header (closed per room) and in the
    room's start says what reads its messages, with Verify (My devices) in an encrypted room; a text's or a bridged
    network's composer says so; with only verified devices on, my message says who cannot read it, and a message whose
    key its sender withheld from this unverified device says that (COM-UI-013). The desktop client's shell
    bundles it (crates/moqui-desktop/shell); with its server out of reach (moqui.connection, never on the web) a room shows
    where the stretch kept on the device ends, a room not kept says so, and what needs the server (edit, delete, react, pin,
    polls, forward, filing, members and settings, search, threads, the details' lists, new rooms, calls) says it needs a connection.
    With a server that takes them once by a clientRef (clientApi 4, the host's outbox.kinds()), a message's edit, deletion,
    reaction and poll vote go through the app's outbox instead, offline too, and show under the message as waiting until
    answered, or as not made with the server's reason (Retry, Discard); when the app's changes feeds change the room's
    messages (moqui.chat's rooms), the messages shown are read again from its store. In
    its app windows, which hold no crypto device (the shell owns it), an encrypted room offers Open in Chat, and a room's
    encrypted call opens the room there (moqui.call). Disappearing messages (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 16, moqui.chat.expiry):
    a room's timer is set in its Disappearing messages dialog (the room menu, Room settings, the header's timer chip), an
    expiring message has a timer by its time and leaves every list here at its time (the 'expired' signal); a single photo or
    video may go view-once (the toggle on its chip), which each recipient opens once in a full-screen viewer, kept in no
    cache, with the Android app's FLAG_SECURE while it is open. The room's call shows in the shell (Calls/Call, bundled). Brand
    color names and Quasar classes only (style-guide §4.8, §5); the m-* inputs for what is typed. -->
<template><div class="m-chat-root"><div class="m-chat row no-wrap" :style="{height: height + 'px'}">
    <!-- the rail -->
    <div v-show="!stacked || !(roomId || pendingDirect)" class="column no-wrap" :style="stacked ? 'width:100%' : 'width:300px;min-width:300px'">
        <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-px-sm q-pt-sm q-pb-xs">
            <q-btn flat dense no-caps align="left" class="col q-px-xs" :aria-label="t('My status')">
                <div class="row items-center no-wrap full-width" style="min-width:0">
                    <m-avatar :name="me.name || ''" :user-id="me.userId || undefined" size="30px"></m-avatar>
                    <div class="col q-ml-sm text-left" style="min-width:0">
                        <div class="text-subtitle2 ellipsis">{{t('Chat')}}</div>
                        <div class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis">{{myStatusText}}</div>
                    </div>
                    <q-icon name="sym_o_expand_more" size="18px" class="m-muted"></q-icon>
                </div>
                <q-menu anchor="bottom left" self="top left">
                    <q-list dense style="min-width:260px">
                        <q-item v-for="option in statusOptions" :key="option.value" clickable v-close-popup :active="myStatus.status === option.value"
                                @click="setStatus(option.value)">
                            <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:28px"><span class="m-status-dot" :class="'m-presence-' + option.dot"></span></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{option.label}}</q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                        <q-separator spaced></q-separator>
                        <q-item-label header class="q-py-xs">{{t('Set a status')}}</q-item-label>
                        <q-item v-for="(preset, index) in prefs.statusPresets || []" :key="'preset' + index" clickable v-close-popup @click="usePreset(preset)">
                            <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:28px"><span>{{preset.emoji || '💬'}}</span></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section><q-item-label>{{preset.text}}</q-item-label>
                                <q-item-label caption>{{clearLabel(preset.clearAfter)}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                        <q-item v-if="myStatus.statusText || myStatus.emoji" clickable v-close-popup @click="clearStatus">
                            <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:28px"><q-icon name="sym_o_close" size="18px"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('Clear status')}}</q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                        <q-separator spaced></q-separator>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="go(linkBase.replace(/\/Chat$/, '/Settings/Chat'))">
                            <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:28px"><q-icon name="sym_o_settings" size="18px"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('Chat settings')}}</q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                    </q-list>
                </q-menu>
            </q-btn>
            <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_edit_square" color="primary" :aria-label="t('New message or room')">
                <q-tooltip>{{t('New message or room')}}</q-tooltip>
                <q-menu anchor="bottom right" self="top right">
                    <q-list dense style="min-width:220px">
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="openNewDirect()"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_person_add"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('New direct message')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="openNewRoom()"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_group_add"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('New room')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="openBrowse()"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_travel_explore"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('Browse rooms')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-separator></q-separator>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="markAllRead"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_done_all"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{t('Mark all read')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    </q-list>
                </q-menu>
            </q-btn>
        </div>
        <div class="q-px-sm q-pb-xs" @keydown.esc="search = ''">
            <m-text-line v-model="search" name="chatRoomSearch" id="ChatRoomSearch" :label="t('Find a room or person')"></m-text-line>
        </div>
        <div class="row q-px-sm q-pb-xs">
            <q-chip v-for="item in filterItems" :key="item.value" dense clickable :outline="filter !== item.value" :color="filter === item.value ? 'primary' : undefined"
                    :text-color="filter === item.value ? 'white' : undefined" class="q-ml-none q-mr-xs q-my-none" :data-filter="item.value" @click="filter = item.value">
                {{item.label}}<span v-if="item.count" class="q-ml-xs text-weight-bold">{{item.count}}</span></q-chip>
        </div>
        <q-separator></q-separator>
        <!-- Activity and Threads (Comms-Messaging §3): my mentions, replies and reactions to my messages across rooms, and
            the threads I am in, newest first, more as the list scrolls; each opens its message -->
        <div v-if="feedShown" class="col scroll m-chat-feed" style="min-height:0" :data-feed="filter" @scroll="onFeedScroll">
            <!-- the reminders that wait (Comms-Messaging phase 15): each opens its message; the × cancels it -->
            <q-list v-if="reminderRows().length" dense class="m-chat-reminders">
                <q-item-label header class="q-py-xs q-px-sm text-caption text-weight-medium">{{t('Reminders')}}</q-item-label>
                <q-item v-for="row in reminderRows()" :key="row.chatMessageReminderId" clickable class="q-py-xs q-px-sm m-chat-reminder-row" :data-reminder="row.chatMessageReminderId"
                        @click="openReminder(row)">
                    <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:42px"><q-avatar size="32px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" icon="sym_o_alarm"></q-avatar></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section style="min-width:0">
                        <q-item-label class="row no-wrap items-center"><span class="ellipsis">{{row.senderName || t('Someone')}}</span><q-space></q-space>
                            <span class="text-caption m-muted text-no-wrap q-ml-xs">{{reminderWhen(row)}}</span></q-item-label>
                        <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis m-muted">{{reminderRoom(row)}}<template v-if="reminderSnippet(row)"> · {{reminderSnippet(row)}}</template></q-item-label>
                    </q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section side><q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" class="m-chat-reminder-cancel" :aria-label="t('Cancel the reminder')"
                            @click.stop="cancelReminder(row)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Cancel the reminder')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn></q-item-section>
                </q-item>
                <q-separator></q-separator>
            </q-list>
            <q-list dense>
                <q-item v-for="item in feedRows" :key="item.key" clickable class="q-py-xs q-px-sm m-chat-feed-row" :data-kind="item.kind" :data-room="item.chatRoomId"
                        @click="openFeedItem(item)">
                    <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:42px">
                        <m-avatar v-if="item.actorUserId" :name="item.actorName || ''" :user-id="item.actorUserId" size="32px"></m-avatar>
                        <q-avatar v-else size="32px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="feedIcon(item)"></q-avatar>
                    </q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section style="min-width:0">
                        <q-item-label class="row no-wrap items-center">
                            <q-icon :name="feedIcon(item)" size="14px" class="m-muted q-mr-xs"></q-icon>
                            <span class="ellipsis">{{feedTitle(item)}}</span>
                            <q-space></q-space>
                            <span class="text-caption m-muted text-no-wrap q-ml-xs">{{shortWhen(item.date)}}</span>
                        </q-item-label>
                        <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis m-muted">{{item.roomName || ''}}<template v-if="feedText(item)"> · {{feedText(item)}}</template></q-item-label>
                    </q-item-section>
                </q-item>
            </q-list>
            <div v-if="feed.loading" class="row justify-center q-pa-sm"><q-spinner size="20px" color="grey-6"></q-spinner></div>
            <div v-else-if="feed.loaded && !feedRows.length" class="column items-center q-pa-lg text-center m-chat-feed-empty">
                <q-icon :name="filter === 'threads' ? 'sym_o_forum' : 'sym_o_notifications'" size="40px" class="m-muted"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-sm">{{filter === 'threads' ? t('No threads yet: a thread you start or reply in is listed here') : t('Nothing yet: mentions of you, replies to you and reactions to your messages are listed here')}}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div v-else class="col scroll" style="min-height:0">
            <div v-if="!loaded" class="q-pa-sm">
                <div v-for="n in 7" :key="n" class="row items-center no-wrap q-py-sm q-gutter-x-sm">
                    <q-skeleton type="QAvatar" size="32px"></q-skeleton>
                    <div class="col"><q-skeleton type="text" width="50%"></q-skeleton><q-skeleton type="text"></q-skeleton></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <q-list v-else dense>
                <template v-for="group in groups" :key="group.key">
                    <!-- a group's header folds it (kept per user in this browser) -->
                    <q-item v-if="group.label" dense clickable class="q-py-none q-px-md m-chat-group" :data-group="group.key" :aria-expanded="folded[group.key] ? 'false' : 'true'"
                            @click="toggleFold(group.key)">
                        <q-item-section class="text-caption text-weight-medium">{{group.label}}</q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section side><div class="row no-wrap items-center">
                            <q-badge v-if="folded[group.key] && group.unread" rounded color="primary" class="q-mr-xs">{{group.unread}}</q-badge>
                            <q-icon :name="folded[group.key] ? 'sym_o_chevron_right' : 'sym_o_expand_more'" size="16px"></q-icon></div></q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                    <q-item v-for="room in (folded[group.key] && group.label ? [] : group.rows)" :key="room.chatRoomId" clickable :active="room.chatRoomId === roomId" active-class="m-tonal text-primary"
                            class="q-py-xs q-px-sm" :data-room="room.chatRoomId" @click="openRoom(room.chatRoomId)">
                        <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:42px">
                            <m-avatar v-if="room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtDirect' && room.otherUserId" :name="room.displayName" :user-id="room.otherUserId" size="32px"></m-avatar>
                            <q-avatar v-else size="32px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="roomIcon(room)"></q-avatar>
                        </q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section style="min-width:0">
                            <q-item-label class="row no-wrap items-center">
                                <span class="ellipsis" :class="countsOf(room).unread || countsOf(room).mentions ? 'text-weight-bold' : ''">{{room.displayName}}</span>
                                <q-icon v-if="room.isPinned" name="sym_o_keep" size="12px" class="m-muted q-ml-xs"></q-icon>
                                <q-chip v-if="room.filtered" dense square size="sm" class="m-tonal text-warning q-my-none q-ml-xs m-chat-filtered-chip" :data-filtered="room.filtered">
                                    {{room.filtered === 'blocked' ? t('Blocked') : t('Spam')}}</q-chip>
                                <q-icon v-if="labelOf(room).lock" name="sym_o_lock" size="12px" class="q-ml-xs text-positive m-chat-e2ee-lock" :data-e2ee="room.chatRoomId"
                                        :aria-label="labelOf(room).text"><q-tooltip>{{labelOf(room).text}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                                <q-icon v-if="room.bridged" :name="room.notConnected ? 'sym_o_link_off' : 'sym_o_hub'" size="12px" class="q-ml-xs"
                                        :class="room.notConnected ? 'text-warning' : 'm-muted'" :data-bridged="room.chatRoomId"><q-tooltip>{{bridgeText(room)}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                                <q-space></q-space>
                                <span class="text-caption m-muted text-no-wrap q-ml-xs">{{shortWhen(room.lastMessage ? room.lastMessage.sentDate : room.lastEventDate)}}</span>
                            </q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption class="row no-wrap items-center">
                                <q-icon v-if="drafts[room.chatRoomId]" name="sym_o_edit" size="12px" class="text-negative q-mr-xs"><q-tooltip>{{t('Draft')}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                                <span class="ellipsis col m-muted">{{snippetOf(room)}}</span>
                                <q-icon v-if="room.isMuted || room.notificationLevelEnumId === 'CnlNone'" name="sym_o_notifications_off" size="12px" class="m-muted q-ml-xs"></q-icon>
                                <q-badge v-if="countsOf(room).mentions" color="negative" rounded class="q-ml-xs">@{{countsOf(room).mentions}}</q-badge>
                                <q-badge v-else-if="countsOf(room).unread" :color="room.isMuted || room.notificationLevelEnumId !== 'CnlAll' ? 'grey-6' : 'primary'" rounded
                                        class="q-ml-xs">{{countsOf(room).unread}}</q-badge>
                            </q-item-label>
                            <!-- the person's latest mail thread, which opens in the Inbox (a link of its own: Tab reaches it, Enter
                                opens it); mail is never end-to-end encrypted (§6.1 rule 7) -->
                            <q-item-label v-if="mailOf(room)" caption class="row no-wrap items-center m-chat-mail-line" :data-mail="room.chatRoomId" role="link" tabindex="0"
                                    :aria-label="mailText(mailOf(room)) + '. ' + mailLabel.text" @click.stop="go(mailOf(room).url)"
                                    @keydown.enter.stop.prevent="go(mailOf(room).url)" @keydown.space.stop.prevent="go(mailOf(room).url)">
                                <q-icon name="sym_o_mail" size="12px" class="m-muted q-mr-xs"></q-icon>
                                <span class="ellipsis col m-muted">{{mailText(mailOf(room))}}<span class="m-chat-mail-label"> · {{mailLabel.text}}</span></span>
                                <q-tooltip>{{mailLabel.text}}</q-tooltip>
                            </q-item-label>
                        </q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                </template>
            </q-list>
            <div v-if="loaded && !rooms.length" class="column items-center q-pa-lg text-center">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_forum" size="48px" class="m-muted"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-sm">{{t('Start a conversation')}}</div>
                <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mb-md">{{t('Message a colleague, or make a room for a team or a topic.')}}</div>
                <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_person_add" :label="t('New direct message')" @click="openNewDirect()"></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_travel_explore" :label="t('Browse rooms')" class="q-mt-xs" @click="openBrowse()"></q-btn>
            </div>
            <div v-else-if="loaded && !shownRooms.length" class="q-pa-md text-caption m-muted text-center">
                {{t('No rooms match')}} <a href="#" class="text-primary" @click.prevent="clearFilters">{{t('Clear filters')}}</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <q-separator v-if="!stacked" vertical></q-separator>

    <!-- the room -->
    <div v-show="!stacked || roomId || pendingDirect" class="col column no-wrap" style="min-width:0">
        <chat-room v-if="roomId && loaded" :key="roomId" ref="room" :bubbles="stacked" :base="base" :room-id="roomId" :me="me" :prefs="prefs" :seq="seq" :thread="thread"
                :can-go-back="stacked" :link-base="linkBase" :rooms="rooms" :first-message="firstMessage && firstMessage.roomId === roomId ? firstMessage.body : ''"
                @back="closeRoom" @thread="setThread" @changed="scheduleRooms" @left="onLeft" @read="onRoomRead" @first-sent="firstMessage = null"></chat-room>
        <!-- a dm link to people with no direct chat (the palette's People to message): an unsaved message; the direct chat is
            made with its first send, so a link followed by mistake makes nothing the other person sees -->
        <div v-else-if="pendingDirect" class="col column no-wrap m-chat-pending-direct">
            <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-pa-sm">
                <q-btn v-if="stacked" flat round dense icon="sym_o_arrow_back" :aria-label="t('Back to chats')" @click="closeRoom"></q-btn>
                <q-icon name="sym_o_person_add" size="22px" class="q-mx-sm m-muted"></q-icon>
                <div class="col text-subtitle1 ellipsis">{{pendingDirect.name || t('New direct message')}}</div>
            </div>
            <q-separator></q-separator>
            <!-- the label of the room the first send makes (encryptionDefault: everyone in it has a crypto device, §6.5) -->
            <div v-if="pendingLabel" class="row no-wrap items-center q-px-sm q-py-xs text-caption m-tonal m-chat-pending-e2ee" :data-e2ee="pendingLabel.state">
                <q-icon :name="pendingLabel.icon" size="16px" :class="pendingLabel.lock ? 'text-positive' : 'm-muted'"></q-icon>
                <span class="col q-ml-xs">{{pendingLabel.banner}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col column items-center justify-center q-pa-lg text-center m-muted">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_chat" size="48px"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-caption q-mt-sm">{{t('No conversation yet: it starts when you send your first message.')}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="row items-end no-wrap q-pa-sm q-gutter-x-sm">
                <div class="col"><m-text-area v-model="pendingDirect.text" name="pendingDirectText" autogrow rows="1" :label="t('Message')"
                        @keydown.enter.exact.prevent="sendPendingDirect"></m-text-area></div>
                <q-btn unelevated round color="primary" icon="sym_o_send" class="m-chat-pending-send" :aria-label="t('Send')" :loading="pendingDirect.busy"
                        :disable="!String(pendingDirect.text || '').trim()" @click="sendPendingDirect"></q-btn>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div v-else class="col column items-center justify-center q-pa-lg text-center m-muted">
            <q-icon name="sym_o_chat" size="56px"></q-icon>
            <div class="text-subtitle1 q-mt-sm">{{t('Pick a conversation')}}</div>
            <div class="text-caption q-mb-md">{{t('Or start a new one: a direct message or a room.')}}</div>
            <div class="row q-gutter-sm justify-center">
                <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_person_add" :label="t('New direct message')" @click="openNewDirect()"></q-btn>
                <q-btn unelevated no-caps class="m-btn-tonal" icon="sym_o_group_add" :label="t('New room')" @click="openNewRoom()"></q-btn>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

    <!-- NewDirect: one person, or several for a group message (with a name, a room), or a phone number to text -->
    <m-dialog v-model="newDirect.open" :title="t('New direct message')" width="520">
        <m-drop-down v-model="newDirect.userIds" name="directUserIds" multiple server-search :options-url="url('searchUsers')" :options-parameters="pickParameters" :options-extra="contactOptions"
                :label="(newDirect.numbers || []).length ? t('To: people or a phone number') : t('To')"></m-drop-down>
        <m-text-line v-if="pickKind === 'group'" v-model="newDirect.name" name="directRoomName" :label="t('Name (optional): makes a room')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-line>
        <m-drop-down v-if="(pickKind === 'number' || pickKind === 'numbers') && (newDirect.numbers || []).length > 1" v-model="newDirect.fromNumber" name="directFromNumber" :options="newDirect.numbers"
                :label="t('From')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-drop-down>
        <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs">{{pickHint}}</div>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_chat" :label="t('Start')" :loading="newDirect.busy" :disable="pickKind === 'none' || pickKind === 'mixed'" @click="startPicked()"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- another of my devices asks to verify with this one (a new device being set up, Comms-Messaging §6.5) -->
    <m-dialog :model-value="ownRequests.length > 0" :title="t('Verify your new device')" width="520" @update:model-value="(open) => { if (!open) ownRequests.forEach(dismissOwn); }">
        <div class="text-body2 q-mb-sm">{{t('Another of your devices asks to be verified, to read your encrypted messages. Accept only if you are setting it up now.')}}</div>
        <m-chat-verification v-for="flow in ownRequests" :key="flow.flowId" :flow="flow" :who="ownWho(flow)" class="q-mb-sm m-chat-own-request"></m-chat-verification>
    </m-dialog>
    <!-- NewRoom: name, topic, private or public, members -->
    <m-dialog v-model="newRoom.open" :title="t('New room')" width="560">
        <q-btn-toggle v-model="newRoom.type" spread dense no-caps unelevated toggle-color="primary" class="q-mb-xs"
                :options="[{label: t('Private'), value: 'private', icon: 'sym_o_groups'}, {label: t('Public'), value: 'public', icon: 'sym_o_tag'}]"></q-btn-toggle>
        <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mb-sm">{{newRoom.type === 'public' ? t('Anyone can find this room, read it and join.') : t('Only the people in it see it; members add others.')}}</div>
        <template v-if="newRoom.type !== 'public'">
            <!-- on by default when everyone picked has a crypto device (encryptionDefault, §6.5), until the user sets it -->
            <q-toggle :model-value="newRoom.encrypted" name="roomEncrypted" :label="t('Encrypted')" class="m-chat-new-encrypted"
                    @update:model-value="(on) => { newRoom.encrypted = on; newRoom.touched = true; }"></q-toggle>
            <div v-if="newRoom.encrypted" class="text-caption m-muted q-mb-sm">{{t('End-to-end encrypted, for good: only the devices of its members read it. No server search, link previews, agents, polls, bridges, forwards, filing on records or terminal; a new device reads older messages from your key backup.')}}</div>
        </template>
        <m-text-line v-model="newRoom.name" name="roomName" :label="t('Name')" required></m-text-line>
        <m-text-area v-model="newRoom.topic" name="roomTopic" rows="2" :label="t('Topic')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-area>
        <m-drop-down v-model="newRoom.userIds" name="roomUserIds" multiple server-search :options-url="url('searchUsers')" :label="t('Members')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-drop-down>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_add" :label="t('Create')" :loading="newRoom.busy" :disable="!String(newRoom.name || '').trim()" @click="createRoom"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- Browse rooms: the public rooms I am not in, to read or join -->
    <m-dialog v-model="browse.open" :title="t('Browse rooms')" width="620">
        <div class="row no-wrap items-center q-gutter-x-xs" @keydown.enter.prevent="loadBrowse">
            <div class="col"><m-text-line v-model="browse.search" name="browseSearch" :label="t('Find a room')"></m-text-line></div>
            <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_search" :aria-label="t('Search')" @click="loadBrowse"></q-btn>
        </div>
        <q-list dense separator class="q-mt-sm">
            <q-item v-for="room in browse.list" :key="room.chatRoomId" class="q-px-xs">
                <q-item-section avatar><q-avatar size="32px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="roomIcon(room)"></q-avatar></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section><q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{room.displayName}}</q-item-label>
                    <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-2-lines">{{room.topic || (room.record ? room.record.typeLabel + ' ' + room.record.title : t('No topic'))}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section side><div class="row no-wrap q-gutter-x-xs">
                    <q-btn flat dense no-caps color="primary" :label="t('View')" @click="viewBrowsed(room)"></q-btn>
                    <q-btn unelevated dense no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Join')" @click="joinBrowsed(room)"></q-btn>
                </div></q-item-section>
            </q-item>
            <q-item v-if="!browse.loading && !browse.list.length"><q-item-section class="m-muted">{{t('No public rooms to join')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
        </q-list>
        <!-- private rooms their owners list in Browse: ask to join (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17) -->
        <template v-if="browse.listed && browse.listed.length">
            <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-md">{{t('Private rooms you can ask to join')}}</div>
            <q-list dense separator>
                <q-item v-for="room in browse.listed" :key="room.chatRoomId" class="q-px-xs m-chat-listed-room">
                    <q-item-section avatar><q-avatar size="32px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" icon="sym_o_lock_person"></q-avatar></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section><q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{room.roomName}}</q-item-label>
                        <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-2-lines">{{room.topic || fill(t('{count} members'), { count: room.memberCount })}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section side>
                        <q-chip v-if="room.pending" dense square class="m-tonal">{{t('Asked')}}</q-chip>
                        <q-btn v-else unelevated dense no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Ask to join')" @click="askToJoin(room)"></q-btn>
                    </q-item-section>
                </q-item>
            </q-list>
        </template>
        <q-inner-loading :showing="browse.loading"></q-inner-loading>
    </m-dialog>
</div></template>

<script>
const t = (text) => (moqui.l10n && moqui.l10n.localize ? moqui.l10n.localize(text) : text);
const DAY = 86400000;
const GROUP_MILLIS = 5 * 60000;
// how far a bubble is swiped to the right to reply to it
const SWIPE_REPLY_PX = 64;
const EDIT_WINDOW = 24 * 3600000;
const QUICK_REACTIONS = ['👍', '❤️', '😂', '🎉', '👀', '✅'];
// how long a press on a reaction chip or a poll option is held to show who reacted or voted (the message's own long press too)
const HOLD_MS = 450;
const CLEAR_LABELS = { '0': "Don't clear", '30': 'Clears in 30 minutes', '60': 'Clears in an hour', '240': 'Clears in 4 hours', today: 'Clears today', week: 'Clears this week' };
const LEVELS = [{ value: 'CnlAll', label: 'All messages', icon: 'sym_o_notifications_active' }, { value: 'CnlMentions', label: 'Mentions only', icon: 'sym_o_alternate_email' },
    { value: 'CnlNone', label: 'Nothing', icon: 'sym_o_notifications_off' }];
// the drafts' keys (moqui.drafts puts them under the storage scope, or in the desktop client's store)
const draftPrefix = () => 'boss.chat.draft.';
// the desktop client's server out of reach (moqui.connection, from its answers; never on the web): an action that needs the
// server says so instead of failing, and is not taken
const noConnection = () => !!(moqui.connection && moqui.connection.offline);
const needsConnection = () => {
    if (!noConnection()) return false;
    moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('This needs a connection to the server: try again when it is back') }]);
    return true;
};
// the drafts of encrypted rooms: in this page only (C7)
const sealedDrafts = {};
const fill = (text, values) => String(text).replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g, (match, key) => (values[key] == null ? '' : String(values[key])));
// The dates (in the user's zone, by calendar day), room icons, counts and snippets the room list here, the phone home and the
// tray share: moqui.chat's (WebrootChat.js), called when used (the bundle test loads this module without moqui.chat)
const timeText = (millis) => moqui.chat.timeText(millis);
const fullTime = (millis) => moqui.chat.fullTime(millis);
const dayLabel = (millis) => moqui.chat.dayLabel(millis);
const shortWhen = (millis) => moqui.chat.shortWhen(millis);
const sizeText = (bytes) => {
    const n = Number(bytes || 0);
    if (n < 1024) return n + ' B';
    if (n < 1024 * 1024) return Math.round(n / 1024) + ' KB';
    return (n / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1) + ' MB';
};
const isImage = (file) => /^image\/(png|jpe?g|gif|webp)$/i.test((file && file.contentType) || '');
const isVideo = (file) => /^video\//i.test((file && file.contentType) || '');
const isAudio = (file) => /^audio\//i.test((file && file.contentType) || '');
// the details view (Comms-Messaging §5.1): one pane with tabs, each a side value, so Back and Esc close it as any pane
const DETAIL_TABS = ['members', 'media', 'files', 'voice', 'links', 'reactions', 'pinned'];
// the tabs of the room's files: the types each keeps on the server (files) and here (an encrypted room's, sorted here)
const FILE_TABS = {
    media: { params: { contentTypePrefixes: 'image/,video/' }, keeps: (file) => /^(image|video)\//i.test(file.contentType || '') },
    files: { params: { excludeContentTypePrefixes: 'image/,video/,audio/' }, keeps: (file) => !/^(image|video|audio)\//i.test(file.contentType || '') },
    voice: { params: { contentTypePrefixes: 'audio/' }, keeps: (file) => /^audio\//i.test(file.contentType || '') }
};
const emptyTab = () => ({ list: [], next: null, loading: false, loaded: false, onlyToMe: false });
const shortText = (text) => { const shown = String(text || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim(); return shown.length > 100 ? shown.slice(0, 99) + '…' : shown; };
// the links of a message's HTML (an encrypted room's, decrypted here: the server cannot list them), each once, in order
const linksIn = (html) => {
    const text = String(html || '').replace(/&amp;/g, '&');
    const found = [];
    for (const match of text.matchAll(/https?:\/\/[^\s"'<>`]+/gi)) {
        const url = match[0].replace(/[.,;:!?)\]}]+$/, '');
        if (!found.includes(url)) found.push(url);
    }
    return found;
};
const fileIcon = (file) => {
    const type = String((file && file.contentType) || '');
    if (/^image\//.test(type)) return 'sym_o_image';
    if (/^video\//.test(type)) return 'sym_o_movie';
    if (/^audio\//.test(type)) return 'sym_o_mic';
    if (/pdf/.test(type)) return 'sym_o_picture_as_pdf';
    if (/(sheet|excel|csv)/.test(type)) return 'sym_o_table';
    if (/(word|document|text)/.test(type)) return 'sym_o_description';
    if (/(zip|compressed)/.test(type)) return 'sym_o_folder_zip';
    return 'sym_o_attach_file';
};
// mentions of me read in bold (the rich-text content style tints every mention)
// an image of another host loses its src (SEC-COM-02; the server keeps no such image since, moqui.chat.ownImages)
const decorateBody = (html, me) => (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.ownImages ? moqui.chat.ownImages(html) : String(html || '')).replace(/<span data-mention-id="([^"]*)"/g,
    (match, id) => '<span class="m-chat-mention' + (id === me ? ' text-weight-bold' : '') + '" data-mention-id="' + id + '"');
const plainOf = (html) => (moqui.richText && moqui.richText.toPlain ? moqui.richText.toPlain(html || '') : String(html || '').replace(/<[^>]*>/g, ' ')).trim();
// a pushed event merged into a timeline list (the page's chat store; nothing without it)
const applyEvent = (list, event, me, threadRoot) => (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.applyEvent ? moqui.chat.applyEvent(list, event, me, threadRoot) : list);
const isEmptyHtml = (html) => (moqui.richText && moqui.richText.isEmpty ? moqui.richText.isEmpty(html || '') : !plainOf(html));
// a membership, system, pin, call or poll event in words, with its icon
const systemText = (event, nameOf) => {
    const content = event.content || {};
    const by = nameOf(content.byUserId || event.senderUserId);
    const who = nameOf(content.userId || content.chatActorId);
    const roles = { CmrOwner: t('an owner'), CmrModerator: t('a moderator'), CmrMember: t('a member'), CmrAgent: t('an agent') };
    if (event.type === 'membership') {
        // joined by an invite link, added by text, left by STOP (moqui.chat.invites, Comms-Messaging §18.3 phases 17 and 18)
        const joinLine = moqui.chat && moqui.chat.invites ? moqui.chat.invites.membershipLine(content, who, by) : null;
        if (joinLine) return [joinLine, content.via === 'text' ? 'sym_o_sms' : content.action === 'leave' ? 'sym_o_logout' : 'sym_o_link'];
        if (content.action === 'join') return [fill(t('{user} joined'), { user: who }), 'sym_o_login'];
        if (content.action === 'add') return [fill(t('{by} added {user}'), { by, user: who }), 'sym_o_person_add'];
        if (content.action === 'leave') return [fill(t('{user} left'), { user: who }), 'sym_o_logout'];
        if (content.action === 'remove') return [fill(t('{by} took {user} out'), { by, user: who }), 'sym_o_person_remove'];
        // an owner's succession when the last owner left: the sender is the one who left
        if (content.action === 'role' && content.automatic) return [fill(t('{user} became an owner when {by} left'), { by, user: who }), 'sym_o_shield_person'];
        if (content.action === 'role') return [fill(t('{by} made {user} {role}'), { by, user: who, role: roles[content.roleEnumId] || content.roleEnumId }), 'sym_o_shield_person'];
        return [fill(t('{by} changed the members'), { by }), 'sym_o_group'];
    }
    if (event.type === 'system') {
        if (content.action === 'created') return [fill(t('{by} created the room'), { by }), 'sym_o_add_circle'];
        if (content.action === 'renamed') return [fill(t('{by} renamed the room to {name}'), { by, name: content.roomName || '' }), 'sym_o_edit'];
        if (content.action === 'topic') return [content.topic ? fill(t('{by} set the topic: {topic}'), { by, topic: content.topic }) : fill(t('{by} cleared the topic'), { by }), 'sym_o_subject'];
        if (content.action === 'archived') return [fill(t('{by} archived the room'), { by }), 'sym_o_archive'];
        if (content.action === 'unarchived') return [fill(t('{by} took the room out of the archive'), { by }), 'sym_o_unarchive'];
        if (content.action === 'timer') return [content.seconds ? fill(t('{by} set disappearing messages to {time}'), { by, time: moqui.chat.expiry.label(content.seconds, t) })
            : fill(t('{by} turned off disappearing messages'), { by }), 'sym_o_timer'];
        return [fill(t('{by} changed the room'), { by }), 'sym_o_info'];
    }
    if (event.type === 'pin') return [fill(content.pinned ? t('{by} pinned a message') : t('{by} unpinned a message'), { by }), 'sym_o_keep'];
    if (event.type === 'call') return [fill(t('{by} started a call'), { by }), 'sym_o_call'];
    if (event.type === 'poll') return [fill(t('{by} made a poll'), { by }), 'sym_o_ballot'];
    return [by, 'sym_o_info'];
};
// the drafts: this browser's storage under the scope, or the desktop client's store (MoquiLib moqui.drafts)
const storage = {
    get(key) { return moqui.drafts.get(key); },
    set(key, value) { moqui.drafts.put(key, value || null); },
    keys(prefix) { return moqui.drafts.keys(prefix); }
};
// a short sound for a new message, at most every two seconds (not under do not disturb: the caller asks moqui.chat.quiet())
let lastChime = 0;
let audio = null;
const chime = () => {
    const now = Date.now();
    if (now - lastChime < 2000) return;
    lastChime = now;
    try {
        const Ctx = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;
        if (!Ctx) return;
        audio = audio || new Ctx();
        const osc = audio.createOscillator();
        const gain = audio.createGain();
        osc.type = 'sine';
        osc.frequency.value = 880;
        gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, audio.currentTime);
        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.05, audio.currentTime + 0.02);
        gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, audio.currentTime + 0.25);
        osc.connect(gain);
        gain.connect(audio.destination);
        osc.start();
        osc.stop(audio.currentTime + 0.3);
    } catch (err) { /* the browser plays nothing before the user's first click */ }
};

// ---- a message of the timeline or of a thread (room is the chat-room component) ----
const messageTemplate = `
<div class="row no-wrap relative-position q-pl-xs q-pr-sm m-chat-msg" :class="[item.grouped ? 'm-chat-grouped' : 'q-mt-sm', room.useBubbles ? 'm-chat-bubble' : '',
            room.useBubbles && item.mine ? 'm-chat-mine' : '', room.useBubbles && room.isDirect ? 'm-chat-in-direct' : '']" :id="room.domId(item.eventSeq, inThread)"
        :data-seq="item.eventSeq" role="article" :tabindex="actionsAvailable ? 0 : -1" :aria-label="messageLabel"
        @focusin="actionFocus = true" @focusout="actionFocus = $event.currentTarget.contains($event.relatedTarget)"
        @mouseenter="room.hover(item, inThread)" @mouseleave="room.unhover(item, inThread)" @click="room.tap(item, inThread)"
        @touchstart.passive="room.holdStart(item, inThread, $event)" @touchmove.passive="room.holdMove($event)" @touchend="room.holdEnd($event)"
        @touchcancel="room.holdEnd($event)" @contextmenu="contextMenu($event)" :style="room.swipeStyle(item, inThread)">
    <div class="self-stretch" :class="item.highlight ? 'bg-primary' : ''" style="width:3px;margin-right:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
    <div style="width:40px;min-width:40px" class="q-pr-sm m-chat-avatar">
        <m-avatar v-if="!item.grouped" :name="item.senderName" :user-id="item.senderUserId || undefined" size="32px" class="q-mt-xs"></m-avatar>
        <div v-else-if="room.isHovered(item, inThread)" class="text-caption m-muted text-right text-no-wrap" style="font-size:10px;line-height:20px">{{item.timeShort}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="col m-chat-body" style="min-width:0">
        <div v-if="!item.grouped" class="row items-baseline no-wrap m-chat-head">
            <span class="text-weight-medium ellipsis m-chat-name">{{item.senderName}}</span>
            <!-- the check only for a verified person's message from a verified device of theirs; else from a verified person, a warning -->
            <q-icon v-if="room.personVerified(item.senderUserId) && item.verifiedSender !== false" name="sym_o_verified" size="14px" class="text-positive q-ml-xs m-chat-person-verified" :aria-label="room.t('Verified')"></q-icon>
            <q-icon v-else-if="room.personVerified(item.senderUserId) && item.verifiedSender === false" name="sym_o_gpp_maybe" size="14px" class="text-warning q-ml-xs m-chat-sender-unverified"
                    :aria-label="room.t('Sent from a device of theirs that is not verified')"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Sent from a device of theirs that is not verified')}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
            <q-chip v-if="item.event.senderExternal" dense square size="sm" icon="sym_o_hub" class="m-tonal text-info q-my-none q-ml-xs m-chat-external">
                {{item.event.senderExternal.networkName || room.t('Outside')}}</q-chip>
            <span class="text-caption m-muted text-no-wrap q-ml-sm">{{item.timeText}}<q-tooltip>{{item.fullTime}}</q-tooltip></span>
            <q-icon v-if="item.expireDate" name="sym_o_timer" size="14px" class="q-ml-xs m-muted m-chat-expiring" :aria-label="room.leftText(item)"><q-tooltip>{{room.leftText(item)}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
            <q-icon v-if="item.pinned" name="sym_o_keep" size="14px" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Pinned')}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
        </div>
        <div v-if="item.replyTo" class="row no-wrap q-my-xs cursor-pointer" @click.stop="room.jumpTo(item.replyTo.eventSeq)">
            <div class="self-stretch bg-grey-5" style="width:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
            <div class="q-pl-sm text-caption ellipsis-2-lines" style="min-width:0">
                <span class="text-weight-medium">{{(item.replyTo.senderName || room.t('Someone')) + ': '}}</span><span class="m-muted">{{item.replyTo.redacted ? room.t('Message removed') : item.replyTo.snippet}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div v-if="item.redacted" class="text-body2 m-muted text-italic">{{item.removedLabel || room.t('Message removed')}}</div>
        <div v-else-if="item.undecryptable" class="text-body2 m-muted text-italic m-chat-undecryptable" :data-withheld="item.withheld || undefined"><q-icon name="sym_o_lock" size="16px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{room.undecryptableText(item)}}
            <q-btn v-if="room.setupNeeded && item.withheld !== 'm.unverified'" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-setup-message" :label="room.t('Set up')" @click.stop="room.openSetup()"></q-btn></div>
        <template v-else>
            <chat-edit v-if="room.isEditing(item)" :room="room" :item="item"></chat-edit>
            <chat-rich v-else-if="item.event.rich" :item="item" :room="room"></chat-rich>
            <div v-else-if="item.bodyHtml && !item.poll" class="m-rich-text-content text-body2" style="padding:0;cursor:auto;max-height:none;overflow:visible;overflow-wrap:anywhere"
                    v-html="item.bodyHtml" @click="room.bodyClick($event)"></div>
            <!-- an answer to a button (content.postback: tapped here, or an RCS reply) -->
            <div v-if="item.event.postback" class="row items-center no-wrap text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs m-chat-postback">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_reply" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon><span class="ellipsis">{{room.t('Chose a suggestion')}}</span></div>
            <span v-if="item.edited && !room.isEditing(item)" class="text-caption m-muted">{{room.t('(edited)')}}<q-tooltip>{{item.editedText}}</q-tooltip></span>
            <div v-if="item.forwardOf" class="row no-wrap q-mt-xs m-chat-forward" style="max-width:520px">
                <div class="self-stretch bg-grey-5" style="width:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
                <div class="q-pl-sm" style="min-width:0">
                    <div class="text-caption m-muted"><q-icon name="sym_o_forward" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{room.forwardedText(item.forwardOf)}}</div>
                    <div v-if="item.forwardOf.body" class="m-rich-text-content text-body2" style="padding:0;cursor:auto;max-height:none;overflow:visible;overflow-wrap:anywhere"
                            v-html="item.forwardOf.body" @click="room.bodyClick($event)"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <q-card v-if="item.poll" flat bordered class="q-mt-xs q-pa-sm m-chat-poll" style="max-width:440px">
                <div class="row no-wrap items-start text-weight-medium q-mb-xs"><q-icon name="sym_o_ballot" size="18px" class="q-mr-xs text-primary"></q-icon>
                    <span style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{item.poll.question}}</span></div>
                <!-- a tap votes; a long press, its own context menu (Android's long press, the menu key) or Shift+Enter shows who
                     voted (a hover on the count, with a pointer) -->
                <q-item v-for="option in item.poll.options" :key="option.id" dense clickable class="rounded-borders q-px-xs" :disable="!room.canVote(item)"
                        :data-option="option.id" :aria-keyshortcuts="option.voterIds && option.voterIds.length ? 'Shift+Enter' : undefined"
                        @click.stop="room.pressed() || room.vote(item, option)"
                        @touchstart.passive="room.pressStart({ kind: 'voters', item, option }, $event)" @touchmove.passive="room.pressCancel()"
                        @touchend="room.pressEnd($event)" @touchcancel="room.pressEnd($event)"
                        @contextmenu.prevent.stop="room.pressMenu({ kind: 'voters', item, option })" @keydown.enter.shift.prevent.stop="room.pressMenu({ kind: 'voters', item, option })">
                    <q-item-section avatar style="min-width:28px"><q-icon :name="room.optionIcon(item, option)" :color="option.mine ? 'primary' : undefined" size="20px"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section>
                        <q-item-label style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{option.text}}</q-item-label>
                        <q-linear-progress :value="room.optionShare(item, option)" rounded size="6px" :color="option.mine ? 'primary' : 'grey-5'" class="q-mt-xs"></q-linear-progress>
                    </q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section side class="text-caption">{{option.voteCount}}<q-tooltip v-if="!room.mobile && option.voterIds && option.voterIds.length">{{room.votersText(option)}}</q-tooltip></q-item-section>
                </q-item>
                <div class="row items-center no-wrap text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs">
                    <span class="ellipsis">{{room.pollFooter(item.poll)}}</span><q-space></q-space>
                    <q-btn v-if="room.canClosePoll(item)" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="room.t('Close the poll')" @click.stop="room.closePoll(item)"></q-btn>
                </div>
            </q-card>
            <!-- a view-once photo or video (phase 16): opened once, in its own viewer; never a preview here -->
            <div v-if="item.viewOnce" class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs q-pa-sm rounded-borders m-tonal m-chat-view-once" :data-view-once="room.viewOnceState(item)" style="max-width:280px">
                <q-icon :name="item.viewOnce.kind === 'video' ? 'sym_o_videocam' : 'sym_o_photo'" size="20px" class="q-mr-sm"></q-icon>
                <span class="col text-body2">{{room.viewOnceText(item)}}</span>
                <q-btn v-if="room.viewOnceState(item) === 'closed'" flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_looks_one" class="m-chat-view-once-open" :label="room.t('Open')"
                        @click.stop="room.openViewOnce(item)"></q-btn>
            </div>
            <div v-if="item.attachments.length && !item.event.rich" class="row q-gutter-xs q-mt-none">
                <template v-for="file in item.attachments" :key="file.chatAttachmentId">
                    <img v-if="room.isImage(file)" :src="room.fileUrl(file, true)" :alt="file.fileName" class="rounded-borders cursor-pointer q-mt-xs"
                            style="max-width:min(280px, 100%);max-height:200px" @load="room.imageLoaded()" @click.stop="room.preview(file, item.attachments)">
                    <!-- a voice note or other sound plays here (an encrypted room's once decrypted) -->
                    <div v-else-if="room.isAudio(file)" class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs m-chat-audio" :data-file="file.chatAttachmentId" @click.stop>
                        <audio v-if="room.mediaUrl(file)" :src="room.mediaUrl(file)" controls preload="metadata" :aria-label="file.fileName" style="max-width:min(300px, 100%);height:40px"></audio>
                        <q-btn v-else flat dense no-caps icon="sym_o_play_arrow" class="m-tonal" :label="room.t('Play the voice note')" @click="room.openMedia(file)"></q-btn>
                    </div>
                    <q-chip v-else dense square clickable :icon="room.fileIcon(file)" class="m-tonal q-ml-none"
                            @click.stop="room.isVideo(file) ? room.preview(file, item.attachments) : room.download(file)">
                        <span class="ellipsis" style="max-width:220px">{{file.fileName}}</span><span class="m-muted q-ml-xs">{{room.sizeText(file.fileSize)}}</span>
                        <q-tooltip>{{room.isVideo(file) ? room.t('Play') : room.t('Download')}} {{file.fileName}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                </template>
            </div>
            <div v-if="item.linkPreviews.length" class="q-mt-xs" style="max-width:440px">
                <q-card v-for="preview in item.linkPreviews" :key="preview.url" flat bordered class="row no-wrap q-pa-sm q-mb-xs m-chat-link-preview">
                    <div class="self-stretch bg-primary q-mr-sm" style="width:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
                    <div class="col" style="min-width:0">
                        <div v-if="preview.siteName" class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis">{{preview.siteName}}</div>
                        <a :href="preview.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary text-weight-medium ellipsis-2-lines" @click.stop>{{preview.title}}</a>
                        <div v-if="preview.description" class="text-caption ellipsis-3-lines">{{preview.description}}</div>
                    </div>
                    <q-btn v-if="item.mine && room.canPost" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" class="self-start" :aria-label="room.t('Remove preview')"
                            @click.stop="room.removePreviews(item)"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Remove preview')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                </q-card>
            </div>
            <div v-if="item.records.length" class="q-mt-xs" style="max-width:440px">
                <m-record-card v-for="record in item.records" :key="record.entity + '|' + record.id" :record-entity="record.entity" :record-id="record.id"
                        :card-url="room.url('recordCard')" dense class="q-mb-xs"></m-record-card>
            </div>
            <!-- a tap adds or takes back my reaction; a long press, its own context menu (Android's long press, the menu key) or
                 Shift+Enter shows who reacted (a hover, with a pointer) -->
            <div v-if="item.reactions.length" class="row items-center q-mt-xs">
                <q-chip v-for="reaction in item.reactions" :key="reaction.key" dense clickable :outline="!reaction.mine" :color="reaction.mine ? 'primary' : undefined"
                        :text-color="reaction.mine ? 'white' : undefined" class="q-ml-none q-mr-xs m-chat-reaction" :data-reaction="reaction.key"
                        :aria-label="room.reactionLabel(reaction)" aria-keyshortcuts="Shift+Enter"
                        :disable="!room.canPost || !room.bridgeCaps.reaction" @click.stop="room.pressed() || room.react(item, reaction.key)"
                        @touchstart.passive="room.pressStart({ kind: 'reactors', item, reaction }, $event)" @touchmove.passive="room.pressCancel()"
                        @touchend="room.pressEnd($event)" @touchcancel="room.pressEnd($event)"
                        @contextmenu.prevent.stop="room.pressMenu({ kind: 'reactors', item, reaction })" @keydown.enter.shift.prevent.stop="room.pressMenu({ kind: 'reactors', item, reaction })">
                    {{reaction.key}} {{reaction.count}}<q-tooltip v-if="!room.mobile">{{room.reactorsText(reaction)}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
            </div>
            <div v-if="!inThread && item.threadReplyCount" class="q-mt-xs">
                <a href="#" class="text-primary text-caption text-weight-medium" @click.prevent.stop="room.openThread(item.eventSeq)">{{room.repliesText(item.threadReplyCount)}}</a>
                <span class="text-caption m-muted"> · {{room.t('last reply')}} {{room.shortWhen(item.threadLastDate)}}</span>
            </div>
            <!-- my message in an encrypted room with only verified devices on: who cannot read it, and Verify (COM-UI-013) -->
            <div v-if="item.mine && room.leftOutBySeq[item.eventSeq]" class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs text-caption text-warning m-chat-left-out">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_visibility_off" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon><span class="ellipsis">{{room.leftOutBySeq[item.eventSeq]}}</span>
                <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-left-out-verify" :label="room.t('Verify')" @click.stop="room.verifySomeone()"></q-btn>
            </div>
            <!-- its delivery to the room's bridges: sending, delivered, not delivered (with Send again) or uncertain -->
            <div v-if="item.event.delivery" class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs text-caption m-chat-delivery" :class="room.deliveryClass(item)"
                    :data-delivery="item.event.delivery.state">
                <q-icon :name="room.deliveryIcon(item)" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>
                <span class="ellipsis">{{room.deliveryText(item)}}</span>
                <q-btn v-if="room.canRetry(item)" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs" :label="room.t('Send again')"
                        @click.stop="room.retryDelivery(item)"></q-btn>
            </div>
        </template>
        <!-- the desktop client: its changes of the message waiting in the app's outbox, or refused (Retry, Discard) -->
        <div v-for="change in room.changesOf(item)" :key="change.clientRef" class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs text-caption m-chat-change"
                :class="change.status === 'failed' ? 'text-negative' : 'm-muted'" :data-change="change.kind" :data-pending="change.status" @click.stop>
            <q-spinner v-if="change.status === 'sending'" size="12px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-spinner>
            <q-icon v-else :name="change.status === 'failed' ? 'sym_o_error' : 'sym_o_schedule'" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>
            <span class="ellipsis">{{room.changeText(change)}}</span>
            <template v-if="change.status === 'failed'">
                <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="room.t('Retry')" class="q-ml-sm" @click="room.retryChange(change)"></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" :label="room.t('Discard')" @click="room.discardChange(change)"></q-btn>
            </template>
        </div>
        <div class="m-chat-stamp text-caption m-muted">{{item.timeShort}}<span v-if="item.edited"> {{room.t('(edited)')}}</span><q-icon v-if="room.reminderOf(item)"
                name="sym_o_alarm" size="12px" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-reminder"><q-tooltip>{{room.reminderText(item)}}</q-tooltip></q-icon></div>
        <div v-if="item.readers && item.readers.length && (item.mine || !room.useBubbles)" class="row justify-end items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs">
            <m-avatar v-for="reader in item.readers.slice(0, 6)" :key="reader.userId" :name="reader.name" :user-id="reader.userId" size="16px" class="q-ml-xs" tooltip></m-avatar>
            <span v-if="item.readers.length > 6" class="text-caption m-muted q-ml-xs">+{{item.readers.length - 6}}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div v-if="actionsVisible" class="absolute-top-right q-mr-sm" style="top:-14px;z-index:2" @click.stop>
        <q-card flat bordered class="row no-wrap items-center shadow-2">
            <template v-if="room.canPost">
                <template v-if="room.bridgeCaps.reaction">
                    <q-btn v-for="key in room.quickReactions.slice(0, room.compact ? 2 : 3)" :key="key" flat dense size="sm" class="q-px-xs" :label="key"
                            :aria-label="room.t('React with') + ' ' + key" @click="room.react(item, key)"></q-btn>
                    <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_add_reaction" :aria-label="room.t('React')"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('React')}}</q-tooltip>
                        <q-menu ref="reactMenu" anchor="bottom right" self="top right" @before-show="reactionMenu = true" @hide="reactionMenu = false">
                            <m-emoji-picker :user-id="room.me.userId || ''" :autofocus="!room.mobile" @pick="picked"></m-emoji-picker>
                        </q-menu>
                    </q-btn>
                </template>
                <q-btn v-if="!inThread" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_reply" :aria-label="room.t('Reply')" @click="room.startReply(item)"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Reply')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                <q-btn v-if="!inThread" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_forum" :aria-label="room.t('Reply in thread')" @click="room.openThread(item.eventSeq)">
                    <q-tooltip>{{room.t('Reply in thread')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            </template>
            <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_more_vert" :aria-label="room.t('More')"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('More')}}</q-tooltip>
                <q-menu ref="moreMenu" anchor="bottom right" self="top right" @before-show="moreMenu = true" @hide="moreMenu = false">
                    <chat-message-menu :room="room" :item="item" :in-thread="inThread" dense style="min-width:230px" @done="hide('moreMenu')"></chat-message-menu>
                </q-menu>
            </q-btn>
        </q-card>
    </div>
    <!-- a right click on a row (no bubbles): the same menu at the pointer, with the quick reactions; on a link, an editor or
         selected text the browser's own -->
    <q-menu v-if="contextOpen" ref="contextMenu" touch-position no-parent-event class="m-chat-context-menu" @hide="contextOpen = false">
        <chat-message-menu :room="room" :item="item" :in-thread="inThread" reactions dense style="min-width:240px;max-width:360px" @done="hide('contextMenu')"></chat-message-menu>
    </q-menu>
</div>`;

// ---- a message of the outbox, not yet answered: Sending, Waiting, or Not sent with Retry and Delete ----
const pendingTemplate = `
<div class="row no-wrap q-pl-xs q-pr-sm q-mt-sm m-chat-pending" :data-pending="item.status" :data-client-ref="item.clientRef">
    <div style="width:46px;min-width:46px"></div>
    <div class="col text-body2" style="min-width:0">
        <div class="ellipsis-2-lines" :style="item.status === 'failed' ? '' : 'opacity:0.6'">{{item.text}}</div>
        <div class="row items-center no-wrap text-caption" :class="item.status === 'failed' ? 'text-negative' : 'm-muted'">
            <q-spinner v-if="item.status === 'sending'" size="12px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-spinner>
            <q-icon v-else :name="item.status === 'failed' ? 'sym_o_error' : 'sym_o_schedule'" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>
            <span class="ellipsis">{{room.pendingText(item)}}</span>
            <template v-if="item.status === 'failed'">
                <q-btn v-if="!item.expired" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="room.t('Retry')" class="q-ml-sm" @click="room.retryPending(item)"></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" :label="room.t('Delete')" @click="room.discardPending(item)"></q-btn>
            </template>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>`;
const chatPending = { name: 'ChatPending', props: { item: Object, room: Object }, template: pendingTemplate };

// ---- rich messages (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 13): a text with buttons, a card, a carousel; and an answer to a button ----
// The words of a text with its chips (a row that scrolls sideways on a phone, wrapping on a desktop), a card (its picture,
// title, words and buttons; at most 320 px, 85 % of a phone's width) or cards side by side (240 px each, scrolling with
// snap). A reply sends its words (replySuggestion), a link opens in a new tab, a call goes to the dialer. A reply is the
// other side's to tap on my own message and in a room with an outbound bridge (its buttons are the person's, on their phone).
const richTemplate = `
<div v-if="rich" class="m-chat-rich" :data-rich="rich.kind">
        <template v-if="rich.kind === 'text'">
            <div class="text-body2 m-chat-rich-text" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{rich.text}}</div>
            <div class="row q-mt-xs m-chat-chips" :class="room.mobile ? 'no-wrap scroll' : 'wrap'" style="gap:4px">
                <q-chip v-for="(one, index) in rich.suggestions || []" :key="index" dense outline color="primary" :icon="iconOf(one)"
                        :clickable="room.canTap(item, one)" class="q-ma-none m-chat-chip" :class="{ 'm-muted': !room.canTap(item, one) }" :data-suggestion="one.type"
                        :title="room.canTap(item, one) ? undefined : room.t('For the other person to tap')" @click.stop="room.canTap(item, one) && room.tapSuggestion(item, one, index, null)">
                    <span class="ellipsis">{{one.text}}</span></q-chip>
            </div>
        </template>
        <div v-else :class="rich.kind === 'carousel' ? 'row no-wrap scroll m-chat-carousel' : ''" :style="rich.kind === 'carousel' ? 'gap:8px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory' : ''">
            <q-card v-for="(card, cardIndex) in rich.cards || []" :key="cardIndex" flat bordered class="q-mt-xs m-chat-card" :style="cardStyle">
                <img v-if="imageOf(card)" :src="room.fileUrl(imageOf(card), true)" :alt="card.title || ''" class="cursor-pointer"
                        style="width:100%;max-height:200px;object-fit:cover;display:block" @load="room.imageLoaded()" @click.stop="room.preview(imageOf(card), item.attachments)">
                <div class="q-pa-sm">
                    <div v-if="card.title" class="text-weight-medium m-chat-card-title" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{card.title}}</div>
                    <div v-if="card.description" class="text-body2 m-chat-card-text" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{card.description}}</div>
                </div>
                <div v-if="card.suggestions && card.suggestions.length" class="column q-px-xs q-pb-xs">
                    <q-btn v-for="(one, index) in card.suggestions" :key="index" flat dense no-caps align="left" color="primary" :icon="iconOf(one)" :label="one.text"
                            :disable="!room.canTap(item, one)" :title="room.canTap(item, one) ? undefined : room.t('For the other person to tap')"
                            class="m-chat-card-btn" :data-suggestion="one.type" @click.stop="room.tapSuggestion(item, one, index, cardIndex)"></q-btn>
                </div>
            </q-card>
        </div>
</div>`;
const chatRich = {
    name: 'ChatRich',
    props: { item: Object, room: Object },
    computed: {
        rich() { const rich = this.item.event.rich; return rich && typeof rich === 'object' && ['text', 'card', 'carousel'].includes(rich.kind) ? rich : null; },
        cardStyle() { return this.rich && this.rich.kind === 'carousel' ? 'width:240px;min-width:240px;scroll-snap-align:start' : (this.room.mobile ? 'max-width:85vw' : 'max-width:320px'); }
    },
    methods: {
        iconOf(one) { return { reply: 'sym_o_reply', url: 'sym_o_open_in_new', dial: 'sym_o_call' }[one.type] || 'sym_o_touch_app'; },
        imageOf(card) {
            if (card.attachmentSeq == null) return null;
            const files = this.item.attachments || [];
            return files.find((file) => Number(file.attachmentSeq) === Number(card.attachmentSeq)) || files[Number(card.attachmentSeq) - 1] || null;
        }
    },
    template: richTemplate
};

// The composer's Card: a title, words, a picture and up to 4 buttons (a reply, a link, a call); with no title and no
// picture it is a text with buttons. It shows the text people without RCS get (moqui.chat.richFallback) as it is written.
const cardBoxTemplate = `
<m-dialog :model-value="true" :title="t('New card')" width="520" @update:model-value="(open) => { if (!open) $emit('close'); }">
    <m-text-line v-model="title" :name="'cardTitle' + uid" :label="t('Title (optional)')" maxlength="200"></m-text-line>
    <m-text-area v-model="text" :name="'cardText' + uid" :label="t('Text')" rows="3" autogrow class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-area>
    <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs">
        <q-btn flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_image" :label="image ? t('Change the picture') : t('Add a picture')" :loading="image && image.uploading" @click="$refs.picker.click()"></q-btn>
        <span v-if="image" class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis q-ml-sm">{{image.fileName}}</span>
        <q-btn v-if="image" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Remove the picture')" @click="image = null"></q-btn>
        <input ref="picker" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif" style="display:none" @change="pick">
    </div>
    <div v-for="(button, index) in buttons" :key="index" class="row no-wrap items-center q-mt-xs q-gutter-x-xs m-chat-card-box-button">
        <q-btn-toggle v-model="button.type" dense no-caps unelevated toggle-color="primary" :options="kinds"></q-btn-toggle>
        <div class="col"><m-text-line v-model="button.text" :name="'cardButton' + uid + '_' + index" :label="t('Words')" maxlength="20"></m-text-line></div>
        <div v-if="button.type !== 'reply'" class="col"><m-text-line v-model="button.value" :name="'cardValue' + uid + '_' + index"
                :label="button.type === 'url' ? t('Address (https://…)') : t('Number (+1…)')"></m-text-line></div>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Remove the button')" @click="buttons.splice(index, 1)"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <q-btn v-if="buttons.length < 4" flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_add" :label="t('Add a button')" class="q-mt-xs"
            @click="buttons.push({ type: 'reply', text: '', value: '' })"></q-btn>
    <div v-if="fallback" class="q-mt-sm text-caption m-muted m-chat-card-box-fallback">
        <div class="text-weight-medium">{{t('People without RCS get:')}}</div><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere">{{fallback}}</div></div>
    <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
        <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_send" :label="t('Send the card')" :disable="!ready" :loading="busy" @click="send"></q-btn>
        <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" @click="$emit('close')"></q-btn>
    </div>
</m-dialog>`;
const chatCardBox = {
    name: 'ChatCardBox',
    props: { room: Object, threadRoot: Number },
    emits: ['close'],
    data: () => ({ uid: Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8), title: '', text: '', image: null, buttons: [{ type: 'reply', text: '', value: '' }], busy: false }),
    computed: {
        kinds() { return [{ value: 'reply', icon: 'sym_o_reply', attrs: { 'aria-label': t('Reply') } }, { value: 'url', icon: 'sym_o_link', attrs: { 'aria-label': t('Link') } },
            { value: 'dial', icon: 'sym_o_call', attrs: { 'aria-label': t('Call') } }]; },
        suggestions() {
            return this.buttons.filter((button) => String(button.text || '').trim()).map((button) => {
                const text = String(button.text).trim();
                if (button.type === 'url') return { type: 'url', text, url: String(button.value || '').trim() };
                if (button.type === 'dial') return { type: 'dial', text, phone: String(button.value || '').replace(/[\s().-]/g, '') };
                // its postback is the server's: "user:" and its words
                return { type: 'reply', text };
            });
        },
        // a card with a title or a picture, else a text with buttons
        rich() {
            const words = String(this.text || '').trim();
            const title = String(this.title || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
            if (!title && !this.image) return { kind: 'text', text: words, suggestions: this.suggestions };
            const card = { suggestions: this.suggestions };
            if (title) card.title = title;
            if (words) card.description = words;
            if (this.image) card.attachmentSeq = 1;
            return { kind: 'card', cards: [card] };
        },
        fallback() { return moqui.chat && moqui.chat.richFallback ? moqui.chat.richFallback(this.rich).trim() : ''; },
        ready() {
            if (this.busy || (this.image && (this.image.uploading || !this.image.chatAttachmentId))) return false;
            const rich = this.rich;
            if (rich.kind === 'text') return !!rich.text && rich.suggestions.length > 0;
            // as the server's: a title or words, and one thing more (the other, a picture or a button)
            const card = rich.cards[0];
            return [card.title, card.description, card.attachmentSeq, card.suggestions.length].filter((one) => !!one).length >= 2;
        }
    },
    methods: {
        t,
        pick(event) {
            const file = event.target.files && event.target.files[0];
            event.target.value = '';
            if (!file) return;
            if (!/^image\/(png|jpe?g|gif)$/i.test(file.type || '')) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('A card\'s picture is a PNG, JPEG or GIF image') }]); return; }
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            const entry = { fileName: file.name, contentType: file.type, uploading: true, chatAttachmentId: null };
            this.image = entry;
            const form = new FormData();
            form.append('chatRoomId', this.room.roomId);
            form.append('file', file, file.name);
            if (moqui.sessionToken) form.append('moquiSessionToken', moqui.sessionToken);
            moqui.request(this.room.url('upload'), { method: 'POST', params: form }).then((result) => {
                const stored = ((result.json || {}).uploadList || [])[0];
                if (this.image !== entry) return;
                this.image = stored ? Object.assign({}, entry, stored, { uploading: false }) : null;
            }, (err) => { if (this.image === entry) this.image = null; moqui.handleAjaxError(err); });
        },
        send() {
            if (!this.ready) return;
            this.busy = true;
            this.room.sendRich(this.rich, this.image ? [this.image.chatAttachmentId] : [], this.threadRoot || null)
                .then((sent) => { this.busy = false; if (sent) this.$emit('close'); }, () => { this.busy = false; });
        }
    },
    template: cardBoxTemplate
};

// ---- a message being edited in place: Enter saves (as the composer sends), Esc cancels ----
const editTemplate = `
<div class="q-my-xs" @keydown.esc.stop="room.cancelEdit()">
    <m-rich-text ref="editor" v-model="body" :name="'chatEdit' + item.eventSeq" :label="room.t('Edit message')" light rows="1" autofocus :enter="room.prefs.enterSends === false ? 'newline' : 'submit'"
            :mention-url="room.url('mentionUsers')" :mention-parameters="{chatRoomId: room.roomId}" @submit="save"></m-rich-text>
    <div class="row items-center q-gutter-x-sm q-mt-xs">
        <q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" size="sm" :label="room.t('Save')" :loading="busy" @click="save"></q-btn>
        <q-btn dense flat no-caps size="sm" :label="room.t('Cancel')" @click="room.cancelEdit()"></q-btn>
        <span class="text-caption m-muted">{{room.t('Esc to cancel')}}</span>
    </div>
</div>`;

// ---- the composer of the room or of a thread ----
const composerTemplate = `
<div class="m-chat-composer" @keydown.capture="onKeydown" @paste="onPaste">
    <!-- the room's scheduled messages (Comms-Messaging phase 15): a line that opens their list -->
    <div v-if="!threadRoot && room.scheduledLineText" class="row items-center no-wrap q-pl-sm q-mb-xs text-caption cursor-pointer m-chat-scheduled-bar"
            role="button" tabindex="0" @click="room.openScheduled()" @keydown.enter="room.openScheduled()">
        <q-icon name="sym_o_schedule_send" size="16px" class="q-mr-xs text-primary"></q-icon>
        <span class="ellipsis">{{room.scheduledLineText}}</span>
        <span v-if="room.scheduledLine.failed" class="text-negative q-ml-sm text-no-wrap">{{room.scheduledFailedText}}</span>
    </div>
    <div v-if="!threadRoot && room.replyTo" class="row items-center no-wrap q-pl-sm q-mb-xs text-caption rounded-borders">
        <div class="self-stretch bg-primary" style="width:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
        <q-icon name="sym_o_reply" size="16px" class="q-mx-xs text-primary"></q-icon>
        <span class="ellipsis col">{{room.t('Replying to')}} <span class="text-weight-medium">{{room.replyTo.senderName}}</span>: {{room.replyTo.snippet}}</span>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="room.t('Cancel the reply')" @click="room.cancelReply()"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <div v-if="files.length" class="row q-mb-xs">
        <q-chip v-for="file in files" :key="file.key" dense square removable class="m-tonal q-ml-none q-mr-xs" :icon="file.uploading ? undefined : room.fileIcon(file)"
                @remove="removeFile(file)"><q-spinner v-if="file.uploading" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-spinner>
            <span class="ellipsis" style="max-width:180px">{{file.fileName}}</span></q-chip>
        <!-- one photo or video may go view-once (phase 16): opened once by each person, then gone -->
        <q-toggle v-if="canViewOnce" v-model="viewOnce" dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_looks_one" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-view-once-toggle" :label="room.t('View once')"></q-toggle>
        <span v-if="viewOnce && canViewOnce && !isEmptyHtml(body)" class="text-caption text-warning q-ml-xs self-center">{{room.t('A view-once photo has no text')}}</span>
    </div>
    <m-rich-text ref="editor" v-model="body" :name="'chatBody' + uid" light rows="1" :enter="room.prefs.enterSends === false ? 'newline' : 'submit'"
            :label="editorLabel" :placeholder="placeholder" :mention-url="room.url('mentionUsers')" :mention-parameters="{chatRoomId: room.roomId}" @submit="send"></m-rich-text>
    <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-xs m-chat-composer-actions">
        <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_attach_file" class="m-chat-attach" :aria-label="room.t('Attach files')" :disable="room.offline" @click="attachClick">
            <q-tooltip>{{room.offline ? room.t('Files go up when you are back online') : room.t('Attach files')}}</q-tooltip>
            <!-- on a phone (bubbles): the camera, the gallery or a file -->
            <q-menu v-if="room.phoneAttach" anchor="top left" self="bottom left"><q-list class="m-chat-attach-menu" style="min-width:200px">
                <q-item clickable v-close-popup data-attach="camera" @click="pickNative('camera')"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_photo_camera"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section>{{room.t('Camera')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                <q-item clickable v-close-popup data-attach="gallery" @click="pickNative('gallery')"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_photo_library"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section>{{room.t('Photos and videos')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                <q-item clickable v-close-popup data-attach="file" @click="pickFiles"><q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_draft"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section>{{room.t('File')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
            </q-list></q-menu></q-btn>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_mood" :aria-label="room.t('Emoji')"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Emoji')}}</q-tooltip>
            <q-menu ref="emojiMenu" anchor="top left" self="bottom left" class="m-chat-emoji-menu">
                <m-emoji-picker :user-id="room.me.userId || ''" :autofocus="!room.mobile" @pick="(key) => { $refs.emojiMenu.hide(); insert(key); }"></m-emoji-picker>
            </q-menu>
        </q-btn>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_alternate_email" class="m-chat-mention-btn" :aria-label="room.t('Mention someone')" @click="insert('@')"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Mention someone')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        <q-btn v-if="!room.sealed" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_ballot" :aria-label="room.t('Make a poll')" :disable="room.offline" @click="room.openPoll(threadRoot || null, '')">
            <q-tooltip>{{room.t('Make a poll')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        <q-btn v-if="!room.sealed" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_view_agenda" class="m-chat-card-btn-open" :aria-label="room.t('Make a card')" :disable="room.offline"
                @click="room.openCard(threadRoot || null)"><q-tooltip>{{room.t('Make a card with buttons')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        <span class="text-caption m-muted q-ml-sm ellipsis gt-xs" v-if="!room.compact && !threadRoot">{{hint}}</span>
        <q-space></q-space>
        <!-- a voice note (Comms-Messaging §5.1): with no text, Send is the microphone; recording shows its time, Cancel and Send -->
        <div v-if="voice" class="row items-center no-wrap q-gutter-x-xs m-chat-recording" role="status">
            <span class="m-chat-recording-dot" style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--q-negative)"></span>
            <span class="text-caption text-weight-medium m-chat-recording-time" style="min-width:40px">{{voiceTime}}</span>
            <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_delete" class="m-chat-voice-cancel" :aria-label="room.t('Cancel the voice note')" :disable="voice.stopping" @click="stopVoice(false)">
                <q-tooltip>{{room.t('Cancel the voice note')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn dense unelevated round color="primary" icon="sym_o_send" class="m-chat-voice-send" :aria-label="room.t('Send the voice note')" :loading="voice.stopping" @click="stopVoice(true)">
                <q-tooltip>{{room.t('Send the voice note')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        </div>
        <q-btn v-else-if="showVoice" dense unelevated round color="primary" icon="sym_o_mic" class="m-chat-voice" :aria-label="room.t('Record a voice note')" @click="startVoice">
            <q-tooltip>{{room.t('Record a voice note')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        <template v-else>
        <q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_send" class="m-chat-send" :label="room.useBubbles ? undefined : room.t('Send')" :aria-label="room.t('Send')"
                :disable="!canSend" :loading="sending" @click="send">
            <!-- Send later (Comms-Messaging phase 15): a long press on a phone, a right click on a desktop -->
            <q-menu context-menu class="m-chat-send-menu" @show="room.buzz()"><q-list style="min-width:220px"><q-item clickable v-close-popup :disable="!!laterOff" class="m-chat-send-later" @click="sendLater">
                <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_schedule_send"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section><q-item-label>{{room.t('Send later…')}}</q-item-label><q-item-label v-if="laterOff" caption>{{laterOff}}</q-item-label></q-item-section></q-item></q-list></q-menu></q-btn>
        <q-btn v-if="!room.useBubbles" dense unelevated color="primary" icon="sym_o_expand_more" class="m-chat-send-more" :aria-label="room.t('More ways to send')"
                style="min-width:22px;padding:0 1px;margin-left:1px" :disable="sending">
            <q-tooltip>{{room.t('More ways to send')}}</q-tooltip>
            <q-menu anchor="top right" self="bottom right"><q-list style="min-width:220px"><q-item clickable v-close-popup :disable="!!laterOff" class="m-chat-send-later" @click="sendLater">
                <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_schedule_send"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section><q-item-label>{{room.t('Send later…')}}</q-item-label><q-item-label v-if="laterOff" caption>{{laterOff}}</q-item-label></q-item-section></q-item></q-list></q-menu></q-btn>
        </template>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden"><m-file ref="picker" v-model="picked" :name="'chatFile' + uid" multiple @update:model-value="onPicked"></m-file>
        <input ref="camera" type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment" :name="'chatCamera' + uid" @change="onNative">
        <input ref="gallery" type="file" accept="image/*,video/*" multiple :name="'chatGallery' + uid" @change="onNative"></div>
</div>`;

let composerCount = 0;
// the longest voice note: it is sent when it reaches this
const VOICE_MAX_MS = 10 * 60 * 1000;
let voiceCount = 0;
const chatComposer = {
    name: 'ChatComposer',
    props: { room: Object, threadRoot: [Number, String], placeholder: String },
    data() {
        composerCount += 1;
        return { uid: composerCount, body: '', files: [], picked: null, sending: false, draftTimer: null, voice: null, voiceNow: 0, voiceStarting: false, viewOnce: false };
    },
    computed: {
        draftKey() { return draftPrefix() + this.room.roomId + (this.threadRoot ? ':' + this.threadRoot : ''); },
        editorLabel() { return this.threadRoot ? t('Reply in the thread') : fill(t('Message {name}'), { name: this.room.displayName }); },
        uploading() { return this.files.some((file) => file.uploading); },
        canSend() { return !this.sending && !this.uploading && (!isEmptyHtml(this.body) || this.files.some((file) => file.chatAttachmentId))
            && !(this.viewOnce && this.canViewOnce && !isEmptyHtml(this.body)); },
        // one photo or video waiting, in a room that is not bridged (phase 16)
        canViewOnce() {
            return this.files.length === 1 && /^(image|video)\//i.test(String(this.files[0].contentType || '')) && !this.room.timerBlocked && !this.threadRoot;
        },
        // the microphone in place of Send: no text and no file, online, and a browser that records sound
        showVoice() {
            return !this.sending && !this.voiceStarting && !this.files.length && isEmptyHtml(this.body) && !this.room.offline && typeof window.MediaRecorder === 'function'
                && !!(navigator.mediaDevices && navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia);
        },
        voiceTime() {
            const seconds = this.voice ? Math.max(0, Math.floor((this.voiceNow - this.voice.start) / 1000)) : 0;
            return Math.floor(seconds / 60) + ':' + String(seconds % 60).padStart(2, '0');
        },
        hint() {
            return this.room.prefs.enterSends === false ? t('Ctrl+Enter to send') : t('Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a new line');
        },
        // why Send later cannot be used now (it shows disabled with this), or null
        laterOff() {
            if (this.room.offline) return t('Send later needs a connection');
            if (this.uploading) return t('Wait for the files to finish uploading');
            if (!this.canSend) return t('Write a message first');
            if (this.room.sealed && this.files.length) return t('In an encrypted room a message with files is sent now');
            if (this.room.sealed && !(moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId())) return t('This browser has no encryption device yet');
            return null;
        }
    },
    watch: {
        body(value) {
            if (!isEmptyHtml(value)) this.room.typingNow();
            clearTimeout(this.draftTimer);
            this.draftTimer = setTimeout(() => this.saveDraft(), 400);
        }
    },
    methods: {
        t,
        isEmptyHtml,
        saveDraft() {
            const has = !isEmptyHtml(this.body);
            // an encrypted room's draft stays in this page, never in the browser's storage (C7)
            if (this.room.sealed) { sealedDrafts[this.draftKey] = has ? this.body : null; storage.set(this.draftKey, null); return; }
            storage.set(this.draftKey, has ? this.body : null);
            window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('boss-chat-draft', { detail: { chatRoomId: this.room.roomId } }));
        },
        focus() {
            const editor = this.$refs.editor && this.$refs.editor.editor;
            if (editor) editor.commands.focus('end');
        },
        insert(text) {
            const editor = this.$refs.editor && this.$refs.editor.editor;
            if (editor) editor.chain().focus().insertContent(text).run();
            else this.body = (this.body || '') + text;
        },
        onKeydown(event) {
            if (event.isComposing) return;
            const editorVm = this.$refs.editor;
            const mentionOpen = editorVm && editorVm.mention && editorVm.mention.open;
            if (event.key === 'ArrowUp' && !event.shiftKey && !event.altKey && !event.ctrlKey && !event.metaKey && !mentionOpen && !this.threadRoot
                    && isEmptyHtml(this.body) && !this.files.length) {
                if (this.room.editLast()) { event.preventDefault(); event.stopPropagation(); }
            } else if (event.key === 'Escape' && !mentionOpen) {
                if (!this.threadRoot && this.room.replyTo) { this.room.cancelReply(); event.stopPropagation(); }
            }
        },
        send() {
            // Enter while a voice note records sends nothing: the text waits for its own Send
            if (this.voice || this.voiceStarting) return;
            if (this.uploading) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('Wait for the files to finish uploading') }]); return; }
            if (!this.canSend) return;
            const text = plainOf(this.body);
            const command = /^\/(task|request|event|poll)\b\s*([\s\S]*)$/.exec(text);
            if (command && !this.files.length) {
                if (command[1] === 'poll') this.room.openPoll(this.threadRoot || null, command[2].trim());
                else this.room.quickCreateText(command[1], command[2].trim());
                this.clear();
                return;
            }
            const body = this.body;
            const ids = this.files.filter((file) => file.chatAttachmentId).map((file) => file.chatAttachmentId);
            const files = this.files;
            const viewOnce = this.viewOnce && this.canViewOnce;
            this.sending = true;
            this.clear();
            this.viewOnce = false;
            this.room.sendMessage({ body: isEmptyHtml(body) ? '' : body, attachmentIds: ids, files: files.filter((file) => file.chatAttachmentId),
                threadRoot: this.threadRoot || null, viewOnce }).then(() => {
                this.sending = false;
                this.$nextTick(() => this.focus());
            }, () => {
                // nothing sent: the text and files come back
                this.sending = false;
                this.body = body;
                this.files = files;
            });
        },
        // Send later (Comms-Messaging phase 15): the room asks when and schedules it; the composer is cleared once it is
        sendLater() {
            if (this.laterOff || this.voice || this.voiceStarting) return;
            const ids = this.files.filter((file) => file.chatAttachmentId).map((file) => file.chatAttachmentId);
            this.room.openSendLater({ body: isEmptyHtml(this.body) ? '' : this.body, attachmentIds: ids, threadRoot: this.threadRoot || null }, () => this.clear());
        },
        clear() {
            this.body = '';
            this.files = [];
            storage.set(this.draftKey, null);
            sealedDrafts[this.draftKey] = null;
            window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('boss-chat-draft', { detail: { chatRoomId: this.room.roomId } }));
            this.room.typingStop();
        },
        pickFiles() {
            const input = this.$refs.picker && this.$refs.picker.$el && this.$refs.picker.$el.querySelector('input[type=file]');
            if (input) input.click();
        },
        // the attach button: the file picker, or on a phone its menu (camera, gallery, file)
        attachClick() { if (!this.room.phoneAttach) this.pickFiles(); },
        pickNative(kind) { const input = this.$refs[kind]; if (input) input.click(); },
        onNative(event) {
            const list = Array.from((event.target && event.target.files) || []);
            if (event.target) event.target.value = '';
            if (list.length) this.upload(list);
        },
        onPicked(files) {
            const list = Array.isArray(files) ? files : (files ? [files] : []);
            this.picked = null;
            if (list.length) this.upload(list);
        },
        onPaste(event) {
            const list = Array.from((event.clipboardData && event.clipboardData.files) || []);
            if (!list.length) return;
            event.preventDefault();
            this.upload(list);
        },
        // ---- a voice note: recorded here (MediaRecorder), sent as an audio file through the upload, encrypted in an
        // encrypted room as any file; at most VOICE_MAX_MS, then it is sent ----
        // one at a time: a second tap while the browser asks for the microphone does nothing, and a microphone that comes
        // after the composer went (the room left during the prompt) or was cancelled is closed at once, never recorded
        startVoice() {
            if (this.voice || this.voiceStarting || this.gone || needsConnection()) return;
            this.voiceStarting = true;
            const asked = ++voiceCount;
            this.voiceAsked = asked;
            navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true }).then((stream) => {
                const close = () => stream.getTracks().forEach((track) => track.stop());
                if (this.gone || this.voice || this.voiceAsked !== asked) { close(); return; }
                this.voiceStarting = false;
                try {
                    const supported = (type) => !window.MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported || window.MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(type);
                    const type = ['audio/webm;codecs=opus', 'audio/ogg;codecs=opus', 'audio/mp4'].find(supported);
                    const recorder = new window.MediaRecorder(stream, type ? { mimeType: type } : undefined);
                    // compared by its id: this.voice is Vue's proxy of it
                    const voice = { id: asked, recorder, stream, chunks: [], start: Date.now(), send: false, stopping: false, timer: null };
                    recorder.ondataavailable = (event) => { if (event.data && event.data.size) voice.chunks.push(event.data); };
                    recorder.onstop = () => this.voiceStopped(voice);
                    this.voice = voice;
                    this.voiceNow = voice.start;
                    // the cap is the recording's own time, however often the timer runs (a page in the background)
                    voice.timer = setInterval(() => {
                        this.voiceNow = Date.now();
                        if (Date.now() - voice.start >= VOICE_MAX_MS && this.voice && this.voice.id === voice.id) this.stopVoice(true);
                    }, 250);
                    recorder.start(1000);
                } catch (err) {
                    close();
                    this.voice = null;
                    moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This browser could not record a voice note') }]);
                }
            }, () => {
                if (this.voiceAsked !== asked) return;
                this.voiceStarting = false;
                if (!this.gone) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('The microphone could not be opened: allow it for this site to record a voice note') }]);
            });
        },
        stopVoice(send) {
            // a microphone still asked for is dropped when it comes
            if (this.voiceStarting) { this.voiceStarting = false; this.voiceAsked = null; }
            const voice = this.voice;
            if (!voice || voice.stopping) return;
            voice.send = !!send;
            voice.stopping = true;
            clearInterval(voice.timer);
            if (voice.recorder.state === 'inactive') this.voiceStopped(voice);
            else voice.recorder.stop();
        },
        voiceStopped(voice) {
            clearInterval(voice.timer);
            voice.stream.getTracks().forEach((track) => track.stop());
            if (this.voice && this.voice.id === voice.id) this.voice = null;
            // sent only by its Send (or the cap) while the composer is there
            if (!voice.send || !voice.chunks.length || this.gone) return;
            // the type without its codecs, and a name with its extension, so the file plays where it is opened
            const type = String(voice.recorder.mimeType || voice.chunks[0].type || 'audio/webm').split(';')[0].trim() || 'audio/webm';
            const ext = { 'audio/webm': 'webm', 'audio/ogg': 'ogg', 'audio/mp4': 'm4a', 'audio/mpeg': 'mp3' }[type] || 'webm';
            const stamp = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 19).replace('T', ' ').replace(/:/g, '.');
            const file = new File([new Blob(voice.chunks, { type })], fill(t('Voice note {when}'), { when: stamp }) + '.' + ext, { type });
            // the voice note goes alone: text typed meanwhile and other files stay in the composer
            this.upload([file]).then(([stored]) => {
                if (!stored || !stored.chatAttachmentId) return;
                this.files = this.files.filter((one) => one.key !== stored.key);
                return this.room.sendMessage({ body: '', attachmentIds: [stored.chatAttachmentId], files: [stored], threadRoot: this.threadRoot || null });
            }).catch(() => moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('The voice note was not sent') }]));
        },
        // each file goes up at once (upload#ChatFiles); the message names them when it is sent. Not offline: a file waits
        // for no one, and the outbox keeps only text. Resolves when all are up (or failed)
        upload(list) {
            if (this.room.offline) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('Files go up when you are back online') }]); return Promise.resolve(); }
            return Promise.all(list.map((file) => {
                const entry = { key: 'f' + Date.now() + Math.random(), fileName: file.name, contentType: file.type, fileSize: file.size, uploading: true, chatAttachmentId: null };
                this.files.push(entry);
                // an encrypted room's file goes up encrypted, named encrypted; its name, type and key go in the message (C7)
                const sealing = this.room.sealed ? moqui.chat.sealFile(file) : Promise.resolve(null);
                return sealing.then((sealed) => {
                    if (sealed) entry.info = sealed.info;
                    const form = new FormData();
                    form.append('chatRoomId', this.room.roomId);
                    form.append('file', sealed ? sealed.blob : file, sealed ? 'encrypted' : file.name);
                    if (moqui.sessionToken) form.append('moquiSessionToken', moqui.sessionToken);
                    return moqui.request(this.room.url('upload'), { method: 'POST', params: form });
                }).then((result) => {
                    const json = result.json || {};
                    const stored = (json.uploadList || [])[0];
                    if (json.messageInfos && json.messageInfos.length) moqui.notifyMessages(json.messageInfos);
                    const index = this.files.indexOf(entry);
                    if (index < 0) return;
                    if (!stored) { this.files.splice(index, 1); return null; }
                    const done = Object.assign({}, entry, stored, this.room.sealed ? { fileName: entry.fileName, contentType: entry.contentType,
                        fileSize: entry.fileSize } : {}, { uploading: false });
                    this.files.splice(index, 1, done);
                    return done;
                }, (err) => {
                    const index = this.files.indexOf(entry);
                    if (index >= 0) this.files.splice(index, 1);
                    moqui.handleAjaxError(err);
                    return null;
                });
            }));
        },
        removeFile(file) { this.files = this.files.filter((item) => item !== file); }
    },
    mounted() {
        const saved = this.room.sealed ? sealedDrafts[this.draftKey] : storage.get(this.draftKey);
        if (saved) this.body = saved;
        // the desktop client's drafts, once read
        else if (!this.room.sealed) moqui.drafts.ready().then(() => { const later = storage.get(this.draftKey); if (later && isEmptyHtml(this.body)) this.body = later; });
        this.room.registerComposer(this, this.threadRoot);
    },
    beforeUnmount() {
        clearTimeout(this.draftTimer);
        this.gone = true;
        this.stopVoice(false);
        this.saveDraft();
        this.room.unregisterComposer(this, this.threadRoot);
    },
    template: composerTemplate
};

const chatEdit = {
    name: 'ChatEdit',
    props: { room: Object, item: Object },
    data() { return { body: this.room.editing ? this.room.editing.body : '', busy: false }; },
    methods: {
        save() {
            if (this.busy) return;
            if (isEmptyHtml(this.body)) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('Delete the message to remove its text') }]); return; }
            this.busy = true;
            this.room.saveEdit(this.item, this.body).then(() => { this.busy = false; }, () => { this.busy = false; });
        }
    },
    template: editTemplate
};

// ---- a message's actions, one list (Comms-Messaging §4, COM-UI-035): the phone's sheet, the More menu of the hover toolbar
// and the right-click menu. With reactions, the quick reactions and "+" first, which opens the emoji picker in their place.
// done: an action was taken, so the sheet or menu closes ----
const menuTemplate = `
<div class="m-chat-actions" :data-seq="item.eventSeq">
    <div v-if="reactions && !picking && room.canPost && room.bridgeCaps.reaction" class="row no-wrap items-center justify-between q-px-sm q-pt-sm m-chat-quick">
        <q-btn v-for="key in room.quickReactions" :key="key" flat dense class="m-chat-sheet-emoji" :style="dense ? 'flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;font-size:18px;padding:2px 0' : 'flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;font-size:22px;padding:6px 0'"
                :label="key" :aria-label="room.t('React with') + ' ' + key" @click="act(() => room.react(item, key))"></q-btn>
        <q-btn flat dense icon="sym_o_add_reaction" style="flex:1 1 0;min-width:0" :aria-label="room.t('More reactions')" class="m-chat-more-reactions" @click="picking = true"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <!-- on a phone the search line waits for a tap, so the keyboard does not cover the sheet -->
    <m-emoji-picker v-if="picking" :user-id="room.me.userId || ''" :autofocus="!room.mobile" class="q-mx-auto" @pick="(key) => act(() => room.react(item, key))"></m-emoji-picker>
    <q-list v-else :dense="dense" :class="dense ? '' : 'q-pb-sm'">
        <template v-for="action in room.messageActions(item, inThread)" :key="action.key">
            <q-separator v-if="action.separator"></q-separator>
            <!-- what an app adds to a message (ext-action slot chat-message-actions; IronStone: create a task, request or event) -->
            <m-ext-actions v-else-if="action.key === 'apps'" slot="chat-message-actions" :item="{ chatRoomId: room.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq }" @done="$emit('done')"></m-ext-actions>
            <q-item v-else clickable :data-action="action.key" @click="act(action.run)">
                <q-item-section avatar><q-icon :name="action.icon" :color="action.negative ? 'negative' : undefined"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section :class="action.negative ? 'text-negative' : ''">{{action.label}}</q-item-section></q-item>
        </template>
    </q-list>
</div>`;
const chatMessageMenu = {
    name: 'ChatMessageMenu',
    props: { item: Object, room: Object, inThread: Boolean, reactions: Boolean, dense: Boolean },
    emits: ['done'],
    data: () => ({ picking: false }),
    methods: {
        act(run) { this.$emit('done'); run(); }
    },
    template: menuTemplate
};

const chatMessage = {
    name: 'ChatMessage',
    props: { item: Object, room: Object, inThread: Boolean },
    components: { 'chat-edit': chatEdit, 'chat-message-menu': chatMessageMenu, 'chat-rich': chatRich },
    data: () => ({ actionFocus: false, reactionMenu: false, moreMenu: false, contextOpen: false }),
    watch: {
        actionsAvailable(value) {
            // Editing or redaction removes the toolbar and can unmount a menu before it emits hide.
            if (!value) { this.actionFocus = false; this.reactionMenu = false; this.moreMenu = false; this.contextOpen = false; }
        }
    },
    methods: {
        // a right click: with bubbles (a phone) the sheet; on a row the menu at the pointer, but the browser's own menu on a
        // link, a picture, a video or a sound, in an editor or on text selected in this message, so their Copy, Save and
        // Open stay. A reaction chip's or poll option's (Android's long press there) is theirs: who reacted or voted.
        contextMenu(event) {
            if (this.room.pressGuard(event)) return;
            if (this.room.useBubbles) { this.room.contextMenu(this.item, this.inThread, event); return; }
            if (!this.actionsAvailable) return;
            const target = event.target;
            if (target && target.closest && target.closest('a[href], img, video, audio, input, textarea, [contenteditable="true"], [contenteditable=""], .q-menu')) return;
            const selection = window.getSelection ? window.getSelection() : null;
            if (selection && String(selection).trim() && ((selection.anchorNode && this.$el.contains(selection.anchorNode))
                || (selection.focusNode && this.$el.contains(selection.focusNode)))) return;
            event.preventDefault();
            this.contextOpen = true;
            this.$nextTick(() => { if (this.$refs.contextMenu) this.$refs.contextMenu.show(event); });
        },
        picked(key) { this.hide('reactMenu'); this.room.react(this.item, key); },
        hide(ref) { const menu = this.$refs[ref]; if (menu && menu.hide) menu.hide(); }
    },
    computed: {
        actionsAvailable() { return !this.item.redacted && !this.room.isEditing(this.item) && this.room.state === 'ready'; },
        // Quasar menus are teleported outside the row; retain their toolbar until hide restores focus to its button.
        actionsVisible() { return this.actionsAvailable && (this.actionFocus || this.reactionMenu || this.moreMenu || this.room.showActions(this.item, this.inThread)); },
        messageLabel() { return fill(t('Message from {name}'), { name: this.item.senderName }) + (this.item.fullTime ? ', ' + this.item.fullTime : ''); }
    },
    template: messageTemplate
};

// ---- the room view: header, timeline, composer and the side pane (thread, members, pinned, search, record); the Chat screen
// and the tray's Chat tab (compact) both show it ----
const roomTemplate = `
<div class="column no-wrap relative-position" :class="useBubbles ? 'm-chat-phone' : ''" style="height:100%;min-height:0" @dragover.prevent="onDragOver" @dragleave.self="dragOver = false" @drop.prevent="onDrop">
    <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-px-sm q-py-xs" style="min-height:52px">
        <q-btn v-if="canGoBack" flat round dense icon="sym_o_arrow_back" :aria-label="t('Back to chats')" class="q-mr-xs m-chat-back" @click="$emit('back')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Back to chats')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
        <template v-if="room">
            <m-avatar v-if="isDirect && room.otherUserId" :name="displayName" :user-id="room.otherUserId" size="34px"></m-avatar>
            <q-avatar v-else size="34px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="roomIcon"></q-avatar>
            <div class="col q-ml-sm" style="min-width:0">
                <div class="row items-center no-wrap">
                    <span class="text-subtitle1 text-weight-medium ellipsis" :title="displayName">{{displayName}}</span>
                    <q-icon v-if="member && member.isPinned" name="sym_o_keep" size="14px" class="q-ml-xs m-muted"><q-tooltip>{{t('Pinned to the top of my rooms')}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                    <q-icon v-if="member && (member.isMuted || member.notificationLevelEnumId === 'CnlNone')" name="sym_o_notifications_off" size="14px" class="q-ml-xs m-muted">
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Muted')}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                    <q-chip v-if="room.archivedDate" dense square class="m-tonal text-warning q-ml-xs">{{t('Archived')}}</q-chip>
                    <!-- the room's E2EE label (moqui.chat.e2eeLabel): the lock for end to end only, else the open lock (COM-UI-001) -->
                    <q-chip v-if="label.lock" dense square icon="sym_o_lock" class="m-tonal text-positive q-ml-xs m-chat-encrypted" :data-e2ee="label.state">{{t('Encrypted')}}
                        <q-icon v-if="label.verified" name="sym_o_check" size="14px" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-verified"></q-icon>
                        <q-tooltip>{{label.text}}. {{t('Search, link previews, agents, polls, bridges, forwards and filing on records are off here.')}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                    <q-icon v-else name="sym_o_lock_open" size="16px" class="q-ml-xs m-muted m-chat-not-e2ee" :data-e2ee="label.state" :aria-label="label.text">
                        <q-tooltip>{{label.text}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                    <q-icon v-if="label.badge" :name="label.badge" size="16px" class="q-ml-xs text-info m-chat-e2ee-badge" :aria-label="label.text">
                        <q-tooltip>{{label.text}}</q-tooltip></q-icon>
                    <q-chip v-if="room.bridged" dense square icon="sym_o_hub" class="m-tonal text-info q-ml-xs m-chat-bridged">{{bridgeNames}}
                        <q-tooltip>{{bridgeTooltip}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                    <q-chip v-if="timerSeconds" dense square clickable icon="sym_o_timer" class="m-tonal q-ml-xs m-chat-timer" :aria-label="t('Disappearing messages')" @click="openTimer">{{timerShort}}
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Disappearing messages')}}: {{timerLabel}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                    <q-chip v-if="room.notConnected" dense square icon="sym_o_link_off" class="m-tonal text-warning q-ml-xs m-chat-not-connected">{{t('Not connected')}}
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Messages stay here and go out once it is back')}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                </div>
                <div class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis">
                    <template v-if="isDirect && room.otherUserId"><span class="m-status-dot q-mr-xs" style="width:8px;height:8px" :class="'m-presence-' + (presenceOf(room.otherUserId) || 'offline')"></span>{{presenceText(room.otherUserId)}}</template>
                    <template v-else-if="room.record"><a v-if="room.record.url" href="#" class="text-primary" @click.prevent="go(room.record.url)">{{recordLabel}}</a><span v-else>{{recordLabel}}</span><span v-if="room.topic && room.topic !== recordLabel"> · {{room.topic}}</span></template>
                    <template v-else>{{room.topic || roomKindText}}</template>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div v-if="!isDirect && !narrow" class="row no-wrap items-center cursor-pointer q-mx-xs" @click="openSide('members')">
                <m-avatar v-for="person in members.slice(0, 4)" :key="person.userId || person.chatActorId" :name="person.name" :user-id="person.userId || undefined" size="24px" class="q-ml-xs"></m-avatar>
                <span class="text-caption m-muted q-ml-xs">{{members.length}}</span><q-tooltip>{{t('Members')}}</q-tooltip>
            </div>
            <q-btn v-if="access.canJoin" dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Join')" class="q-mx-xs" @click="join"></q-btn>
            <!-- a voice call and a video call (Comms-Messaging §8.3 item 1); in the tray's narrow Chat tab they are in the room's menu -->
            <template v-if="canCall && !compact">
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_call" class="m-chat-voice-call" :aria-label="t('Voice call')" @click="startCall(false)"><q-tooltip>{{callTip(false)}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_videocam" class="m-chat-video-call" :aria-label="t('Video call')" @click="startCall(true)"><q-tooltip>{{callTip(true)}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            </template>
            <q-btn v-if="!narrow" flat round dense icon="sym_o_search" :aria-label="t('Search in the room')" @click="openSide('search')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Search in the room')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn v-if="!narrow" flat round dense icon="sym_o_keep" :aria-label="t('Pinned messages')" @click="openSide('pinned')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Pinned messages')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn v-if="!narrow" flat round dense icon="sym_o_forum" :aria-label="t('Threads')" @click="openSide('threads')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Threads')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn v-if="!narrow" flat round dense icon="sym_o_perm_media" class="m-chat-details-btn" :aria-label="t('Media, files and links')" @click="openSide('media')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Media, files and links')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn v-if="compact && !bubbles" flat round dense icon="sym_o_open_in_new" :aria-label="t('Open in Chat')" @click="openInChat"><q-tooltip>{{t('Open in Chat')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_more_vert" :aria-label="t('Room')"><q-tooltip>{{t('Room')}}</q-tooltip>
                <q-menu anchor="bottom right" self="top right"><q-list dense style="min-width:250px">
                    <template v-if="isMember">
                        <q-item-label header class="q-py-xs">{{t('Notify me of')}}</q-item-label>
                        <q-item v-for="level in levels" :key="level.value" clickable v-close-popup :active="(member && member.notificationLevelEnumId || 'CnlAll') === level.value" @click="setLevel(level.value)">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon :name="level.icon"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t(level.label)}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="toggleMute">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon :name="member && member.isMuted ? 'sym_o_volume_up' : 'sym_o_volume_off'"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{member && member.isMuted ? t('Unmute') : t('Mute')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="togglePin">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_keep"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{member && member.isPinned ? t('Unpin from my rooms') : t('Pin to the top of my rooms')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="toggleArchive">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon :name="archivedByMe ? 'sym_o_unarchive' : 'sym_o_archive'"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>{{archivedByMe ? t('Unarchive') : t('Archive')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="markRead(true)">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_done_all"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Mark as read')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <template v-if="block && block.blockKind">
                            <q-item clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-block-item" @click="blockAction(filtered === 'blocked' ? 'unblockRoom' : 'blockRoom')">
                                <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_block"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                                <q-item-section>{{filtered === 'blocked' ? t('Unblock') : blockLabel}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                            <q-item v-if="block.blockKind !== 'person' && filtered !== 'blocked'" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-report-item" @click="blockAction('reportSpam')">
                                <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_report"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Report spam')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        </template>
                        <q-separator></q-separator>
                    </template>
                    <template v-if="canCall && compact">
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="startCall(false)">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_call"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Voice call')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="startCall(true)">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_videocam"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Video call')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    </template>
                    <q-item v-if="!isDirect" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSide('members')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_group"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Members')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="narrow" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSide('pinned')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_keep"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Pinned messages')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="narrow" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSide('search')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_search"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Search in the room')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="narrow" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSide('threads')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_forum"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Threads')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="narrow" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-details-item" @click="openSide('media')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_perm_media"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Media, files and links')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="room.record" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSide('record')">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon :name="room.record.icon || 'sym_o_description'"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('The record')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="canModerate" clickable v-close-popup @click="openSettings">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_settings"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Room settings')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="isMember" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-timer-item" @click="openTimer">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_timer"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Disappearing messages')}}</q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section side class="text-caption">{{timerLabel}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="inviteOffered" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-invites-item" @click="openInvites">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_qr_code_2"></q-icon></q-item-section><q-item-section>{{t('Invite links')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="canModerate && joinUi.count > 0" clickable v-close-popup @click="joinUi.requests = true">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_person_add"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section>{{fill(t('Join requests ({count})'), { count: joinUi.count })}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <!-- a plain direct chat: its encrypted chat with the same people (Comms-Messaging §6.5) -->
                    <q-item v-if="encryptOffered" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-start-encrypted-item" @click="startEncrypted">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_lock"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section>{{encryptedSibling ? t('Open the encrypted chat') : t('Start an encrypted chat')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    <template v-if="isMember">
                        <q-separator></q-separator>
                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="leave">
                            <q-item-section avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_logout" color="negative"></q-icon></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section class="text-negative">{{isDirect ? t('Hide this conversation') : t('Leave the room')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    </template>
                </q-list></q-menu>
            </q-btn>
        </template>
    </div>
    <q-separator></q-separator>
    <!-- a new device (Comms-Messaging §6.5): Set up this device in the banner's place until it reads what came before it -->
    <div v-if="setupBar" class="row no-wrap items-center q-px-sm q-py-xs text-caption m-tonal text-warning m-chat-setup-bar" role="status">
        <q-icon name="sym_o_phonelink_lock" size="16px"></q-icon>
        <span class="col q-ml-xs">{{t('Set up this device to read messages sent before it was added.')}}</span>
        <q-btn unelevated dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-setup" :label="t('Set up')" @click="openSetup"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <div v-else-if="backupHint" class="row no-wrap items-center q-px-sm q-py-xs text-caption m-tonal m-chat-backup-hint">
        <q-icon name="sym_o_key" size="16px" class="m-muted"></q-icon>
        <span class="col q-ml-xs">{{t('Keep your encrypted messages if you lose this device: set up key backup.')}}</span>
        <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs" :label="t('Set up key backup')" @click="openDevices"></q-btn>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="xs" icon="sym_o_close" class="q-ml-xs" :aria-label="t('Close the note')" @click="closeBackupHint"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <!-- the room's E2EE banner (Comms-Messaging §6.2): what reads its messages, with Verify in an encrypted room not all verified -->
    <div v-else-if="room && label.banner && !bannerHidden" class="row no-wrap items-center q-px-sm q-py-xs text-caption m-tonal m-chat-e2ee-banner" :data-e2ee="label.state">
        <q-icon :name="label.icon" size="16px" :class="label.lock ? 'text-positive' : 'm-muted'"></q-icon>
        <q-icon v-if="label.verified" name="sym_o_check" size="12px" class="text-positive"></q-icon>
        <span class="col q-ml-xs m-chat-e2ee-banner-text">{{label.banner}}</span>
        <q-btn v-if="label.verify" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="q-ml-xs m-chat-verify" :label="t('Verify')" @click="verifySomeone()"></q-btn>
        <q-btn flat round dense size="xs" icon="sym_o_close" class="q-ml-xs" :aria-label="t('Close the note')" @click="closeBanner"></q-btn>
    </div>

    <div class="col row no-wrap" style="min-height:0">
        <!-- the timeline and the composer -->
        <div v-show="!sideOverlay || !side" class="col column no-wrap" style="min-width:0">
            <div v-if="state === 'loading'" class="col q-pa-md">
                <div v-for="n in 6" :key="n" class="row no-wrap q-gutter-x-sm q-mb-md">
                    <q-skeleton type="QAvatar" size="32px"></q-skeleton>
                    <div class="col"><q-skeleton type="text" width="30%"></q-skeleton><q-skeleton type="text"></q-skeleton></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div v-else-if="state === 'unreachable'" class="col column items-center justify-center q-pa-lg text-center m-muted m-chat-unreachable">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_cloud_off" size="48px"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-sm">{{t('This conversation is not kept on this device')}}</div>
                <div class="text-caption">{{t('It opens when the server can be reached.')}}</div>
            </div>
            <div v-else-if="state === 'missing'" class="col column items-center justify-center q-pa-lg text-center m-muted">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_block" size="48px"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-sm">{{t('This conversation is not available')}}</div>
                <div class="text-caption">{{t('It does not exist, or you are not in it.')}}</div>
            </div>
            <div v-else-if="cryptoElsewhere" class="col column items-center justify-center q-pa-lg text-center m-muted m-chat-crypto-elsewhere">
                <q-icon name="sym_o_lock" size="48px"></q-icon>
                <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-sm">{{t('Encrypted messages open in Chat')}}</div>
                <div class="text-caption">{{t('This app keeps the keys of encrypted rooms in its main window.')}}</div>
                <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_open_in_new" class="q-mt-md" :label="t('Open in Chat')" @click="openInShell"></q-btn>
            </div>
            <template v-else>
                <div class="col relative-position" style="min-height:0">
                    <div ref="scroller" class="absolute-full scroll q-pb-xs" @scroll="onScroll" @wheel.passive="anchor = null" @touchstart.passive="anchor = null">
                        <div v-if="hasMoreBefore" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                            <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :loading="loadingOlder" :label="t('Earlier messages')" @click="loadOlder"></q-btn></div>
                        <div v-else-if="gapBefore" class="text-center text-caption m-muted q-py-sm m-chat-gap" data-gap="before">
                            <q-icon name="sym_o_cloud_off" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('Older messages load when the server can be reached')}}</div>
                        <div v-else class="q-px-md q-pt-lg q-pb-sm">
                            <m-avatar v-if="isDirect && room.otherUserId" :name="displayName" :user-id="room.otherUserId" size="48px"></m-avatar>
                            <q-avatar v-else size="48px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="roomIcon"></q-avatar>
                            <div class="text-subtitle1 text-weight-medium q-mt-sm">{{displayName}}</div>
                            <div class="text-caption m-muted">{{startText}}</div>
                            <div v-if="label.banner" class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs m-chat-e2ee-intro"><q-icon :name="label.icon" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon><span class="m-chat-e2ee-intro-text">{{label.banner}}</span></div>
                            <!-- a plain direct chat's encrypted one, and an encrypted one's earlier plain chat (Comms-Messaging §6.5) -->
                            <q-btn v-if="encryptOffered" flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_lock" class="q-mt-xs m-chat-start-encrypted" :loading="encryptBusy"
                                    :label="encryptedSibling ? t('Open the encrypted chat') : t('Start an encrypted chat')" @click="startEncrypted"></q-btn>
                            <div v-if="plainSibling" class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs m-chat-earlier-plain">{{earlierText}}
                                <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('Open')" @click="go(linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(plainSibling))"></q-btn></div>
                        </div>
                        <template v-for="item in items" :key="item.key">
                            <div v-if="item.kind === 'day'" class="row items-center no-wrap q-my-sm q-px-sm">
                                <q-separator class="col"></q-separator><span class="text-caption text-weight-medium m-muted q-px-sm">{{item.label}}</span><q-separator class="col"></q-separator></div>
                            <div v-else-if="item.kind === 'unread'" :id="domId('unread', false)" class="row items-center no-wrap q-my-xs q-px-sm text-negative">
                                <q-separator class="col" color="negative"></q-separator><span class="text-caption text-weight-medium q-px-sm">{{t('New messages')}}</span></div>
                            <div v-else-if="item.kind === 'system'" class="text-center text-caption m-muted q-py-xs q-px-md" :class="item.target ? 'cursor-pointer' : ''"
                                    :id="domId(item.eventSeq, false)" @click="item.target ? jumpTo(item.target) : null">
                                <q-icon :name="item.icon" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{item.text}} · {{item.time}}</div>
                            <div v-else-if="item.kind === 'hidden'" class="text-center text-caption m-muted q-py-xs q-px-md m-chat-hidden">
                                <q-icon name="sym_o_block" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('Hidden: a message from someone you blocked')}}</div>
                            <chat-message v-else :item="item" :room="self"></chat-message>
                        </template>
                        <div v-if="gapAfter && !hasMoreAfter" class="text-center text-caption m-muted q-py-sm m-chat-gap" data-gap="after">
                            <q-icon name="sym_o_cloud_off" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('Newer messages load when the server can be reached')}}</div>
                        <chat-pending v-for="pending in pendingMain" :key="pending.clientRef" :item="pending" :room="self"></chat-pending>
                    </div>
                    <q-btn v-if="!atBottom || hasMoreAfter" round unelevated size="sm" color="primary" icon="sym_o_arrow_downward" class="absolute"
                            style="right:16px;bottom:10px" :aria-label="t('Jump to the latest')" @click="jumpToLatest">
                        <q-badge v-if="newBelow" floating rounded color="negative">{{newBelow}}</q-badge><q-tooltip>{{t('Jump to the latest')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                    <div v-if="dragOver && canPost" class="absolute-full q-pa-sm" style="z-index:3">
                        <q-card flat bordered class="full-height column items-center justify-center text-primary text-subtitle1" style="border-style:dashed;border-width:2px">
                            <q-icon name="sym_o_upload_file" size="40px"></q-icon>{{t('Drop the files to send them')}}</q-card></div>
                </div>
                <div class="q-px-md text-caption m-muted ellipsis" style="min-height:20px">{{typingText}}</div>
                <div class="q-px-sm q-pb-sm">
                    <!-- join requests waiting, for a moderator (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17) -->
                    <q-banner v-if="joinUi.count > 0 && canModerate" dense rounded class="text-caption m-tonal q-mb-xs m-chat-join-banner">
                        <template v-slot:avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_person_add" color="info"></q-icon></template>
                        {{joinUi.count === 1 ? t('1 person asks to join') : fill(t('{count} people ask to join'), { count: joinUi.count })}}
                        <template v-slot:action><q-btn dense flat no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Review')" @click="joinUi.requests = true"></q-btn></template></q-banner>
                    <!-- a room's text members get each message as a text (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 18) -->
                    <div v-if="textCostLine && access.canPost" class="text-caption m-muted q-px-xs m-chat-text-cost"><q-icon name="sym_o_sms" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{textCostLine}}</div>
                    <q-banner v-if="offline && access.canPost" dense rounded class="text-caption m-tonal q-mb-xs m-chat-offline"><template v-slot:avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_cloud_off" color="warning"></q-icon></template>
                        {{t('You are offline. Messages wait here and go when you are back; files wait for the connection.')}}</q-banner>
                    <q-banner v-if="access.isArchived" dense rounded class="text-caption m-muted"><template v-slot:avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_archive"></q-icon></template>
                        {{t('This room is archived: it is read only.')}}</q-banner>
                    <q-banner v-else-if="access.canJoin" dense rounded class="text-caption"><template v-slot:avatar><q-icon name="sym_o_visibility" color="info"></q-icon></template>
                        {{t('You are reading this room. Join it to post and to hear of its messages.')}}
                        <template v-slot:action><q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Join')" @click="join"></q-btn></template></q-banner>
                    <!-- a room in Spam & blocked: why, and Not spam, Report spam or Unblock in place of the composer -->
                    <q-banner v-else-if="filtered" dense rounded class="text-caption m-tonal m-chat-filtered" :data-filtered="filtered">
                        <template v-slot:avatar><q-icon :name="filtered === 'spam' ? 'sym_o_report' : 'sym_o_block'" color="warning"></q-icon></template>
                        <div>{{filteredText}}</div>
                        <div v-if="filtered === 'spam' && block && block.reasons && block.reasons.length" class="m-muted">{{t('Why')}}: {{block.reasons.join(', ')}}</div>
                        <template v-slot:action>
                            <template v-if="filtered === 'spam'">
                                <q-btn dense flat no-caps color="primary" class="m-chat-not-spam" :label="t('Not spam')" @click="blockAction('notSpam')"></q-btn>
                                <q-btn dense flat no-caps color="negative" class="m-chat-report-spam" :label="t('Report spam')" @click="blockAction('reportSpam')"></q-btn>
                            </template>
                            <q-btn v-else dense flat no-caps color="primary" class="m-chat-unblock" :label="t('Unblock')" @click="blockAction('unblockRoom')"></q-btn>
                        </template></q-banner>
                    <chat-composer v-else-if="access.canPost" :room="self" :placeholder="composerPlaceholder"></chat-composer>
                </div>
            </template>
        </div>

        <!-- the side pane: a thread, the room's threads, its details (tabs: people, media, files, voice, links, reactions,
             pinned), search in the room, the record -->
        <q-separator v-if="side && !sideOverlay" vertical></q-separator>
        <div v-if="side" class="column no-wrap" :class="sideOverlay ? 'col' : ''" :style="sideOverlay ? 'min-width:0' : 'width:360px;min-width:360px'">
            <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-px-sm" style="min-height:44px">
                <q-btn v-if="sideOverlay" flat round dense icon="sym_o_arrow_back" :aria-label="t('Back to the room')" class="m-chat-side-back" @click="closeSide"><q-tooltip>{{t('Back to the room')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                <div class="text-subtitle2 q-ml-xs col ellipsis">{{sideTitle}}</div>
                <q-btn v-if="!sideOverlay" flat round dense icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Close')" @click="closeSide"><q-tooltip>{{t('Close')}} (Esc)</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            </div>
            <!-- the details' tabs (Comms-Messaging §5.1): each loads more as it scrolls -->
            <q-tabs v-if="detailsOpen" :model-value="side" dense no-caps outside-arrows mobile-arrows align="left" left-icon="sym_o_chevron_left" right-icon="sym_o_chevron_right" class="m-chat-details-tabs"
                    @update:model-value="openSide">
                <q-tab v-for="tab in detailTabs" :key="tab.name" :name="tab.name" :label="tab.label" :data-tab="tab.name" class="q-px-sm"></q-tab>
            </q-tabs>
            <q-separator></q-separator>

            <template v-if="side === 'thread'">
                <div ref="threadScroller" class="col scroll q-pb-sm" style="min-height:0">
                    <q-linear-progress v-if="threadView.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                    <template v-for="(item, index) in threadItems" :key="item.key">
                        <div v-if="item.kind === 'day'" class="row items-center no-wrap q-my-sm q-px-sm">
                            <q-separator class="col"></q-separator><span class="text-caption m-muted q-px-sm">{{item.label}}</span><q-separator class="col"></q-separator></div>
                        <template v-else-if="item.kind === 'message'">
                            <chat-message :item="item" :room="self" in-thread></chat-message>
                            <div v-if="item.eventSeq === threadView.rootSeq" class="row items-center no-wrap q-my-xs q-px-md text-caption m-muted">
                                <span>{{repliesText(threadItems.filter((row) => row.kind === 'message').length - 1)}}</span><q-separator class="col q-ml-sm"></q-separator></div>
                        </template>
                    </template>
                    <chat-pending v-for="pending in pendingThread" :key="pending.clientRef" :item="pending" :room="self"></chat-pending>
                </div>
                <div v-if="access.canPost" class="q-px-sm q-pb-sm"><chat-composer :room="self" :thread-root="threadView.rootSeq" :placeholder="t('Reply in the thread…')"></chat-composer></div>
            </template>

            <div v-else-if="side === 'threads'" class="col column no-wrap" style="min-height:0">
                <div class="row q-px-sm q-py-xs">
                    <q-chip v-for="chip in threadChips" :key="String(chip.value)" dense clickable :outline="threadsPane.mine !== chip.value" :color="threadsPane.mine === chip.value ? 'primary' : undefined"
                            :text-color="threadsPane.mine === chip.value ? 'white' : undefined" class="q-ml-none q-mr-xs" :data-threads="chip.value ? 'mine' : 'all'"
                            @click="threadsPane.mine = chip.value; loadThreads(false)">{{chip.label}}</q-chip>
                </div>
                <div class="col scroll" style="min-height:0">
                    <q-linear-progress v-if="threadsPane.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                    <q-list dense separator>
                        <q-item v-for="thread in threadsPane.list" :key="thread.eventSeq" clickable :data-thread="thread.eventSeq" @click="openThread(thread.eventSeq)">
                            <q-item-section avatar top><m-avatar :name="nameOf(thread.senderUserId, thread.senderName)" :user-id="thread.senderUserId || undefined" size="28px"></m-avatar></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section>
                                <q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{nameOf(thread.senderUserId, thread.senderName)}}<span class="text-caption m-muted"> · {{shortWhen(thread.sentDate)}}</span></q-item-label>
                                <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-2-lines">{{thread.redacted ? t('Message removed') : thread.snippet}}</q-item-label>
                                <q-item-label caption><span class="text-primary text-weight-medium">{{repliesText(thread.threadReplyCount)}}</span> · {{lastReplyText(thread)}}</q-item-label>
                            </q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                        <q-item v-if="!threadsPane.loading && !threadsPane.list.length"><q-item-section class="m-muted text-caption">{{t('No threads yet. Reply in a thread from a message to start one.')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    </q-list>
                    <div v-if="threadsPane.hasMore" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                        <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('More threads')" :loading="threadsPane.loading" @click="loadThreads(true)"></q-btn></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Media: the pictures and videos, a grid; a tap opens the viewer, which swipes through them -->
            <div v-else-if="side === 'media'" class="col scroll m-chat-tab" style="min-height:0" data-pane="media" @scroll="onTabScroll">
                <q-linear-progress v-if="tabs.media.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                <div class="row q-col-gutter-xs q-pa-xs">
                    <div v-for="file in tabs.media.list" :key="file.chatAttachmentId" class="col-4 m-chat-media" :data-file="file.chatAttachmentId">
                        <q-img v-if="isImage(file)" :src="fileUrl(file, true)" :ratio="1" class="rounded-borders cursor-pointer" :alt="file.fileName" @click="preview(file, tabs.media.list)">
                            <q-tooltip>{{file.fileName}}</q-tooltip></q-img>
                        <div v-else class="relative-position rounded-borders cursor-pointer bg-grey-9 text-white column items-center justify-center m-chat-media-video"
                                style="aspect-ratio:1" role="button" tabindex="0" :aria-label="t('Play') + ' ' + (file.fileName || '')"
                                @click="preview(file, tabs.media.list)" @keydown.enter="preview(file, tabs.media.list)">
                            <q-icon name="sym_o_play_circle" size="36px"></q-icon>
                            <div class="text-caption ellipsis q-px-xs" style="max-width:100%">{{file.fileName}}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div v-if="tabs.media.loaded && !tabs.media.loading && !tabs.media.list.length && tabs.media.next == null" class="q-pa-md m-muted text-caption">{{t('No pictures or videos yet.')}}</div>
                <div v-if="tabs.media.next != null" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                    <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('More')" :loading="tabs.media.loading" @click="loadTab('media', true)"></q-btn></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Files and Voice: the other files, and the sounds (voice notes) with their player -->
            <div v-else-if="side === 'files' || side === 'voice'" class="col scroll m-chat-tab" style="min-height:0" :data-pane="side" @scroll="onTabScroll">
                <q-linear-progress v-if="tabs[side].loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                <q-list dense separator>
                    <q-item v-for="file in tabs[side].list" :key="file.chatAttachmentId" :data-file="file.chatAttachmentId">
                        <q-item-section avatar top><q-avatar size="40px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" :icon="fileIcon(file)"></q-avatar></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section style="min-width:0"><q-item-label class="ellipsis">{{file.fileName || t('File')}}</q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis">{{sizeText(file.fileSize)}} · {{nameOf(file.senderUserId, file.senderName)}} · {{shortWhen(file.sentDate)}}</q-item-label>
                            <div v-if="side === 'voice'" class="q-mt-xs m-chat-audio" :data-file="file.chatAttachmentId">
                                <audio v-if="mediaUrl(file)" :src="mediaUrl(file)" controls preload="metadata" :aria-label="file.fileName" style="width:100%;height:36px"></audio>
                                <q-btn v-else flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" icon="sym_o_play_arrow" :label="t('Play the voice note')" @click="openMedia(file)"></q-btn>
                            </div></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section side top><div class="row no-wrap">
                            <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_download" :aria-label="t('Download')" @click="download(file)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Download')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                            <q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_chat" :aria-label="t('Show in chat')" @click="showFileInChat(file)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Show in chat')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                        </div></q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                </q-list>
                <div v-if="tabs[side].loaded && !tabs[side].loading && !tabs[side].list.length && tabs[side].next == null" class="q-pa-md m-muted text-caption">
                    {{side === 'voice' ? t('No voice notes yet. With no text in the message box, its microphone records one.') : t('No files yet. The files sent in the room are listed here.')}}</div>
                <div v-if="tabs[side].next != null" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                    <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('More')" :loading="tabs[side].loading" @click="loadTab(side, true)"></q-btn></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Links: the links of the messages, the newest first, with a preview's title; an encrypted room's from the messages opened here -->
            <div v-else-if="side === 'links'" class="col scroll m-chat-tab" style="min-height:0" data-pane="links" @scroll="onTabScroll">
                <div v-if="sealed" class="q-pa-sm m-muted text-caption m-chat-links-sealed" role="note"><q-icon name="sym_o_lock" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('The server cannot read the links of an encrypted room: these are the links of the messages opened on this device.')}}</div>
                <q-linear-progress v-if="tabs.links.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                <q-list dense separator>
                    <q-item v-for="link in tabs.links.list" :key="link.eventSeq + ':' + link.url" class="m-chat-link" :data-seq="link.eventSeq">
                        <q-item-section avatar><q-avatar size="40px" rounded class="m-tonal text-primary" icon="sym_o_link"></q-avatar></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section style="min-width:0">
                            <q-item-label class="ellipsis"><a :href="link.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary">{{link.title || hostOf(link.url)}}</a></q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis">{{link.url}}</q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis">{{[link.siteName, nameOf(link.senderUserId, link.senderName), shortWhen(link.sentDate)].filter((part) => part).join(' · ')}}</q-item-label>
                        </q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section side><q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_chat" :aria-label="t('Show in chat')" @click="showFileInChat(link)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Show in chat')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn></q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                </q-list>
                <div v-if="tabs.links.loaded && !tabs.links.loading && !tabs.links.list.length && tabs.links.next == null" class="q-pa-md m-muted text-caption">{{t('No links yet.')}}</div>
                <div v-if="tabs.links.next != null" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                    <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('More')" :loading="tabs.links.loading" @click="loadTab('links', true)"></q-btn></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Reactions: the messages with reactions, the latest reaction first; or only those to my messages -->
            <div v-else-if="side === 'reactions'" class="col column no-wrap" style="min-height:0" data-pane="reactions">
                <div class="row q-px-sm q-py-xs">
                    <q-chip v-for="chip in reactionChips" :key="String(chip.value)" dense clickable :outline="tabs.reactions.onlyToMe !== chip.value" :color="tabs.reactions.onlyToMe === chip.value ? 'primary' : undefined"
                            :text-color="tabs.reactions.onlyToMe === chip.value ? 'white' : undefined" class="q-ml-none q-mr-xs" :data-reactions="chip.value ? 'mine' : 'all'"
                            @click="tabs.reactions.onlyToMe = chip.value; loadTab('reactions', false)">{{chip.label}}</q-chip>
                </div>
                <div class="col scroll m-chat-tab" style="min-height:0" @scroll="onTabScroll">
                    <q-linear-progress v-if="tabs.reactions.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                    <q-list dense separator>
                        <q-item v-for="message in tabs.reactions.list" :key="message.eventSeq" clickable class="m-chat-reacted" :data-seq="message.eventSeq" @click="showFileInChat(message)">
                            <q-item-section avatar top><m-avatar :name="nameOf(message.senderUserId, message.senderName)" :user-id="message.senderUserId || undefined" size="28px"></m-avatar></q-item-section>
                            <q-item-section style="min-width:0">
                                <q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{nameOf(message.senderUserId, message.senderName)}}<span class="text-caption m-muted"> · {{shortWhen(message.sentDate)}}</span></q-item-label>
                                <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-2-lines">{{message.undecryptable ? t('Encrypted message') : (message.snippet || filesText(message))}}</q-item-label>
                                <div class="row q-gutter-xs q-mt-xs">
                                    <q-chip v-for="reaction in message.reactions" :key="reaction.key" dense square :outline="!reaction.mine" class="q-ma-none" :data-key="reaction.key">
                                        {{reaction.key}} {{reaction.count}}<q-tooltip v-if="!mobile">{{reactorsText(reaction)}}</q-tooltip></q-chip>
                                </div>
                            </q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                    </q-list>
                    <div v-if="tabs.reactions.loaded && !tabs.reactions.loading && !tabs.reactions.list.length && tabs.reactions.next == null" class="q-pa-md m-muted text-caption">
                        {{tabs.reactions.onlyToMe ? t('No reactions to your messages yet.') : t('No reactions yet.')}}</div>
                    <div v-if="tabs.reactions.next != null" class="text-center q-py-sm">
                        <q-btn flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" :label="t('More')" :loading="tabs.reactions.loading" @click="loadTab('reactions', true)"></q-btn></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div v-else-if="side === 'members'" class="col scroll" style="min-height:0" data-pane="members">
                <!-- the room's E2EE label, for every room (§6.1 rule 1) -->
                <div class="q-pa-sm text-caption row no-wrap items-start m-chat-room-label" :data-e2ee="label.state">
                    <q-icon :name="label.icon" size="16px" class="q-mr-xs" :class="label.lock ? 'text-positive' : 'm-muted'"></q-icon><span class="col">{{label.banner || label.text}}</span></div>
                <div v-if="isMember && !isDirect && !access.isArchived" class="q-pa-sm row no-wrap items-end q-gutter-x-xs">
                    <div class="col"><m-drop-down v-model="addPeople.userIds" name="addUserIds" multiple server-search :options-url="url('searchUsers')" :label="t('Add people')"></m-drop-down></div>
                    <q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Add')" :loading="addPeople.busy" :disable="!(addPeople.userIds || []).length" @click="addMembers"></q-btn>
                </div>
                <m-chat-text-members v-if="!isDirect" :base="base" :room-id="roomId" :can-moderate="canModerate" @changed="reloadMeta"></m-chat-text-members>
                <q-list dense>
                    <q-item v-for="person in members.filter((one) => !one.textMember)" :key="person.userId || person.chatActorId">
                        <q-item-section avatar><m-avatar :name="person.name" :user-id="person.userId || undefined" size="32px"></m-avatar></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section><q-item-label>{{person.name}}<span v-if="person.userId && person.userId === me.userId" class="m-muted"> ({{t('you')}})</span>
                                <q-icon v-if="personVerified(person.userId)" name="sym_o_verified" size="14px" class="text-positive q-ml-xs m-chat-person-verified" :aria-label="t('Verified')"></q-icon></q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption>{{person.external ? externalText(person) : presenceText(person.userId)}}<span v-if="personChanged(person.userId)" class="text-warning"> · {{t('new identity: verify them again')}}</span></q-item-label></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section side class="row no-wrap items-center">
                            <!-- an encrypted room: verify another person by emoji (§6.1 rule 3, COM-UI-013) -->
                            <q-btn v-if="canVerify(person)" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" icon="sym_o_verified_user" :label="t('Verify')" class="m-chat-member-verify"
                                    :data-user="person.userId" @click="openVerify(person.userId)"></q-btn>
                            <q-chip v-if="person.external" dense square icon="sym_o_hub" class="m-tonal text-info m-chat-external">{{person.networkName || t('Outside')}}</q-chip>
                            <q-chip v-if="person.roleEnumId === 'CmrOwner' && !isDirect" dense square class="m-tonal">{{t('Owner')}}</q-chip>
                            <q-chip v-else-if="person.roleEnumId === 'CmrModerator'" dense square class="m-tonal text-info">{{t('Moderator')}}</q-chip>
                            <q-btn v-if="person.userId !== me.userId && (canModerate && (isOwner || person.roleEnumId !== 'CmrOwner') || (person.userId && !person.isAgent))" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_more_vert" :aria-label="t('Member')">
                                <q-menu anchor="bottom right" self="top right"><q-list dense style="min-width:200px">
                                    <template v-if="canModerate && (isOwner || person.roleEnumId !== 'CmrOwner')">
                                        <template v-if="!person.external">
                                            <q-item v-if="person.roleEnumId !== 'CmrModerator'" clickable v-close-popup @click="setRole(person, 'CmrModerator')"><q-item-section>{{t('Make a moderator')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                                            <q-item v-if="person.roleEnumId !== 'CmrMember'" clickable v-close-popup @click="setRole(person, 'CmrMember')"><q-item-section>{{t('Make a member')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                                            <q-item v-if="isOwner && person.roleEnumId !== 'CmrOwner'" clickable v-close-popup @click="setRole(person, 'CmrOwner')"><q-item-section>{{t('Make an owner')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                                            <q-separator></q-separator>
                                        </template>
                                        <q-item clickable v-close-popup @click="removeMember(person)"><q-item-section class="text-negative">{{t('Take out of the room')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                                    </template>
                                    <!-- block a person in chat (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 11; unblock in Settings, Chat) -->
                                    <q-item v-if="person.userId && !person.isAgent" clickable v-close-popup class="m-chat-block-person" @click="blockPerson(person)">
                                        <q-item-section>{{fill(t('Block {name}'), { name: person.name || person.userId })}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                                </q-list></q-menu>
                            </q-btn>
                        </q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                </q-list>
            </div>

            <div v-else-if="side === 'pinned'" class="col scroll" style="min-height:0" data-pane="pinned">
                <q-linear-progress v-if="pinned.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                <q-list dense separator>
                    <q-item v-for="event in pinned.list" :key="event.eventSeq" clickable @click="jumpTo(event.eventSeq)">
                        <q-item-section avatar top><m-avatar :name="nameOf(event.senderUserId, event.senderName)" :user-id="event.senderUserId || undefined" size="28px"></m-avatar></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section><q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{nameOf(event.senderUserId, event.senderName)}}
                                <span class="text-caption m-muted"> · {{shortWhen(event.sentDate)}}</span></q-item-label>
                            <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-3-lines">{{event.bodyText || filesText(event)}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section v-if="canPost" side top><q-btn flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_keep_off" :aria-label="t('Unpin')" @click.stop="pin({eventSeq: event.eventSeq, event: event}, false)">
                            <q-tooltip>{{t('Unpin')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn></q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                    <q-item v-if="!pinned.loading && !pinned.list.length"><q-item-section class="m-muted text-caption">{{t('No pinned messages. Pin one from its menu to keep it here.')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                </q-list>
            </div>

            <div v-else-if="side === 'search'" class="col column no-wrap" style="min-height:0">
                <!-- an encrypted room is not searched on the server, and this app has no search on the device yet (COM-UI-011) -->
                <div v-if="sealed" class="q-pa-sm m-muted text-caption m-chat-search-sealed" role="note">
                    <q-icon name="sym_o_lock" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('An encrypted room is not searched: the server keeps only ciphertext, and this app has no search on your device yet.')}}</div>
                <div class="q-pa-sm row no-wrap items-center" @keydown.enter.prevent="runSearch">
                    <div class="col"><m-text-line v-model="searchPane.text" :name="'roomSearch' + uid" :label="t('Search this room')" :disable="sealed"></m-text-line></div>
                    <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_search" :aria-label="t('Search')" :disable="sealed" @click="runSearch"></q-btn>
                </div>
                <div class="col scroll" style="min-height:0">
                    <q-linear-progress v-if="searchPane.loading" indeterminate color="primary"></q-linear-progress>
                    <q-list dense separator>
                        <q-item v-for="hit in searchPane.results" :key="hit.eventSeq" clickable @click="jumpTo(hit.eventSeq)">
                            <q-item-section><q-item-label class="text-weight-medium">{{hit.senderName}} <span class="text-caption m-muted"> · {{shortWhen(hit.sentDate)}}</span></q-item-label>
                                <q-item-label caption class="ellipsis-3-lines">{{hit.snippet}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                        </q-item>
                        <q-item v-if="searchPane.searched && !searchPane.loading && !searchPane.results.length"><q-item-section class="m-muted text-caption">{{t('No messages match')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
                    </q-list>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div v-else-if="side === 'record' && room && room.record" class="col scroll q-pa-sm" style="min-height:0">
                <m-record-card :record-entity="room.record.entity" :record-id="room.record.id" :card-url="url('recordCard')"></m-record-card>
                <q-btn v-if="room.record.url" unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_open_in_new" :label="t('Open the record')" class="q-mt-sm" @click="go(room.record.url)"></q-btn>
                <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-sm">{{t('Everyone who can see this record can read this room and join it.')}}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RoomSettings: name and topic (moderators), who may join and the archive (owners) -->
    <!-- invite links and join requests (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17; WebrootChatJoin.js) -->
    <m-chat-invites v-if="inviteOffered" v-model="joinUi.links" :base="base" :room-id="roomId" :room-name="room && room.roomName"></m-chat-invites>
    <m-chat-join-requests v-if="canModerate" v-model="joinUi.requests" :base="base" :room-id="roomId" @changed="loadJoinCount"></m-chat-join-requests>
    <m-dialog v-model="settings.open" :title="t('Room settings')" width="560">
        <div class="q-mb-sm text-caption row no-wrap items-start m-chat-room-label" :data-e2ee="label.state">
            <q-icon :name="label.icon" size="16px" class="q-mr-xs" :class="label.lock ? 'text-positive' : 'm-muted'"></q-icon><span class="col">{{label.banner || label.text}}</span></div>
        <m-text-line v-model="settings.roomName" :name="'settingsName' + uid" :label="t('Name')"></m-text-line>
        <m-text-area v-model="settings.topic" :name="'settingsTopic' + uid" rows="2" :label="t('Topic')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-area>
        <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-mt-sm m-chat-settings-timer"><q-icon name="sym_o_timer" size="18px" class="q-mr-sm m-muted"></q-icon>
            <span class="col">{{t('Disappearing messages')}}: {{timerLabel}}</span>
            <q-btn flat dense no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Change')" @click="openTimer"></q-btn></div>
        <template v-if="isOwner">
            <m-drop-down v-model="settings.visibility" :name="'settingsVisibility' + uid" :options="visibilityOptions" :label="t('Who may join')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-drop-down>
        </template>
        <div v-if="sealed" class="q-mt-sm q-pa-sm rounded-borders m-tonal text-body2 m-chat-encrypted-note"><q-icon name="sym_o_lock" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon>{{t('Messages here are end-to-end encrypted, and that cannot be turned off. Only the devices of its members read them; the server keeps ciphertext. So this room has no server search, link previews, agents, polls, bridges, forwards or filing on records, and the terminal cannot read it. A new device reads older messages only from your key backup (Settings, My devices) or from another of your devices.')}}</div>
        <template v-if="sealed">
            <q-toggle v-model="settings.verifiedOnly" :label="t('Messages only to verified devices')" class="q-mt-sm m-chat-room-verified-only"></q-toggle>
            <div class="text-caption m-muted">{{t("Each member's browser encrypts for the devices that were verified (by emoji or QR code, or by their owner's cross-signing) only; a device that is not verified cannot read what follows.")}}</div>
        </template>
        <!-- the networks the room's messages go to (C1): its bridges' mappings, added, changed and ended by a bridge administrator -->
        <template v-if="!sealed && !isDirect && (roomBridges.length || (me && me.bridgeAdmin))">
            <div class="text-subtitle2 q-mt-md">{{t('Bridges')}}</div>
            <q-list dense separator class="m-chat-room-bridges">
                <q-item v-for="bridge in roomBridges" :key="bridge.chatRoomBridgeId">
                    <q-item-section>
                        <q-item-label>{{bridge.networkName || bridge.name}}<span v-if="bridge.externalRoomName"> · <a v-if="bridge.externalRoomUrl" :href="bridge.externalRoomUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{bridge.externalRoomName}}</a><template v-else>{{bridge.externalRoomName}}</template></span></q-item-label>
                        <q-item-label caption>{{directionText(bridge.directionEnumId)}} · <span :class="bridge.connected ? 'text-positive' : 'text-warning'">{{bridge.connected ? t('connected') : t('not connected')}}</span></q-item-label>
                        <q-item-label caption class="m-chat-bridge-encryption" :data-encryption="bridge.encryption">{{bridgeEncryptionText(bridge.encryption)}}</q-item-label>
                    </q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section v-if="me && me.bridgeAdmin" side class="row no-wrap">
                        <div class="row no-wrap">
                            <q-btn flat dense round icon="sym_o_edit" @click="editBridge(bridge)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Change')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                            <q-btn flat dense round icon="sym_o_link_off" color="negative" @click="endBridge(bridge)"><q-tooltip>{{t('End')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                        </div>
                    </q-item-section>
                </q-item>
                <q-item v-if="!roomBridges.length"><q-item-section class="text-caption m-muted">{{t('Not bridged: its messages stay here.')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
            </q-list>
            <template v-if="me && me.bridgeAdmin">
                <q-btn v-if="!bridgeForm.open" flat dense no-caps icon="sym_o_add_link" :label="t('Bridge to another network')" class="q-mt-xs" @click="newBridge"></q-btn>
                <div v-else class="q-mt-xs q-pa-sm rounded-borders m-tonal m-chat-room-bridge-form">
                    <m-drop-down v-if="!bridgeForm.chatRoomBridgeId" v-model="bridgeForm.chatBridgeId" :name="'bridgeChoice' + uid" :options="bridgeChoices" :label="t('Bridge')"></m-drop-down>
                    <m-text-line v-if="!bridgeForm.chatRoomBridgeId" v-model="bridgeForm.externalRoomId" :name="'bridgeRoomId' + uid" :label="t('Its room or conversation id on that network')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-line>
                    <m-text-line v-model="bridgeForm.externalRoomName" :name="'bridgeRoomName' + uid" :label="t('Its name there')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-line>
                    <m-text-line v-model="bridgeForm.externalRoomUrl" :name="'bridgeRoomUrl' + uid" :label="t('A link to it (optional)')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-line>
                    <m-drop-down v-model="bridgeForm.directionEnumId" :name="'bridgeDirection' + uid" :options="directionOptions" :label="t('Messages go')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-drop-down>
                    <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-sm">
                        <q-btn unelevated dense no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Save the bridge')" :loading="bridgeForm.busy"
                                :disable="!bridgeForm.chatRoomBridgeId && (!bridgeForm.chatBridgeId || !bridgeForm.externalRoomId)" @click="saveBridge"></q-btn>
                        <q-btn flat dense no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" @click="bridgeForm.open = false"></q-btn>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </template>
        </template>
        <!-- an encrypted room's calls are encrypted, and that is not a setting (Comms-Messaging §6.1 rule 4) -->
        <q-toggle :model-value="sealed || settings.callE2ee" :disable="sealed" :label="t('Calls in this room are end-to-end encrypted')" class="q-mt-sm m-chat-room-call-e2ee"
                @update:model-value="(value) => { settings.callE2ee = value; }"></q-toggle>
        <div v-if="sealed" class="text-caption m-muted">{{t('Every call in an encrypted room is end-to-end encrypted: no recording, captions, phones or guests.')}}</div>
        <div v-else class="text-caption m-muted">{{t('Only the people in a call hear and see it: no recording, captions, phones or guests. This is apart from the encryption of the messages.')}}</div>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md items-center">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Save')" :loading="settings.busy" @click="saveSettings"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
            <q-space></q-space>
            <q-btn v-if="isOwner" unelevated no-caps class="m-btn-tonal text-negative" :icon="room && room.archivedDate ? 'sym_o_unarchive' : 'sym_o_archive'"
                    :label="room && room.archivedDate ? t('Take out of the archive') : t('Archive the room')" @click="setArchived(!(room && room.archivedDate))"></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- Disappearing messages (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 16): the room's timer, from when a message is sent -->
    <m-dialog v-model="timerBox.open" :title="t('Disappearing messages')" width="420">
        <div class="m-chat-timer-dialog" :data-blocked="timerBlocked || undefined">
            <q-option-group v-model="timerBox.value" :options="timerOptions" type="radio" dense :disable="!canSetTimer" class="m-chat-timer-options"></q-option-group>
            <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-sm">{{t('New messages disappear this long after they are sent, read or not, here and on every member’s device. Messages sent before keep their time.')}}</div>
            <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs">{{t('Anyone in the room can still copy or photograph a message before it goes.')}}</div>
            <div v-if="timerBlocked === 'bridged'" class="text-caption text-warning q-mt-xs m-chat-timer-bridged">{{timerBridgedText}}</div>
            <div v-else-if="timerBlocked === 'recordRoom'" class="text-caption text-warning q-mt-xs">{{t('A record’s room keeps its messages.')}}</div>
            <div v-else-if="!canSetTimer" class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs">{{t('A moderator or owner changes it.')}}</div>
            <div v-if="!sealed && !timerBlocked" class="text-caption m-muted q-mt-xs">{{t('This room is not end-to-end encrypted: until a message goes, the server can read it, and a backup made meanwhile keeps it until the backup is removed.')}}</div>
            <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
                <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Save')" :loading="timerBox.busy" :disable="!canSetTimer" @click="saveTimer"></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
            </div>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- a view-once photo or video, open (phase 16): no download, forward or save; the Android app blocks screenshots meanwhile -->
    <q-dialog :model-value="onceView.open" maximized transition-show="fade" transition-hide="fade" @hide="closeViewOnce" @update:model-value="(open) => { if (!open) closeViewOnce(); }">
        <div class="column no-wrap bg-black text-white m-chat-view-once-viewer" style="width:100%;height:100%;user-select:none" tabindex="0" @contextmenu.prevent @keydown.esc="closeViewOnce">
            <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-pa-sm">
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Close')" @click="closeViewOnce"></q-btn>
                <div class="col q-ml-sm text-caption">{{t('View once: it goes when you close it')}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col row items-center justify-center" style="min-height:0">
                <img v-if="onceView.url && onceView.kind === 'photo'" :src="onceView.url" alt="" draggable="false" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none">
                <video v-else-if="onceView.url" :src="onceView.url" autoplay playsinline controls controlslist="nodownload noplaybackrate" disablepictureinpicture
                        style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%" @ended="closeViewOnce"></video>
                <q-spinner v-else size="40px"></q-spinner>
            </div>
            <div v-if="onceView.secured === false" class="text-caption text-center q-pa-sm m-muted m-chat-view-once-unsecured">{{t('Screenshots cannot be stopped here.')}}</div>
        </div>
    </q-dialog>

    <!-- Verify a person (COM-UI-013): their devices as this browser knows them, each with Verify, and the verifications with them -->
    <m-dialog v-model="verifyBox.open" :title="verifyTitle" width="520">
        <div class="text-caption m-muted q-mb-sm">{{t('Compare emoji with them, on a call or side by side: when they match, their device is verified, and with cross-signing every device they signed.')}}</div>
        <q-list dense bordered separator class="rounded-borders q-mb-sm m-chat-verify-devices">
            <q-item v-for="device in verifyDevices" :key="device.deviceId" :data-device="device.deviceId">
                <q-item-section><q-item-label>{{device.displayName || device.deviceId}}</q-item-label><q-item-label caption>{{device.deviceId}}</q-item-label></q-item-section>
                <q-item-section side>
                    <q-badge v-if="device.verified" color="positive">{{t('Verified')}}</q-badge>
                    <q-btn v-else flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_verified_user" :label="t('Verify')" class="m-chat-verify-device" @click="verifyDevice(device)"></q-btn>
                </q-item-section>
            </q-item>
            <q-item v-if="!verifyDevices.length"><q-item-section class="text-caption m-muted">{{t('This browser knows no device of theirs yet.')}}</q-item-section></q-item>
        </q-list>
        <m-chat-verification v-for="flow in verifyFlows" :key="flow.flowId" :flow="flow" :who="nameOf(flow.otherUserId)" can-retry class="q-mb-sm"
                @retry="retryVerify" @step="verifyStepped"></m-chat-verification>
    </m-dialog>
    <!-- Set up this device: the recovery key, or a verification with another of the user's devices (Comms-Messaging §6.5) -->
    <m-chat-device-setup v-if="sealed" ref="setupCard" v-model="setupOpen" :status="setup" @refresh="loadSetup" @later="setupLaterNow"></m-chat-device-setup>
    <!-- another person asks to verify with this device: shown in the room, as on My devices -->
    <m-dialog :model-value="incomingFlows.length > 0 && !verifyBox.open" :title="t('Verify')" width="520" @update:model-value="(open) => { if (!open) dismissIncoming(); }">
        <m-chat-verification v-for="flow in incomingFlows" :key="flow.flowId" :flow="flow" :who="incomingWho(flow)" class="q-mb-sm m-chat-incoming"
                @step="verifyStepped"></m-chat-verification>
    </m-dialog>
    <!-- before a send (§6.1 rule 3): a verified person's new device or new identity; Verify, or Send anyway -->
    <m-dialog v-model="problemBox.open" :title="t('Check before you send')" width="520">
        <div class="text-body2 q-mb-sm">{{t('Someone you verified has changed. Verify them before you send, or send anyway.')}}</div>
        <q-list dense class="q-my-sm m-chat-problems">
            <q-item v-for="(problem, index) in problemBox.problems" :key="index" class="q-px-none">
                <q-item-section>{{problemLines[index]}}</q-item-section>
                <q-item-section side><q-btn flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_verified_user" :label="t('Verify')" class="m-chat-problem-verify"
                        :data-user="problem.userId" @click="verifyProblem(problem)"></q-btn></q-item-section>
            </q-item>
        </q-list>
        <div class="text-caption m-muted">{{t('Send anyway: each new device listed gets the keys of this room from this message on, and each new identity is used here; they stay not verified, and you are asked again for any other change.')}}</div>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('Send anyway')" :loading="problemBox.busy" class="m-chat-problem-send" @click="sendAnyway"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- LinkToRecord: a message filed on a record, whose Chatter shows it -->
    <m-dialog v-model="fileOn.open" :title="t('File on a record')" width="520">
        <div v-if="fileOn.item" class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis-2-lines q-mb-sm">{{fileOn.item.senderName}}: {{snippetOf(fileOn.item.event)}}</div>
        <m-drop-down v-model="fileOn.value" :name="'fileOnRecord' + uid" server-search :server-min-length="2" :options-url="url('searchRecords')" :label="t('Record by id or name')"></m-drop-down>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" :label="t('File')" :disable="!fileOn.value" :loading="fileOn.busy" @click="fileOnRecord"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- the viewer: a picture or a video full screen, a swipe (or the arrows, or Left and Right) to the next of its list (the
         Media tab's, or the message's) -->
    <q-dialog v-model="viewer.open" maximized transition-show="fade" transition-hide="fade" @hide="viewerClosed">
        <div v-if="viewerFile" class="column no-wrap bg-black text-white m-chat-viewer" style="width:100%;height:100%" tabindex="0"
                :data-file="viewerFile.chatAttachmentId" @keydown.left.prevent="viewerStep(-1)" @keydown.right.prevent="viewerStep(1)"
                @touchstart.passive="viewerTouch($event, true)" @touchend="viewerTouch($event, false)">
            <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-pa-sm">
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Close')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
                <div class="col q-ml-sm" style="min-width:0">
                    <div class="ellipsis">{{viewerFile.fileName}}</div>
                    <div class="text-caption ellipsis m-chat-viewer-where">{{[nameOf(viewerFile.senderUserId, viewerFile.senderName), shortWhen(viewerFile.sentDate)].filter((part) => part).join(' · ')}}<span v-if="viewer.list.length > 1"> · {{viewer.index + 1}} / {{viewer.list.length}}</span></div>
                </div>
                <q-btn v-if="viewerFile.eventSeq" flat round dense icon="sym_o_chat" :aria-label="t('Show in chat')" @click="viewer.open = false; showFileInChat(viewerFile)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Show in chat')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_download" :aria-label="t('Download')" @click="download(viewerFile)"><q-tooltip>{{t('Download')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
            </div>
            <div class="col relative-position row items-center justify-center" style="min-height:0">
                <img v-if="isImage(viewerFile) && mediaUrl(viewerFile)" :src="mediaUrl(viewerFile)" :alt="viewerFile.fileName" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain">
                <video v-else-if="isVideo(viewerFile) && mediaUrl(viewerFile)" :key="viewerFile.chatAttachmentId" :src="mediaUrl(viewerFile)" controls playsinline style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%"></video>
                <q-spinner v-else size="40px"></q-spinner>
                <q-btn v-if="viewer.index > 0" round flat icon="sym_o_chevron_left" size="lg" class="absolute-left q-my-auto m-chat-viewer-prev" style="height:56px;top:0;bottom:0"
                        :aria-label="t('Previous')" @click="viewerStep(-1)"></q-btn>
                <q-btn v-if="viewer.index < viewer.list.length - 1" round flat icon="sym_o_chevron_right" size="lg" class="absolute-right q-my-auto m-chat-viewer-next" style="height:56px;top:0;bottom:0"
                        :aria-label="t('Next')" @click="viewerStep(1)"></q-btn>
            </div>
        </div>
    </q-dialog>

    <!-- Forward: a message to another of my rooms, with a comment; the server quotes it -->
    <m-dialog v-model="forward.open" :title="t('Forward')" width="520">
        <div v-if="forward.item" class="row no-wrap q-mb-sm text-caption">
            <div class="self-stretch bg-grey-5" style="width:3px;border-radius:2px"></div>
            <div class="q-pl-sm ellipsis-3-lines"><span class="text-weight-medium">{{forward.item.senderName}}:</span> {{snippetOf(forward.item.event)}}</div>
        </div>
        <m-drop-down v-model="forward.roomId" :name="'forwardRoom' + uid" server-search :server-min-length="0" options-load-init :options-url="url('forwardRooms')"
                :label="t('To')"></m-drop-down>
        <m-text-area v-model="forward.comment" :name="'forwardComment' + uid" rows="2" :label="t('Add a comment (optional)')" class="q-mt-xs"></m-text-area>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_forward" :label="t('Forward')" :disable="!forward.roomId" :loading="forward.busy" @click="sendForward"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>

    <!-- NewCard (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 13): a card or a text with buttons -->
    <chat-card-box v-if="cardBox.open" :room="self" :thread-root="cardBox.threadRoot" @close="cardBox = { open: false, threadRoot: null }"></chat-card-box>
    <!-- NewPoll: a question, 2 to 10 options, more than one choice, anonymous, and when it closes -->
    <m-dialog v-model="pollBox.open" :title="t('New poll')" width="520">
        <m-text-line v-model="pollBox.question" :name="'pollQuestion' + uid" :label="t('Question')" required></m-text-line>
        <div v-for="(option, index) in pollBox.options" :key="index" class="row no-wrap items-center q-mt-xs">
            <div class="col"><m-text-line v-model="pollBox.options[index]" :name="'pollOption' + uid + '_' + index" :label="optionLabel(index)"></m-text-line></div>
            <q-btn v-if="pollBox.options.length > 2" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Remove the option')" @click="pollBox.options.splice(index, 1)"></q-btn>
        </div>
        <q-btn v-if="pollBox.options.length < 10" flat dense no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_add" :label="t('Add an option')" class="q-mt-xs" @click="pollBox.options.push('')"></q-btn>
        <div class="column q-mt-sm q-gutter-y-xs">
            <m-check v-model="pollBox.multiple" :name="'pollMultiple' + uid" toggle true-value="Y" false-value="N" :single-label="t('People may choose more than one')"></m-check>
            <m-check v-model="pollBox.anonymous" :name="'pollAnonymous' + uid" toggle true-value="Y" false-value="N" :single-label="t('Anonymous: no one sees who voted for what')"></m-check>
        </div>
        <m-date-time v-model="pollBox.closes" :name="'pollCloses' + uid" :label="t('Closes (optional)')" class="q-mt-sm"></m-date-time>
        <div class="row q-gutter-sm q-mt-md">
            <q-btn unelevated no-caps color="primary" icon="sym_o_ballot" :label="t('Post the poll')" :disable="!canMakePoll" :loading="pollBox.busy" @click="createPoll"></q-btn>
            <q-btn flat no-caps :label="t('Cancel')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
        </div>
    </m-dialog>
    <!-- a message's actions on a phone: a long press (or a right click) opens them as a sheet from the bottom, the same list
         as the desktop's menu (chat-message-menu) -->
    <q-dialog v-model="sheet.open" position="bottom" @hide="sheet.item = null">
        <q-card v-if="sheet.item" class="m-chat-sheet" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0">
            <chat-message-menu :room="self" :item="sheet.item" :in-thread="sheet.inThread" reactions @done="sheet.open = false"></chat-message-menu>
        </q-card>
    </q-dialog>
    <!-- who reacted with an emoji, or voted for an option: a long press on its chip or option (a hover shows it too) -->
    <q-dialog v-model="peopleBox.open" :position="useBubbles ? 'bottom' : 'standard'">
        <q-card class="m-chat-people" :style="useBubbles ? 'width:100%;max-width:560px;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0' : 'width:100%;max-width:400px'">
            <q-card-section class="row items-center no-wrap q-pb-xs">
                <div class="col text-subtitle1 ellipsis">{{peopleBox.title}}</div>
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Close')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
            </q-card-section>
            <q-list class="q-pb-sm scroll" style="max-height:50vh">
                <q-item v-for="person in peopleBox.people" :key="person.userId" :data-person="person.userId">
                    <q-item-section avatar><m-avatar :name="person.name" :user-id="person.userId" size="32px"></m-avatar></q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section>{{person.name}}</q-item-section>
                    <q-item-section v-if="person.detail" side class="text-body1">{{person.detail}}</q-item-section>
                </q-item>
            </q-list>
        </q-card>
    </q-dialog>
    <!-- Info (Comms-Messaging §4, COM-UI-008): only what the server knows: sent, the delivery of a bridged message per
         network, and who has read up to it (not in a thread; none where either side has receipts off) -->
    <q-dialog v-model="infoBox.open" :position="useBubbles ? 'bottom' : 'standard'" @hide="infoBox.item = null">
        <q-card v-if="infoBox.item" class="m-chat-info" :style="useBubbles ? 'width:100%;max-width:560px;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0' : 'width:100%;max-width:480px'">
            <q-card-section class="row items-center no-wrap q-pb-xs">
                <div class="col text-subtitle1">{{t('Message info')}}</div>
                <q-btn flat round dense icon="sym_o_close" :aria-label="t('Close')" v-close-popup></q-btn>
            </q-card-section>
            <q-card-section class="q-pt-none relative-position">
                <div class="text-caption m-muted ellipsis-2-lines q-mb-xs">{{infoBox.item.senderName}}: {{snippetOf(infoBox.item.event)}}</div>
                <q-list dense>
                    <q-item v-for="(line, index) in infoLines" :key="index" class="q-px-none" :data-info="line.key" :data-state="line.state || undefined">
                        <q-item-section v-if="line.label" side top class="text-weight-medium text-body2" style="min-width:96px;max-width:40%">{{line.label}}</q-item-section>
                        <q-item-section :class="line.key === 'note' ? 'text-caption m-muted' : 'text-body2'">{{line.text}}</q-item-section>
                    </q-item>
                </q-list>
                <q-inner-loading :showing="infoBox.loading"></q-inner-loading>
            </q-card-section>
        </q-card>
    </q-dialog>
    <!-- Send later and Remind me (Comms-Messaging phase 15) -->
    <chat-when v-model="whenBox.open" :kind="whenBox.kind" :title="whenBox.title" :note="whenBox.note" :current="whenBox.current" @pick="whenPicked" @clear="whenCleared"></chat-when>
    <chat-scheduled v-model="scheduledBox.open" :room="self"></chat-scheduled>
</div>`;

// ---- Send later and Remind me (Comms-Messaging phase 15): when, and the room's scheduled messages ----
const WHEN_LABELS = { hour: 'In 1 hour', tomorrowMorning: 'Tomorrow morning', tomorrowAfternoon: 'Tomorrow afternoon', monday: 'Monday morning',
    minutes20: 'In 20 minutes', tomorrow: 'Tomorrow' };
const whenTemplate = `
<m-dialog :model-value="modelValue" :title="title" width="400" @update:model-value="(open) => $emit('update:modelValue', open)">
    <div v-if="note" class="text-caption m-muted q-mb-sm m-chat-when-note">{{note}}</div>
    <q-list dense class="m-chat-when">
        <q-item v-for="choice in choices" :key="choice.key" clickable :data-when="choice.key" @click="$emit('pick', choice.at)">
            <q-item-section>{{choice.label}}</q-item-section>
            <q-item-section side class="text-caption">{{choice.text}}</q-item-section>
        </q-item>
    </q-list>
    <div class="row items-center no-wrap q-gutter-x-sm q-mt-sm">
        <q-input v-model="custom" dense outlined stack-label type="datetime-local" class="col" name="chatWhenCustom" :label="t('Pick a date and time')"></q-input>
        <q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" class="m-chat-when-set" :label="t('Set')" :disable="customAt == null" @click="$emit('pick', customAt)"></q-btn>
    </div>
    <div v-if="custom && customAt == null" class="text-caption text-negative q-mt-xs">{{t('Pick a time at least a minute from now and within a year')}}</div>
    <div v-if="current" class="row q-mt-md"><q-btn flat dense no-caps color="negative" class="m-chat-when-clear" :label="t('Cancel the reminder')" @click="$emit('clear')"></q-btn></div>
</m-dialog>`;
const chatWhen = {
    name: 'ChatWhen',
    props: { modelValue: Boolean, kind: { type: String, default: 'send' }, title: String, note: String, current: Object },
    emits: ['update:modelValue', 'pick', 'clear'],
    data() { return { custom: '', now: Date.now() }; },
    computed: {
        choices() {
            return moqui.chat.whenChoices(this.kind, this.now).map((choice) => Object.assign({ label: t(WHEN_LABELS[choice.key] || choice.key),
                text: moqui.chat.whenText(choice.at, this.now) }, choice));
        },
        // the date and time picked, in this device's zone, when it may be used
        customAt() {
            // read in the user's zone, as the choices and their labels are
            const at = this.custom ? moqui.chat.wallTime(this.custom) : NaN;
            return moqui.chat.timeAllowed(at, Date.now()) ? at : null;
        }
    },
    watch: { modelValue(open) { if (open) { this.now = Date.now(); this.custom = ''; } } },
    methods: { t },
    template: whenTemplate
};
const scheduledTemplate = `
<m-dialog :model-value="modelValue" :title="t('Scheduled messages')" width="560" @update:model-value="(open) => $emit('update:modelValue', open)">
    <q-list separator class="m-chat-scheduled">
        <q-item v-for="row in room.scheduledHere" :key="row.chatScheduledMessageId" class="q-px-none" :data-scheduled="row.chatScheduledMessageId" :data-status="row.status">
            <q-item-section>
                <q-item-label class="row items-center no-wrap text-caption" :class="room.scheduledFailed(row) ? 'text-negative' : 'm-muted'">
                    <q-icon :name="room.scheduledIcon(row)" size="14px" class="q-mr-xs"></q-icon><span class="ellipsis">{{room.scheduledWhen(row)}}</span></q-item-label>
                <template v-if="editing === row.chatScheduledMessageId">
                    <m-rich-text v-model="editBody" :name="'chatScheduledEdit' + row.chatScheduledMessageId" light rows="2" :label="t('Edit message')"
                            :mention-url="room.url('mentionUsers')" :mention-parameters="{chatRoomId: room.roomId}"></m-rich-text>
                    <div class="row q-gutter-x-sm q-mt-xs">
                        <q-btn dense unelevated no-caps color="primary" size="sm" :label="t('Save')" :loading="busy" @click="save(row)"></q-btn>
                        <q-btn dense flat no-caps size="sm" :label="t('Change the time…')" @click="room.retimeScheduled(row)"></q-btn>
                        <q-btn dense flat no-caps size="sm" :label="t('Cancel')" @click="editing = null"></q-btn>
                    </div>
                </template>
                <q-item-label v-else class="ellipsis-2-lines text-body2">{{room.scheduledText(row)}}</q-item-label>
                <q-item-label v-if="row.files && row.files.length" caption class="ellipsis">{{row.files.map((file) => file.fileName).join(', ')}}</q-item-label>
                <q-item-label v-if="row.threadRootEventSeq" caption>{{t('In a thread')}}</q-item-label>
                <q-item-label v-else-if="row.replyToEventSeq" caption>{{t('A reply')}}</q-item-label>
            </q-item-section>
            <q-item-section side top>
                <div class="row no-wrap">
                    <q-btn v-if="room.canEditScheduled(row)" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_edit" class="m-chat-scheduled-edit" :aria-label="t('Edit')" @click="edit(row)">
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Edit')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                    <q-btn v-if="row.reviewNeeded && room.isHolder(row)" flat dense no-caps size="sm" color="primary" class="m-chat-scheduled-review" :label="t('Review and send')"
                            @click="room.reviewScheduled(row)"></q-btn>
                    <q-btn v-else-if="room.canSendScheduled(row)" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_send" class="m-chat-scheduled-now" :aria-label="t('Send now')" @click="room.sendScheduledNow(row)">
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Send now')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                    <q-btn v-if="row.status === 'sent'" flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_close" class="m-chat-scheduled-dismiss" :aria-label="t('Dismiss')" @click="room.dismissScheduled(row)">
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Dismiss')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                    <q-btn v-else flat round dense size="sm" icon="sym_o_delete" class="m-chat-scheduled-cancel" :aria-label="t('Cancel the message')" @click="room.cancelScheduled(row)">
                        <q-tooltip>{{t('Cancel the message')}}</q-tooltip></q-btn>
                </div>
            </q-item-section>
        </q-item>
    </q-list>
    <div v-if="!room.scheduledHere.length" class="text-caption m-muted q-pa-md text-center">{{t('Nothing is scheduled in this room')}}</div>
</m-dialog>`;
const chatScheduled = {
    name: 'ChatScheduled',
    props: { modelValue: Boolean, room: Object },
    emits: ['update:modelValue'],
    data() { return { editing: null, editBody: '', busy: false }; },
    methods: {
        t,
        edit(row) {
            this.editing = row.chatScheduledMessageId;
            if (!row.held) { this.editBody = row.body || ''; return; }
            this.editBody = '';
            moqui.chat.openHeld(row.chatScheduledMessageId, moqui.crypto.openLocal).then((draft) => { this.editBody = (draft && draft.body) || ''; }, () => {});
        },
        save(row) {
            this.busy = true;
            this.room.saveScheduled(row, this.editBody).then(() => { this.busy = false; this.editing = null; }, () => { this.busy = false; });
        }
    },
    template: scheduledTemplate
};

let roomCount = 0;
const chatRoom = {
    name: 'ChatRoom',
    props: { base: String, roomId: String, me: Object, prefs: { type: Object, default: () => ({}) }, seq: [Number, String], thread: [Number, String],
        compact: Boolean, canGoBack: Boolean, bubbles: Boolean, linkBase: { type: String, default: '/qapps/BasicComms/Chat' },
        // the user's rooms (find#Rooms), for a direct room's other one with the same people; a first message to send once the
        // room is shown (a dm link's unsaved message, sealed here in an encrypted room)
        rooms: { type: Array, default: () => [] }, firstMessage: String },
    emits: ['back', 'thread', 'changed', 'left', 'read', 'first-sent'],
    components: { 'chat-message': chatMessage, 'chat-composer': chatComposer, 'chat-pending': chatPending, 'chat-message-menu': chatMessageMenu, 'chat-card-box': chatCardBox,
        'chat-when': chatWhen, 'chat-scheduled': chatScheduled },
    data() {
        roomCount += 1;
        return {
            uid: roomCount, state: 'loading', room: null, member: null, access: {}, members: [], names: {}, block: null,
            joinUi: { links: false, requests: false, count: 0 },
            events: [], hasMoreBefore: false, hasMoreAfter: false, gapBefore: false, gapAfter: false, loadingOlder: false, loadingNewer: false,
            myLastRead: 0, dividerSeq: null, highlightSeq: null, atBottom: true, newBelow: 0, holdRead: false,
            hoverKey: null, tapKey: null, sheet: { open: false, item: null, inThread: false }, editing: null, replyTo: null, side: null,
            swipeKey: null, swipeDx: 0,
            threadView: { rootSeq: null, events: [], loading: false }, pinned: { list: [], loading: false },
            threadsPane: { list: [], loading: false, hasMore: false, mine: false, next: null },
            tabs: { media: emptyTab(), files: emptyTab(), voice: emptyTab(), links: emptyTab(), reactions: emptyTab() },
            forward: { open: false, item: null, roomId: null, comment: '', busy: false },
            pollBox: { open: false, threadRoot: null, question: '', options: ['', ''], multiple: 'N', anonymous: 'N', closes: '', busy: false },
            cardBox: { open: false, threadRoot: null },
            searchPane: { text: '', results: [], loading: false, searched: false }, addPeople: { userIds: [], busy: false },
            settings: { open: false, roomName: '', topic: '', visibility: '', busy: false },
            timerBox: { open: false, value: 0, busy: false }, onceView: { open: false, url: null, kind: null, item: null, until: 0, secured: null },
            bridgeForm: { open: false, chatRoomBridgeId: null, chatBridgeId: null, externalRoomId: '', externalRoomName: '', externalRoomUrl: '', directionEnumId: 'CrbBoth', busy: false },
            bridgeChoices: [], viewer: { open: false, list: [], index: 0 },
            tick: Date.now(), width: 0, dragOver: false, anchor: null, trust: null, bannerTick: 0, leftOutTick: 0,
            verifyBox: { open: false, userId: null }, problemBox: { open: false, problems: [], retry: null, busy: false }, dismissedFlows: {},
            setup: null, setupOpen: false, setupTick: 0, encryptDefault: null, firstSent: false, encryptBusy: false,
            lingering: {}, seenIncoming: {},
            fileOn: { open: false, item: null, value: null, busy: false },
            peopleBox: { open: false, title: '', people: [] }, infoBox: { open: false, item: null, inThread: false, event: null, members: [], loading: false },
            quickReactions: QUICK_REACTIONS, levels: LEVELS,
            // Send later and Remind me (phase 15): the time asked, what it is for (onPick, onClear), the room's scheduled list
            // and the texts of this device's held drafts, opened here
            whenBox: { open: false, kind: 'send', title: '', note: '', current: null, onPick: null, onClear: null }, scheduledBox: { open: false }, heldTexts: {}
        };
    },
    computed: {
        self() { return this; },
        // ---- scheduled messages and reminders (phase 15; moqui.chat.state.schedule, read by Chat) ----
        scheduleState() { return (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.schedule) || { scheduledList: [], reminderList: [] }; },
        scheduledHere() { return (this.scheduleState.scheduledList || []).filter((row) => row.chatRoomId === this.roomId); },
        scheduledLine() { return moqui.chat.scheduledLine(this.scheduleState.scheduledList, this.roomId); },
        scheduledLineText() {
            const line = this.scheduledLine;
            if (!line.total) return '';
            if (line.waiting === 1) return fill(t('Scheduled: {when}'), { when: this.whenText(line.next) });
            if (line.waiting > 1) return fill(t('{count} scheduled messages'), { count: line.waiting });
            if (line.late) return t('A scheduled message was sent late');
            return t('Scheduled messages');
        },
        scheduledFailedText() { return fill(t('{count} not sent'), { count: this.scheduledLine.failed }); },
        // archived by me until a message after the archive
        archivedByMe() {
            const seq = this.member && this.member.archivedEventSeq;
            if (seq == null) return false;
            const last = this.events.reduce((max, event) => (event.type === 'message' ? Math.max(max, Number(event.eventSeq) || 0) : max), 0);
            return last <= Number(seq);
        },
        isDirect() { return !!this.room && this.room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtDirect'; },
        // an end-to-end encrypted room (C7): its messages are encrypted and decrypted in this browser
        sealed() { return !!this.room && !!this.room.encrypted; },
        // disappearing messages (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 16): the room's timer, and why it has none (a bridge cannot delete there)
        timerSeconds() { return (this.room && Number(this.room.messageTimerSeconds)) || 0; },
        timerLabel() { return moqui.chat.expiry.label(this.timerSeconds, t); },
        timerShort() { return moqui.chat.expiry.short(this.timerSeconds, t); },
        timerBlocked() {
            if (!this.room) return null;
            if (this.room.bridged || this.room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtExternal') return 'bridged';
            return this.room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtRecord' ? 'recordRoom' : null;
        },
        canSetTimer() { return this.isMember && !(this.room && this.room.archivedDate) && !this.timerBlocked && (this.isDirect || this.canModerate); },
        timerOptions() { return moqui.chat.expiry.options(t); },
        timerBridgedText() { return fill(t('This room is bridged to {networks}: a message that went there cannot be deleted there, so it has no timer.'), { networks: this.bridgeNames || t('another network') }); },
        // a call from the room, where the server holds calls (config.calls) and the user may post in it
        // a call from the room, where the server holds calls and the user may post, with someone on this server to ring (a
        // bridged or texting room's other side is on another network: no empty call)
        canCall() { return !!(moqui.call && moqui.config && moqui.config.calls && this.access && this.access.canPost && this.room && !this.room.archivedDate) && this.callees.length > 0; },
        callees() { return this.members.filter((person) => person.userId && !person.isAgent && person.userId !== (this.me && this.me.userId)); },
        isMember() { return !!this.access.isMember; },
        canPost() { return !!this.access.canPost; },
        // Spam & blocked (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 11): my room's filter (spam, blocked), what the banner says, the menu's Block
        filtered() { return this.member && this.member.filterEnumId ? ({ CmfSpam: 'spam', CmfBlocked: 'blocked' })[this.member.filterEnumId] || null : null; },
        filteredText() {
            if (this.filtered === 'spam') return t('This conversation looks like spam. It does not notify you, and its links do not open.');
            const kind = this.block && this.block.blockKind;
            if (kind === 'person') return fill(t('You blocked {name}. Their messages do not notify you; unblock them to write here.'), { name: this.block.blockedName || '' });
            if (kind === 'number') return t('You blocked this number: its texts do not notify you and its calls are refused.');
            return t('You blocked this conversation: it does not notify you.');
        },
        blockLabel() {
            const kind = this.block && this.block.blockKind;
            if (kind === 'person') return fill(t('Block {name}'), { name: this.block.blockedName || '' });
            return kind === 'number' ? t('Block this number') : t('Block this conversation');
        },
        canModerate() { return !!this.access.canModerate; },
        isOwner() { return !!this.access.isOwner; },
        // invite links (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17): a private room's moderators, a public room's members
        inviteOffered() {
            const type = this.room && this.room.roomTypeEnumId;
            if (!this.access.isMember || this.access.isArchived || (this.room && this.room.recordEntityName)) return false;
            return (type === 'CrtPrivate' && this.canModerate) || type === 'CrtPublic';
        },
        textMemberCount() { return this.members.filter((person) => person.textMember).length; },
        textCostLine() { return moqui.chat && moqui.chat.texts ? moqui.chat.texts.costLine(this.textMemberCount) : ''; },
        roomBridges() { return (this.room && this.room.bridges) || []; },
        directionOptions() {
            return [{ value: 'CrbBoth', label: t('Both ways') }, { value: 'CrbIn', label: t('Only in: from there to here') }, { value: 'CrbOut', label: t('Only out: from here to there') }];
        },
        // a bridged room (C1): what its bridges carry (an edit, a delete or a reaction one of them cannot carry is not offered)
        bridgeCaps() { return (this.room && this.room.bridgeCapabilities) || { edit: true, delete: true, reaction: true }; },
        bridgeNames() {
            const names = ((this.room && this.room.bridges) || []).map((bridge) => bridge.networkName || bridge.name).filter((name) => name);
            return Array.from(new Set(names)).join(', ');
        },
        bridgeTooltip() { return fill(t('Messages here also go to {names}'), { names: this.bridgeNames }); },
        displayName() { return this.room ? (this.room.displayName || this.room.roomName || this.room.chatRoomId) : ''; },
        roomIcon() { return moqui.chat.roomIcon(this.room); },
        // the room's E2EE label (Comms-Messaging §6.2): its state, icon, banner and composer hint, from the room, its bridges
        // and, in an encrypted room, its devices' trust
        label() { return moqui.chat.e2eeLabel(this.room, this.trust); },
        bannerHidden() { void this.bannerTick; return !!this.room && moqui.chat.bannerClosed(this.roomId, this.label.state); },
        // who could not read my messages (COM-UI-013), as this browser keeps it for the account: {eventSeq: text}
        leftOutBySeq() { void this.leftOutTick; return this.sealed ? moqui.chat.leftOutOf(this.roomId) : {}; },
        verifications() { return (moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.state && moqui.crypto.state.verifications) || []; },
        // ---- E2EE by default (Comms-Messaging §6.5) ----
        otherIds() { return this.callees.map((person) => person.userId); },
        // an encrypted direct room's plain one with the same people, and a plain one's encrypted one
        plainSibling() { return this.sealed && this.isDirect ? moqui.chat.directRoomFor(this.rooms, this.otherIds, this.me && this.me.userId, true) : null; },
        encryptedSibling() {
            if (this.sealed || !this.isDirect || this.compact) return null;
            const found = moqui.chat.directRoomFor(this.rooms, this.otherIds, this.me && this.me.userId);
            return found && found !== this.roomId ? found : null;
        },
        // Start an encrypted chat: a plain direct room whose people all have a crypto device (encryptionDefault), or Open the one there is
        encryptOffered() {
            return !!this.room && this.isDirect && !this.sealed && !this.compact && !this.room.bridged && this.room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtExternal'
                && (!!this.encryptedSibling || this.encryptDefault === true);
        },
        earlierText() { return fill(t('Earlier messages with {name} are in a chat that is not end-to-end encrypted.'), { name: this.displayName }); },
        setupNeeded() { void this.setupTick; return this.sealed && !this.cryptoElsewhere && moqui.chat.setupNeeded(this.setup); },
        setupBar() { void this.setupTick; return !!this.room && this.setupNeeded && !moqui.chat.setupLater(this.setup && this.setup.deviceId); },
        backupHint() {
            void this.setupTick;
            return !!this.room && this.sealed && !this.setupNeeded && !!this.setup && !(this.setup.otherDevices || []).length && moqui.chat.backupHinted(this.setup);
        },
        verifyTitle() { return fill(t('Verify {name}'), { name: this.verifyBox.userId ? this.nameOf(this.verifyBox.userId) : '' }); },
        verifyDevices() {
            const person = this.trust && this.trust.people && this.verifyBox.userId ? this.trust.people[this.verifyBox.userId] : null;
            return (person && person.devices) || [];
        },
        verifyFlows() { return this.verifications.filter((flow) => flow.otherUserId === this.verifyBox.userId && !this.dismissedFlows[flow.flowId]); },
        // another person's request to verify, not yet answered here; one that ended stays a moment, its end shown
        incomingFlows() {
            const me = this.me && this.me.userId;
            return this.sealed ? this.verifications.filter((flow) => !flow.weStarted && flow.otherUserId && flow.otherUserId !== me && !this.dismissedFlows[flow.flowId]
                && ((!flow.done && !flow.cancelled) || this.lingering[flow.flowId])) : [];
        },
        problemLines() { return moqui.chat.problemsText(this.problemBox.problems, (id) => this.nameOf(id)); },
        recordLabel() { const record = this.room && this.room.record; return record ? [record.typeLabel, record.title].filter((part) => part).join(' · ') : ''; },
        roomKindText() {
            if (!this.room) return '';
            const type = this.room.roomTypeEnumId;
            if (type === 'CrtPublic') return t('Public room');
            if (type === 'CrtPrivate') return t('Private room');
            if (type === 'CrtRecord') return t('Record room');
            return fill(t('Group message with {count} people'), { count: this.members.length });
        },
        startText() {
            if (!this.room) return '';
            if (this.isDirect) return this.room.otherUserId ? fill(t('This is the start of your conversation with {name}.'), { name: this.displayName })
                : t('This is the start of your group conversation.');
            if (this.room.record) return fill(t('This room is about {record}. Everyone who can see the record can read it.'), { record: this.recordLabel });
            return fill(t('This is the start of {name}.'), { name: this.displayName }) + (this.room.topic ? ' ' + this.room.topic : '');
        },
        narrow() { return this.compact || (this.width > 0 && this.width < moqui.chat.NARROW_PX); },
        // a phone messaging layout: mine on the right, the others on the left, each in a bubble (the phone home, the stacked Chat, a narrow room)
        useBubbles() { return this.bubbles || this.narrow; },
        // the attach choice of a phone (camera, gallery, file): bubbles on a mobile platform, not the desktop's narrow tray
        phoneAttach() { return this.useBubbles && !!(this.$q.platform && this.$q.platform.is && this.$q.platform.is.mobile); },
        sideOverlay() { return this.compact || (this.width > 0 && this.width < moqui.chat.SIDE_OVERLAY_PX); },
        sideTitle() {
            if (this.detailsOpen) return this.displayName;
            return { thread: t('Thread'), search: t('Search in the room'), record: t('The record'), threads: t('Threads') }[this.side] || '';
        },
        // the side pane is the room's details, on one of its tabs (Comms-Messaging §5.1)
        detailsOpen() { return DETAIL_TABS.includes(this.side); },
        detailTabs() {
            const labels = { members: fill(t('People ({count})'), { count: this.members.length }), media: t('Media'), files: t('Files'), voice: t('Voice'),
                links: t('Links'), reactions: t('Reactions'), pinned: t('Pinned') };
            return DETAIL_TABS.map((name) => ({ name, label: labels[name] }));
        },
        reactionChips() { return [{ value: false, label: t('All') }, { value: true, label: t('To my messages') }]; },
        viewerFile() { return this.viewer.list[this.viewer.index] || null; },
        // the browser is offline: sends wait in the outbox, files and polls wait for the connection
        offline() { return !!moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.online === false; },
        // the desktop client's server out of reach: what needs it says so (never on the web)
        noConnection() { return noConnection(); },
        // an encrypted room in a desktop client's app window, whose shell owns the crypto device: it opens in Chat there
        cryptoElsewhere() { return this.sealed && !!(moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.elsewhere && moqui.crypto.elsewhere()); },
        // this page's crypto device is open: an encrypted room's trust can be asked of it
        cryptoReady() { return !!(moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.state && moqui.crypto.state.status === 'ready'); },
        // the outbox's messages of this room and of the open thread (the chat store's state, so they follow other tabs)
        pendingMain() { void (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.outbox && moqui.chat.state.sending); return moqui.chat && moqui.chat.pendingIn ? moqui.chat.pendingIn(this.roomId, null) : []; },
        pendingThread() {
            void (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.outbox && moqui.chat.state.sending);
            return moqui.chat && moqui.chat.pendingIn && this.threadView.rootSeq != null ? moqui.chat.pendingIn(this.roomId, this.threadView.rootSeq) : [];
        },
        threadChips() { return [{ value: false, label: t('All') }, { value: true, label: t('Mine') }]; },
        canMakePoll() {
            const options = this.pollBox.options.map((text) => String(text || '').trim()).filter((text) => text);
            return !!String(this.pollBox.question || '').trim() && options.length >= 2 && !this.pollBox.busy;
        },
        // a text or a bridged network's message says so (Comms-Messaging §6.2)
        composerPlaceholder() { return this.label.hint || fill(this.isDirect ? t('Message {name}') : t('Message {name}… @ to mention'), { name: this.displayName }); },
        visibilityOptions() {
            if (this.room && this.room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtRecord')
                return [{ value: 'CrvRecord', label: t('Anyone who can see the record') }, { value: 'CrvMembers', label: t('Members only: added by a member') }];
            return [{ value: 'CrvMembers', label: t('Members only: added by a member (private)') }, { value: 'CrvUsers', label: t('Anyone in the organization (public)') }];
        },
        readersBySeq() {
            const out = {};
            if (this.prefs.readReceipts === false || !this.events.length) return out;
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const seqs = this.events.filter((event) => event.type === 'message').map((event) => Number(event.eventSeq));
            for (const person of this.members) {
                if (!person.userId || person.userId === me || person.isAgent) continue;
                const read = Number(person.lastReadEventSeq || 0);
                if (!read) continue;
                let at = null;
                for (const seq of seqs) { if (seq <= read) at = seq; else break; }
                if (at == null) continue;
                (out[at] = out[at] || []).push({ userId: person.userId, name: person.name });
            }
            return out;
        },
        // a phone or tablet (Quasar's platform): who reacted or voted shows on a long press, not in a tooltip
        mobile() { return !!(this.$q.platform && this.$q.platform.is && this.$q.platform.is.mobile); },
        // the lines of the open Info (moqui.chat.messageInfo, Comms-Messaging §4)
        infoLines() {
            const box = this.infoBox;
            if (!box.item || !moqui.chat || !moqui.chat.messageInfo) return [];
            const info = moqui.chat.messageInfo(box.event || box.item.event, box.members, { me: this.me.userId, receipts: this.prefs.readReceipts !== false,
                inThread: box.inThread });
            return moqui.chat.messageInfoLines(info, fullTime);
        },
        items() { return this.buildItems(this.events, { divider: true, readers: true }); },
        threadItems() { return this.buildItems(this.threadView.events, { divider: false, readers: false }); },
        typingText() {
            void this.tick;
            if (!moqui.chat || this.prefs.typing === false) return '';
            const ids = moqui.chat.typingIn(this.roomId).filter((id) => id !== this.me.userId);
            if (!ids.length) return '';
            const names = ids.map((id) => this.nameOf(id).split(' ')[0]);
            if (names.length === 1) return fill(t('{name} is typing…'), { name: names[0] });
            if (names.length === 2) return fill(t('{a} and {b} are typing…'), { a: names[0], b: names[1] });
            return t('Several people are typing…');
        }
    },
    watch: {
        seq(value) { if (value && this.state === 'ready') this.jumpTo(Number(value)); },
        // the room's timer, for the encrypted room's key rotation (WebrootCrypto.js)
        timerSeconds(value) { moqui.chat.expiry.timers[this.roomId] = value || 0; },
        cryptoReady(value) { if (value) this.loadTrust(); },
        // the room shown: its first message (a dm link's) sent through the room's own send, sealed in an encrypted room
        state(value) {
            if (value !== 'ready') return;
            if (this.firstMessage && !this.firstSent) {
                this.firstSent = true;
                const body = this.firstMessage;
                // not sent here (an app window holds no keys for an encrypted room, or the outbox refused it): the text stays in
                // the composer, or is said when the room opens elsewhere
                const keep = () => {
                    const composer = this.composers && this.composers.main;
                    if (composer && !this.cryptoElsewhere) composer.body = body;
                    else moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('Your message was not sent: open the chat in Chat to send it') }]);
                };
                if (this.cryptoElsewhere) { keep(); this.$emit('first-sent'); }
                else this.sendMessage({ body }).catch(keep).then(() => this.$emit('first-sent'));
            }
            this.loadEncryptDefault();
        },
        // a verification with someone of this room done: their check, and the room's
        verifications(list) {
            if (!this.sealed) return;
            this.noteIncoming(list);
            if (list.some((flow) => flow.done && !this.dismissedFlows['done:' + flow.flowId])) this.verificationsDone(list);
        },
        thread(value) {
            if (this.state !== 'ready') return;
            if (value && Number(value) !== this.threadView.rootSeq) this.openThread(Number(value), true);
            else if (!value && this.side === 'thread') this.side = null;
        }
    },
    methods: {
        t,
        fill,
        shortWhen,
        sizeText,
        isImage,
        isVideo,
        isAudio,
        fileIcon,
        url(name) { return this.base + '/' + name; },
        get(name, params) {
            return moqui.request(this.url(name), { params: params || {} }).then((result) => this.openPage(result.json || {}), (err) => {
                // the desktop client offline, for what it does not keep: said where it shows (the gap, the room), not as an error
                if (!(moqui.unreachable && moqui.unreachable(err))) moqui.handleAjaxError(err);
                throw err;
            });
        },
        // a timeline page of the desktop client's store (offline): where the stretch it holds ends, the server may have more
        gapsOf(page, before, after) {
            const offline = page && moqui.isPlainObject(page.offline) ? page.offline : null;
            if (before) this.gapBefore = !!(offline && offline.gapBefore) && !page.hasMoreBefore;
            if (after) this.gapAfter = !!(offline && offline.gapAfter) && !page.hasMoreAfter;
        },
        // the encrypted events of an answer (a timeline page, a room view) decrypted in place before they are shown (C7)
        openPage(json) {
            const lists = [json.eventList, json.timeline && json.timeline.eventList].filter((list) => Array.isArray(list) && list.length);
            if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.expiry) moqui.chat.expiry.seen(json, (json.room && json.room.chatRoomId) || this.roomId);
            if (!lists.length || !moqui.chat || !moqui.chat.openEvents) return json;
            const roomId = (json.room && json.room.chatRoomId) || this.roomId;
            return Promise.all(lists.map((list) => moqui.chat.openEvents(roomId, list, (file) => this.sealedUrl(file)))).then(() => json);
        },
        post(name, params) {
            if (needsConnection()) return Promise.reject({ status: 0, offline: true });
            return moqui.request(this.url(name), { method: 'POST', params: params || {} }).then((result) => {
                const json = result.json || {};
                if (json.messageInfos && json.messageInfos.length) moqui.notifyMessages(json.messageInfos, json.errors);
                return json;
            }, (err) => {
                if (moqui.unreachable && moqui.unreachable(err)) needsConnection(); else moqui.handleAjaxError(err);
                throw err;
            });
        },
        // an action that needs the server, while the desktop client cannot reach it: said, and not taken
        needsConnection() { return needsConnection(); },
        // the members' userIds, who get an encrypted room's keys
        memberIds() { return this.members.filter((person) => person.userId).map((person) => person.userId); },
        // ---- the room's E2EE label (Comms-Messaging §6.2) ----
        // an encrypted room's devices: verified or not (the lock's check, Verify), and who the next message leaves out. Asked
        // only of a crypto device that is open (the room's messages open it), never to open one for the label.
        loadTrust() {
            const crypto = moqui.crypto;
            if (!this.sealed || this.cryptoElsewhere || !crypto || !crypto.roomTrust || !crypto.state || crypto.state.status !== 'ready') return;
            this.loadSetup();
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            crypto.roomTrust(roomId, this.memberIds()).then((answer) => {
                if (roomId === this.roomId) this.trust = moqui.chat.trustOf(answer, this.me.userId);
            }, () => { if (roomId === this.roomId) this.trust = null; });
        },
        verificationsDone(list) {
            const dismissed = Object.assign({}, this.dismissedFlows);
            list.filter((flow) => flow.done).forEach((flow) => { dismissed['done:' + flow.flowId] = true; });
            this.dismissedFlows = dismissed;
            setTimeout(() => this.loadTrust(), 500);
        },
        closeBanner() { moqui.chat.closeBanner(this.roomId, this.label.state); this.bannerTick += 1; },
        // ---- a new device (Comms-Messaging §6.5): whether it is set up, the card, Not now ----
        loadSetup() {
            const crypto = moqui.crypto;
            if (!this.sealed || this.cryptoElsewhere || !crypto || !crypto.setupStatus || !crypto.state || crypto.state.status !== 'ready') return;
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            crypto.setupStatus().then((status) => {
                if (roomId !== this.roomId) return;
                this.setup = status;
                this.setupTick += 1;
            }, () => null);
        },
        openSetup() { this.setupOpen = true; this.loadSetup(); },
        setupLaterNow() { moqui.chat.putSetupLater(this.setup && this.setup.deviceId); this.setupTick += 1; },
        closeBackupHint() { moqui.chat.closeSetupHint(); this.setupTick += 1; },
        // a plain direct room: whether its people all have a crypto device, so it offers Start an encrypted chat (one bit)
        loadEncryptDefault() {
            if (!this.room || !this.isDirect || this.sealed || this.compact || this.encryptDefault !== null || !this.otherIds.length) return;
            this.encryptDefault = false;
            this.get('encryptionDefault', { userIds: this.otherIds.join(',') }).then((json) => { this.encryptDefault = json.encrypted === true; }, () => null);
        },
        // the encrypted direct chat of the same people, made or opened (createDirect with encrypted); the plain one stays
        startEncrypted() {
            if (needsConnection() || this.encryptBusy) return;
            if (this.encryptedSibling) { this.go(this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(this.encryptedSibling)); return; }
            // one at a time: a second click would race the first to make the room (the server answers the oldest anyway)
            this.encryptBusy = true;
            this.post('createDirect', { userIds: this.otherIds.join(','), encrypted: 'true' }).then((json) => {
                this.encryptBusy = false;
                if (!json || !json.chatRoomId) return;
                this.$emit('changed');
                this.go(this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(json.chatRoomId));
            }, () => { this.encryptBusy = false; });
        },
        // Verify: My devices, where this user's own devices are verified by emoji or QR code
        openDevices() { this.go(this.linkBase.replace(/\/Chat$/, '/Settings/Devices')); },
        // ---- verifying people (COM-UI-013, §6.1 rule 3) ----
        personVerified(userId) { return !!(this.sealed && userId && this.trust && this.trust.people && this.trust.people[userId] && this.trust.people[userId].verified); },
        personChanged(userId) { return !!(this.sealed && userId && this.trust && this.trust.people && this.trust.people[userId] && this.trust.people[userId].changed); },
        canVerify(person) {
            return this.sealed && this.cryptoReady && !this.cryptoElsewhere && !!person.userId && person.userId !== this.me.userId && !person.external
                && !this.personVerified(person.userId);
        },
        openVerify(userId) {
            this.verifyBox = { open: true, userId };
            this.loadTrust();
        },
        // Verify from the banner or a message: the first other person with a device not verified, else My devices (my own)
        verifySomeone(userId) {
            const target = userId || moqui.chat.verifyTarget(this.trust, this.me.userId);
            if (target) this.openVerify(target); else this.openDevices();
        },
        verifyDevice(device) {
            const userId = this.verifyBox.userId;
            moqui.crypto.verifyDevice(userId, device.deviceId).catch((err) => moqui.notifyMessages([], (err && err.errors) || t('The verification did not start')));
        },
        retryVerify(flow) {
            const device = this.verifyDevices.find((one) => one.deviceId === flow.otherDeviceId) || this.verifyDevices.find((one) => !one.verified);
            if (device) this.verifyDevice(device);
        },
        // a match confirmed: the room's trust read again once the other side is done
        verifyStepped(action) { if (action === 'confirm' || action === 'qrConfirm') setTimeout(() => this.loadTrust(), 1500); },
        // closed: an open request is cancelled (the other person sees it end), not only hidden
        dismissIncoming() {
            const dismissed = Object.assign({}, this.dismissedFlows);
            this.incomingFlows.forEach((flow) => {
                dismissed[flow.flowId] = true;
                if (!flow.done && !flow.cancelled && moqui.crypto) moqui.crypto.verification(flow.flowId, 'cancel').catch(() => null);
            });
            this.dismissedFlows = dismissed;
        },
        // who asks: a member by name; someone else by name when known, said not to be in this room
        incomingWho(flow) {
            const id = flow.otherUserId;
            if (this.members.some((person) => person.userId === id)) return this.nameOf(id);
            return this.names[id] ? fill(t('{name}, not in this room'), { name: this.names[id] }) : t('someone outside this room');
        },
        // an incoming request that ended shows Verified or Cancelled for a moment, then goes
        noteIncoming(list) {
            const me = this.me && this.me.userId;
            const seen = Object.assign({}, this.seenIncoming);
            for (const flow of list) {
                if (flow.weStarted || !flow.otherUserId || flow.otherUserId === me || this.dismissedFlows[flow.flowId]) continue;
                if (!flow.done && !flow.cancelled) { seen[flow.flowId] = true; continue; }
                if (seen[flow.flowId] && !this.lingering[flow.flowId]) {
                    this.lingering = Object.assign({}, this.lingering, { [flow.flowId]: true });
                    setTimeout(() => { this.dismissedFlows = Object.assign({}, this.dismissedFlows, { [flow.flowId]: true }); }, 2500);
                }
            }
            this.seenIncoming = seen;
        },
        // a send refused for a verified person's change: say it, with Verify and Send anyway (retry sends it again)
        askProblems(problems, retry) { this.problemBox = { open: true, problems: problems || [], retry, busy: false }; },
        // Verify the person of one problem (my own new device: My devices); the send waits for the next Send
        verifyProblem(problem) {
            this.problemBox = Object.assign({}, this.problemBox, { open: false });
            if (problem && problem.userId !== this.me.userId) this.openVerify(problem.userId); else this.openDevices();
        },
        sendAnyway() {
            const box = this.problemBox;
            box.busy = true;
            moqui.crypto.acceptProblems(this.roomId, box.problems).then(() => {
                this.problemBox = { open: false, problems: [], retry: null, busy: false };
                this.loadTrust();
                // the retry says its own refusal (or asks again): nothing more here
                if (box.retry) Promise.resolve().then(box.retry).catch(() => null);
            }, (err) => { box.busy = false; moqui.notifyMessages([], (err && err.errors) || t('This message could not be encrypted')); });
        },
        // a sealed change refused for a verified person's change (§6.1 rule 3): the same question, then retry; else said
        sealRefused(err, retry) {
            if (err && err.reasonCode === 'verifiedUserProblem') this.askProblems(err.problems, retry);
            else moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: (err && (err.errors || err.message)) || t('This message could not be encrypted') }]);
        },
        undecryptableText(item) { return moqui.chat.undecryptableText(item.withheld, item.senderName, this.setupNeeded); },
        bridgeEncryptionText(encryption) {
            if (encryption === 'EndToEnd') return t('End-to-end encrypted through the bridge');
            if (encryption === 'BridgeDecrypted') return t('End-to-end encrypted on that network; the bridge here decrypts it');
            if (encryption === 'Transport') return t('Encrypted in transit only: the network can read it');
            if (encryption === 'NoneByNetwork') return t('Not encrypted: that network has no end-to-end encryption, and its servers can read it');
            return t('Not encrypted: the network and its providers can read it');
        },
        // new room keys came (from a member, or the key backup): the messages that could not be read are tried again
        onRoomKeys() {
            if (!this.sealed || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            this.loadSetup();
            const lists = [this.events, this.threadView.events].filter((list) => list.some((item) => item.undecryptable || (item.encryptedReactions || []).length));
            lists.forEach((list) => moqui.chat.openEvents(this.roomId, list.filter((item) => item.undecryptable), (file) => this.sealedUrl(file)));
        },
        // the room's call, voice or video: a direct room calls the person, a group room starts a group call its members join
        // from the chat (one going on is opened to join); an encrypted room's call is end-to-end encrypted (§6.1 rule 4)
        startCall(video) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            // asked so, a browser that cannot is refused before anyone rings
            if (moqui.call) moqui.call.startCall(Object.assign({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, video: video !== false }, this.sealed ? { requireE2ee: true } : {}));
        },
        callTip(video) {
            if (this.isDirect) return fill(video ? t('Video call {name}') : t('Voice call {name}'), { name: this.displayName });
            if (this.room && this.room.bridged) return video ? t('Video call: the people on this server in the room ring, not those on the bridged network') : t('Voice call: the people on this server in the room ring, not those on the bridged network');
            return video ? t('Video call: everyone in the room rings, and members can join') : t('Voice call: everyone in the room rings, and members can join');
        },
        go(target) { if (target) this.$root.setUrl(target); },
        domId(seq, inThread) { return 'chat-' + this.uid + (inThread ? '-t-' : '-m-') + seq; },
        nameOf(userId, fallback) {
            if (!userId) return fallback || t('Someone');
            if (this.names[userId]) return this.names[userId];
            const person = this.members.find((item) => item.userId === userId);
            return (person && person.name) || fallback || userId;
        },
        mergeNames(map) { if (map) Object.keys(map).forEach((id) => { if (map[id]) this.names[id] = map[id]; }); },
        presenceOf(userId) { return moqui.chat ? moqui.chat.presenceOf(userId) : ''; },
        presenceText(userId) {
            const dot = this.presenceOf(userId) || 'offline';
            const status = moqui.chat ? moqui.chat.statusOf(userId) : null;
            const text = { online: t('Active'), away: t('Away'), dnd: t('Do not disturb'), offline: t('Offline') }[dot] || '';
            return status && status.statusText ? text + ' · ' + (status.emoji ? status.emoji + ' ' : '') + status.statusText : text;
        },
        repliesText(count) { return count === 1 ? t('1 reply') : fill(t('{count} replies'), { count }); },
        filesText(event) { return (event.attachments || []).map((file) => file.fileName).join(', '); },
        reactorsText(reaction) { return (reaction.userIds || []).map((id) => (id === this.me.userId ? t('You') : this.nameOf(id))).join(', '); },
        // the rows shown: day separators, the "new messages" divider, system rows in words and messages grouped by sender
        buildItems(events, opts) {
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const out = [];
            let prev = null;
            let lastDay = null;
            let dividerPlaced = false;
            for (const event of events) {
                const sent = Number(event.sentDate || 0);
                const day = moqui.l10n.dayKey(sent);
                if (day !== lastDay) { out.push({ kind: 'day', key: 'd' + event.eventSeq, label: dayLabel(sent) }); lastDay = day; prev = null; }
                if (opts.divider && !dividerPlaced && this.dividerSeq != null && Number(event.eventSeq) > this.dividerSeq && event.type === 'message' && event.senderUserId !== me) {
                    out.push({ kind: 'unread', key: 'unread' });
                    dividerPlaced = true;
                    prev = null;
                }
                // a message of someone the user blocked: one quiet line for a run of them (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 11)
                if (moqui.chat.hiddenLine(out, event)) { prev = null; continue; }
                if (event.type !== 'message') {
                    const words = systemText(event, (id) => this.nameOf(id));
                    out.push({ kind: 'system', key: 'e' + event.eventSeq, eventSeq: event.eventSeq, text: words[0], icon: words[1], time: timeText(sent),
                        target: event.type === 'pin' && event.content && event.content.pinned ? event.relatesToEventSeq : null });
                    prev = null;
                    continue;
                }
                const grouped = !!prev && (prev.event.senderActorId || prev.senderUserId) === (event.senderActorId || event.senderUserId)
                    && sent - prev.sentDate < GROUP_MILLIS && event.replyToEventSeq == null;
                const item = { kind: 'message', key: 'e' + event.eventSeq, eventSeq: Number(event.eventSeq), event, senderUserId: event.senderUserId,
                    senderName: this.nameOf(event.senderUserId, event.senderName), sentDate: sent, timeText: timeText(sent), timeShort: timeText(sent), fullTime: fullTime(sent),
                    bodyHtml: event.redacted ? null : (event.body ? decorateBody(event.body, me) : null), redacted: !!event.redacted, removedLabel: event.removedLabel,
                    undecryptable: !event.redacted && !!event.undecryptable, withheld: event.withheld || null, verifiedSender: event.verifiedSender,
                    edited: !!event.edited, editedText: event.editedDate ? fill(t('Edited {when}'), { when: fullTime(event.editedDate) }) : t('Edited'),
                    attachments: event.viewOnce ? [] : (event.attachments || []), records: event.records || [], reactions: event.reactions || [],
                    expireDate: event.expireDate || null, viewOnce: event.viewOnce || null, viewOnceFile: event.viewOnce ? (event.attachments || [])[0] || null : null,
                    forwardOf: event.forwardOf ? Object.assign({}, event.forwardOf, { body: event.forwardOf.body && moqui.chat && moqui.chat.ownImages ? moqui.chat.ownImages(event.forwardOf.body) : event.forwardOf.body }) : null, poll: event.poll || null, linkPreviews: event.linkPreviews || [],
                    replyTo: event.replyToEventSeq != null ? this.replyOf(event) : null, threadReplyCount: Number(event.threadReplyCount || 0),
                    threadLastDate: event.threadLastDate, pinned: !!event.pinned, grouped, mine: event.senderUserId === me,
                    highlight: this.highlightSeq === Number(event.eventSeq), readers: opts.readers ? (this.readersBySeq[event.eventSeq] || null) : null };
                out.push(item);
                prev = item;
            }
            return out;
        },
        replyOf(event) {
            const loaded = this.events.find((item) => Number(item.eventSeq) === Number(event.replyToEventSeq));
            // a reply to someone the user blocked shows nothing of the message (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 11)
            if ((loaded && loaded.hidden) || (event.replyTo && event.replyTo.hidden)) return { eventSeq: event.replyToEventSeq, senderName: null, redacted: false,
                hidden: true, snippet: t('Hidden: a message from someone you blocked') };
            if (loaded) return { eventSeq: loaded.eventSeq, senderName: this.nameOf(loaded.senderUserId, loaded.senderName), redacted: !!loaded.redacted,
                snippet: this.snippetOf(loaded) };
            if (event.replyTo) return Object.assign({}, event.replyTo, { senderName: this.nameOf(event.replyTo.senderUserId, event.replyTo.senderName) });
            return { eventSeq: event.replyToEventSeq, senderName: null, redacted: false, snippet: t('An earlier message') };
        },
        snippetOf(event) {
            const text = String(event.bodyText || plainOf(event.body) || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
            return (text.length > 100 ? text.slice(0, 99) + '…' : text) || this.filesText(event);
        },

        // ---- loading and paging ----
        load() {
            this.state = 'loading';
            const aroundSeq = this.seq ? Number(this.seq) : null;
            this.get('roomView', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, aroundSeq: aroundSeq || '', limit: 50 }).then((json) => {
                if (!json.room) { this.state = 'missing'; return; }
                this.applyMeta(json);
                const page = json.timeline || {};
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                this.events = page.eventList || [];
                this.hasMoreBefore = !!page.hasMoreBefore;
                this.hasMoreAfter = !!page.hasMoreAfter;
                this.gapsOf(page, true, true);
                this.myLastRead = Number((json.member && json.member.lastReadEventSeq) || 0);
                const last = Number(json.room.lastEventSeq || 0);
                this.dividerSeq = this.isMember && this.myLastRead < last && this.events.some((event) => Number(event.eventSeq) > this.myLastRead
                    && event.type === 'message' && event.senderUserId !== this.me.userId) ? this.myLastRead : null;
                this.state = 'ready';
                if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.openRoom(this.roomId);
                this.opened = true;
                this.$emit('read', this.roomId);
                this.$nextTick(() => {
                    if (aroundSeq) this.scrollToSeq(aroundSeq, true);
                    else if (this.dividerSeq != null) this.scrollToDivider();
                    else this.scrollToBottom();
                    this.maybeMarkRead();
                    if (this.thread) this.openThread(Number(this.thread), true);
                    else if (!this.compact) this.focusComposer();
                });
            }, (err) => { this.state = moqui.unreachable && moqui.unreachable(err) ? 'unreachable' : 'missing'; });
        },
        applyMeta(json) {
            this.room = json.room;
            this.member = json.member || null;
            this.access = json.access || {};
            this.members = json.memberList || [];
            this.members.forEach((person) => { if (person.name) this.names[person.userId] = person.name; });
            if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.watchUsers(this.members.map((person) => person.userId));
            this.loadTrust();
            this.loadBlock();
            this.loadJoinCount();
        },
        // the join requests a moderator sees (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17): the banner, moved by the room's pushes
        openInvites() { if (!needsConnection()) this.joinUi.links = true; },
        loadJoinCount() {
            if (!this.canModerate || noConnection()) { this.joinUi.count = 0; return; }
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            this.get('joinRequestCount', { chatRoomId: roomId }).then((json) => { if (roomId === this.roomId) this.joinUi.count = Number(json.pendingCount || 0); }, () => {});
        },
        // what Block blocks and why a room is in Spam (roomBlock): for a phone room or a direct chat
        loadBlock() {
            const type = this.room && this.room.roomTypeEnumId;
            if (!(type === 'CrtExternal' || type === 'CrtDirect') || noConnection()) { this.block = null; return; }
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            this.get('roomBlock', { chatRoomId: roomId }).then((json) => { if (roomId === this.roomId) this.block = json && json.blockKind !== undefined ? json : null; },
                () => { this.block = null; });
        },
        // Block, Unblock, Not spam and Report spam; the room and the rail read again
        blockAction(name) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            const run = (extra) => this.post(name, Object.assign({ chatRoomId: this.roomId }, extra || {})).then(() => { this.reloadMeta(); this.$emit('changed', this.roomId); }, () => {});
            const kind = this.block && this.block.blockKind;
            // a group text: hidden for me only, with a vote against each number I pick (none by default)
            if (name === 'reportSpam' && kind === 'room') {
                const numbers = (this.block && this.block.phoneNumberList) || [];
                return this.$q.dialog({ title: t('Report spam?'),
                    message: t('This group text is hidden for you only; nobody in it is told. Pick the numbers to report as spam, if any: each report counts toward marking a number spam for others here.'),
                    options: { type: 'checkbox', model: [], items: numbers.map((number) => ({ label: number, value: number })) },
                    ok: { label: t('Report spam'), color: 'negative', unelevated: true, noCaps: true }, cancel: { label: t('Cancel'), flat: true, noCaps: true } })
                    .onOk((picked) => run({ phoneNumbers: (picked || []).join(',') }));
            }
            if (name === 'reportSpam') return this.confirm(t('Report spam?'),
                t('The number is blocked for you: its calls are refused and its texts stay in Spam & blocked. Your report counts toward marking it spam for others here; your teammates on this number see this conversation in Spam only if nobody here has replied in it. Unblock takes the report back.'),
                t('Report spam'), true).then(() => run());
            if (name === 'blockRoom') return this.confirm(this.blockLabel + '?', this.block && this.block.blockKind === 'person'
                ? t('Their messages are hidden from you and do not notify you; they still see you in shared rooms, and are not told.')
                : kind === 'number' ? t('Its calls are refused, and its texts go to Spam & blocked without notifying you.')
                : t('This group text goes to Spam & blocked for you only; its numbers are not blocked.'),
                t('Block'), true).then(() => run());
            return run();
        },
        blockPerson(person) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.confirm(fill(t('Block {name}?'), { name: person.name || person.userId }), t('Their messages are hidden from you and do not notify you; they still see you in shared rooms, and are not told.'),
                t('Block'), true).then(() => this.post('blockUser', { userId: person.userId }).then(() => { this.reloadMeta(); this.$emit('changed', this.roomId); }, () => {}));
        },
        reloadMeta() {
            return this.get('room', { chatRoomId: this.roomId }).then((json) => { if (json.room) this.applyMeta(json); }, () => {});
        },
        loadOlder() {
            if (!this.hasMoreBefore || this.loadingOlder || !this.events.length) return;
            this.loadingOlder = true;
            const el = this.$refs.scroller;
            const fromEnd = el ? el.scrollHeight - el.scrollTop : 0;
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, beforeSeq: this.events[0].eventSeq, limit: 50 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                const have = new Set(this.events.map((event) => Number(event.eventSeq)));
                this.events = (page.eventList || []).filter((event) => !have.has(Number(event.eventSeq))).concat(this.events);
                this.hasMoreBefore = !!page.hasMoreBefore;
                this.gapsOf(page, true, false);
                this.loadingOlder = false;
                this.$nextTick(() => { if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight - fromEnd; });
            }, () => { this.loadingOlder = false; });
        },
        loadNewer() {
            if (!this.hasMoreAfter || this.loadingNewer || !this.events.length) return;
            this.loadingNewer = true;
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, afterSeq: this.events[this.events.length - 1].eventSeq, limit: 50 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                const have = new Set(this.events.map((event) => Number(event.eventSeq)));
                this.events = this.events.concat((page.eventList || []).filter((event) => !have.has(Number(event.eventSeq))));
                this.hasMoreAfter = !!page.hasMoreAfter;
                this.gapsOf(page, false, true);
                this.loadingNewer = false;
                if (!this.hasMoreAfter) this.maybeMarkRead();
            }, () => { this.loadingNewer = false; });
        },
        jumpTo(seq) {
            if (!seq) return;
            if (this.sideOverlay && this.side && this.side !== 'thread') this.side = null;
            const loaded = this.events.some((event) => Number(event.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
            if (loaded) { this.$nextTick(() => this.scrollToSeq(Number(seq), true)); return; }
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, aroundSeq: seq, limit: 50 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                this.events = page.eventList || [];
                this.hasMoreBefore = !!page.hasMoreBefore;
                this.hasMoreAfter = !!page.hasMoreAfter;
                this.gapsOf(page, true, true);
                this.$nextTick(() => this.scrollToSeq(Number(seq), true));
            }, () => {});
        },
        jumpToLatest() {
            this.newBelow = 0;
            if (!this.hasMoreAfter) { this.scrollToBottom(); this.maybeMarkRead(); return; }
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, limit: 50 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                this.events = page.eventList || [];
                this.hasMoreBefore = !!page.hasMoreBefore;
                this.hasMoreAfter = false;
                this.gapsOf(page, true, true);
                this.$nextTick(() => { this.scrollToBottom(); this.maybeMarkRead(); });
            }, () => {});
        },
        scrollToBottom() {
            const el = this.$refs.scroller;
            if (!el) return;
            el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
            this.atBottom = true;
        },
        scrollToDivider(again) {
            if (!again) this.holdAnchor({ kind: 'divider' });
            const el = this.$refs.scroller;
            const divider = document.getElementById(this.domId('unread', false));
            if (!el || !divider) { this.scrollToBottom(); return; }
            el.scrollTop = Math.max(0, divider.offsetTop - el.clientHeight / 3);
            this.onScroll();
        },
        scrollToSeq(seq, highlight, again) {
            if (!again) this.holdAnchor({ kind: 'seq', seq: Number(seq) });
            const node = document.getElementById(this.domId(seq, false));
            if (node && node.scrollIntoView) node.scrollIntoView({ block: 'center' });
            if (highlight) {
                this.highlightSeq = Number(seq);
                clearTimeout(this.highlightTimer);
                this.highlightTimer = setTimeout(() => { this.highlightSeq = null; }, 4000);
            }
            this.onScroll();
        },
        // a picture that loads after the room opened at its divider or at a message keeps that in view; at the bottom, the bottom
        imageLoaded() {
            if (this.anchor && this.anchor.kind === 'divider') this.scrollToDivider(true);
            else if (this.anchor && this.anchor.kind === 'seq') this.scrollToSeq(this.anchor.seq, false, true);
            else if (this.atBottom && !this.hasMoreAfter) this.scrollToBottom();
        },
        holdAnchor(anchor) {
            this.anchor = anchor;
            clearTimeout(this.anchorTimer);
            this.anchorTimer = setTimeout(() => { this.anchor = null; }, 4000);
        },
        onScroll() {
            const el = this.$refs.scroller;
            if (!el) return;
            const fromBottom = el.scrollHeight - el.scrollTop - el.clientHeight;
            this.atBottom = fromBottom < 40;
            if (this.atBottom) { this.newBelow = 0; this.maybeMarkRead(); }
            if (el.scrollTop < 60 && this.hasMoreBefore && !this.loadingOlder) this.loadOlder();
            if (fromBottom < 80 && this.hasMoreAfter && !this.loadingNewer) this.loadNewer();
        },

        // ---- read markers ----
        maybeMarkRead() {
            if (!this.isMember || this.holdRead || this.hasMoreAfter || !this.atBottom || this.state !== 'ready' || !this.room) return;
            if (document.visibilityState && document.visibilityState !== 'visible') return;
            if (Number(this.room.lastEventSeq || 0) <= this.myLastRead) return;
            clearTimeout(this.readTimer);
            this.readTimer = setTimeout(() => this.markRead(false), 600);
        },
        markRead(now) {
            if (!this.isMember) return;
            if (now) this.holdRead = false;
            // the desktop client sends it from its outbox, offline too; the web asks now
            const queued = moqui.chat && moqui.chat.queueRead ? moqui.chat.queueRead(this.roomId, this.room && this.room.lastEventSeq) : null;
            const asked = () => this.post('markRead', { chatRoomId: this.roomId });
            (queued ? queued.catch(asked) : asked()).then((json) => {
                if (json.lastReadEventSeq != null) this.myLastRead = Math.max(this.myLastRead, Number(json.lastReadEventSeq));
                if (now) this.dividerSeq = null;
                this.$emit('read', this.roomId);
            }, () => {});
        },
        markUnreadFrom(item) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.post('markRead', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, markUnread: 'true' }).then((json) => {
                this.holdRead = true;
                this.myLastRead = Number(json.lastReadEventSeq || 0);
                this.dividerSeq = this.myLastRead;
                moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('Marked unread from this message') }]);
            }, () => {});
        },

        // ---- live: the page's chat store ----
        onEvent(payload) {
            const event = payload && payload.event;
            if (!event || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            // an encrypted room's event is decrypted first, the events kept in their order (C7); a member who left takes no later key
            if (this.sealed && moqui.chat && moqui.chat.openEvent) {
                if (event.type === 'membership' && event.content && ['leave', 'remove'].includes(event.content.action)) {
                    // out of the members at once, not when the room's meta reloads: a message sent meanwhile shares no key with them
                    const gone = event.content.userId || event.senderUserId;
                    if (gone) this.members = this.members.filter((person) => person.userId !== gone);
                    moqui.crypto.rotateRoom(this.roomId).catch(() => null);
                }
                const copy = Object.assign({}, event);
                this.liveQueue = (this.liveQueue || Promise.resolve()).then(() => moqui.chat.openEvent(this.roomId, copy, (file) => this.sealedUrl(file)))
                    .then(() => this.applyLive(Object.assign({}, payload, { event: copy })), (err) => console.error('An encrypted event was not shown', err));
                return;
            }
            this.applyLive(payload);
        },
        applyLive(payload) {
            const event = payload && payload.event;
            if (!event || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const seq = Number(event.eventSeq);
            if (this.room) this.room.lastEventSeq = Math.max(Number(this.room.lastEventSeq || 0), seq);
            if (event.senderUserId && event.senderName && !this.names[event.senderUserId]) this.names[event.senderUserId] = event.senderName;
            const isRow = ['message', 'membership', 'system', 'pin', 'call', 'poll'].includes(event.type);
            const mainTimeline = event.threadRootEventSeq == null;
            if (this.hasMoreAfter && isRow && mainTimeline) {
                if (event.type === 'pin') {
                    const target = this.events.find((item) => Number(item.eventSeq) === Number(event.relatesToEventSeq));
                    if (target) target.pinned = !!(event.content && event.content.pinned);
                }
                if (event.type === 'message' && event.senderUserId !== me) this.newBelow++;
            } else {
                const wasAtBottom = this.atBottom;
                applyEvent(this.events, event, me);
                if (isRow && mainTimeline) this.$nextTick(() => {
                    if (wasAtBottom || event.senderUserId === me) this.scrollToBottom();
                    else if (event.type === 'message') this.newBelow++;
                });
            }
            if (this.side === 'thread' && this.threadView.rootSeq != null) {
                const before = this.threadView.events.length;
                applyEvent(this.threadView.events, event, me, this.threadView.rootSeq);
                if (this.threadView.events.length !== before) this.$nextTick(() => { const el = this.$refs.threadScroller; if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight; });
            }
            if (this.side === 'threads' && (event.threadRootEventSeq != null || event.type === 'redaction')) this.patchThreads(event);
            if (event.type === 'message') {
                const person = this.members.find((item) => item.userId === event.senderUserId);
                // a member who turned read receipts off has no marker to move
                if (person && person.lastReadEventSeq != null) person.lastReadEventSeq = Math.max(Number(person.lastReadEventSeq || 0), seq);
                if (event.senderUserId === me) this.myLastRead = Math.max(this.myLastRead, seq);
                else {
                    this.maybeMarkRead();
                    const mentioned = (event.mentions || []).includes(me);
                    const level = (this.member && this.member.notificationLevelEnumId) || 'CnlAll';
                    const wants = mentioned || (level === 'CnlAll' && !(this.member && this.member.isMuted));
                    if (wants && this.prefs.sounds !== false && !(moqui.chat && moqui.chat.quiet()) && document.visibilityState !== 'visible') chime();
                }
            }
            // the timer changed (by anyone): an encrypted room's next message here starts a new key, so no session spans two
            // timers (phase 16); a browser with the room closed rotates at its next send, its settings having changed
            if (event.type === 'system' && event.content && event.content.action === 'timer' && this.sealed && moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.rotateRoom)
                moqui.crypto.rotateRoom(this.roomId).catch(() => null);
            if (event.type === 'membership' || event.type === 'system') { this.reloadMeta(); this.$emit('changed'); }
            if (this.side === 'pinned' && (event.type === 'pin' || event.type === 'redaction')) this.loadPinned();
            if (this.tabs[this.side] && this.tabTouched(this.side, event)) {
                clearTimeout(this.tabTimer);
                const name = this.side;
                this.tabTimer = setTimeout(() => { if (this.side === name) this.refreshTab(name); }, 400);
            }
        },
        onReadSignal(payload) {
            if (!payload || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId) return;
            if (payload.userId && payload.userId !== this.me.userId) {
                const person = this.members.find((item) => item.userId === payload.userId);
                if (person) person.lastReadEventSeq = Number(payload.lastReadEventSeq || 0);
            } else if (payload.lastReadEventSeq != null) this.myLastRead = Math.max(this.myLastRead, Number(payload.lastReadEventSeq));
        },
        onRoomSignal(payload) {
            if (!payload || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId) return;
            if (payload.action === 'left') { this.$emit('left', this.roomId); return; }
            this.reloadMeta();
        },
        onVisible() { if (document.visibilityState === 'visible') this.maybeMarkRead(); },
        typingNow() { if (this.prefs.typing !== false && this.canPost && moqui.chat) moqui.chat.typing(this.roomId); },
        typingStop() { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.typing(this.roomId, false); },

        // ---- the composers ----
        registerComposer(vm, threadRoot) { (this.composers = this.composers || {})[threadRoot ? 'thread' : 'main'] = vm; },
        unregisterComposer(vm, threadRoot) { const key = threadRoot ? 'thread' : 'main'; if (this.composers && this.composers[key] === vm) this.composers[key] = null; },
        focusComposer() { const vm = this.composers && this.composers.main; if (vm) vm.focus(); },
        // A message goes through the chat store's outbox (moqui.chat.send): kept in the page first, so one sent offline, or
        // one whose answer is lost, goes later and is not sent twice (the server knows its clientRef). Its row is the
        // outbox's until the answer or its push (onSent). Rejects when the outbox cannot keep it; resolves otherwise.
        sendMessage(message) {
            const threadRoot = message.threadRoot ? Number(message.threadRoot) : null;
            const replyTo = threadRoot ? null : this.replyTo;
            const params = { body: message.body || '', replyToEventSeq: replyTo ? replyTo.eventSeq : '', threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot || '',
                chatAttachmentIds: (message.attachmentIds || []).join(',') };
            if (message.viewOnce) params.viewOnce = 'true';
            if (!threadRoot) {
                this.replyTo = null;
                if (!this.hasMoreAfter) this.$nextTick(() => this.scrollToBottom());
            }
            const restore = (err) => { if (replyTo) this.replyTo = replyTo; throw err; };
            // an encrypted room: the message is encrypted before the outbox keeps it, which then holds only ciphertext (C7)
            if (this.sealed) {
                const clientRef = moqui.chat.newClientRef();
                const html = message.body || '';
                return moqui.chat.sealMessage(this.roomId, this.memberIds(), html, message.files || []).then((sealed) => {
                    moqui.chat.sealedTexts[clientRef] = plainOf(html) || t('Files');
                    const sealedParams = { encryptedJson: sealed.encryptedJson, mentionUserIds: sealed.mentionUserIds, replyToEventSeq: params.replyToEventSeq,
                        threadRootEventSeq: params.threadRootEventSeq, chatAttachmentIds: params.chatAttachmentIds, viewOnce: params.viewOnce || '' };
                    // who cannot read it: the devices only verified devices left out (COM-UI-013), shown under it once it is sent
                    const leftOut = moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.leftOut ? moqui.crypto.leftOut(this.roomId).catch(() => []) : Promise.resolve([]);
                    return leftOut.then((devices) => {
                        if (devices && devices.length) moqui.chat.noteLeftOut(clientRef, this.roomId, moqui.chat.leftOutText(devices, this.me.userId, (id) => this.nameOf(id)));
                        return moqui.chat.send({ clientRef, chatRoomId: this.roomId, url: this.url('send'), params: sealedParams, text: '', sealed: true,
                            threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot, hasFiles: !!(message.attachmentIds || []).length });
                    });
                }).then((outcome) => {
                    if (outcome && outcome.failed && outcome.error) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: outcome.error }]);
                    return outcome;
                }, (err) => {
                    // a verified person's new device or identity (§6.1 rule 3): asked first, then sent again
                    this.sealRefused(err, () => this.sendMessage(message).then(() => {
                        // sent after all: the composer that kept its text is cleared
                        const vm = this.composers && this.composers[threadRoot ? 'thread' : 'main'];
                        if (vm) vm.clear();
                    }));
                    return restore(err);
                });
            }
            if (!moqui.chat || !moqui.chat.send) {
                return this.post('send', Object.assign({ chatRoomId: this.roomId }, params)).then((json) => {
                    this.onSent({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot, json });
                    return json;
                }, restore);
            }
            return moqui.chat.send({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, url: this.url('send'), params, text: plainOf(message.body) || t('Files'),
                threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot, hasFiles: !!(message.attachmentIds || []).length }).then((outcome) => {
                if (outcome && outcome.failed && outcome.error) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: outcome.error }]);
                return outcome;
            }, (err) => {
                moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This message cannot wait to be sent: it is too large, or too many wait. Send it when you are back online.') }]);
                return restore(err);
            });
        },
        // a message of this room answered (now, or later from the outbox): in its place, and read
        onSent(payload) {
            const sent = payload && payload.json && payload.json.event;
            if (!sent || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            if (this.sealed && sent.encrypted && !payload.opened && moqui.chat.openEvent) {
                const copy = Object.assign({}, sent);
                this.liveQueue = (this.liveQueue || Promise.resolve()).then(() => moqui.chat.openEvent(this.roomId, copy, (file) => this.sealedUrl(file)))
                    .then(() => this.onSent(Object.assign({}, payload, { opened: true, json: Object.assign({}, payload.json, { event: copy }) })));
                return;
            }
            const event = sent;
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const threadRoot = payload.threadRootEventSeq != null ? Number(payload.threadRootEventSeq) : null;
            const seq = Number(event.eventSeq);
            this.myLastRead = Math.max(this.myLastRead, seq);
            if (this.room) this.room.lastEventSeq = Math.max(Number(this.room.lastEventSeq || 0), seq);
            this.dividerSeq = null;
            this.holdRead = false;
            // a thread reply counts on its root through its push only, so it is not counted twice
            if (threadRoot) {
                if (Number(this.threadView.rootSeq) === threadRoot) {
                    applyEvent(this.threadView.events, event, me, threadRoot);
                    this.$nextTick(() => { const el = this.$refs.threadScroller; if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight; });
                }
            } else if (this.hasMoreAfter) this.jumpToLatest();
            else {
                applyEvent(this.events, event, me);
                this.$nextTick(() => this.scrollToBottom());
            }
        },
        pendingText(item) {
            if (item.status === 'sending') return t('Sending…');
            if (item.status === 'failed') return item.expired ? t('Not sent: its files are no longer kept') : (item.error ? t('Not sent:') + ' ' + item.error : t('Not sent'));
            if (item.status === 'held') return t('Waiting: sign in again to send it');
            return this.offline ? t('Waiting for the connection') : t('Waiting to send');
        },
        retryPending(item) { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.retry(item.clientRef); },
        discardPending(item) {
            this.confirm(t('Delete this message?'), t('It was not sent; it is removed from this page.'), t('Delete'), true).then(() => { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.discard(item.clientRef); });
        },
        // a change of a message with no event of its own (link previews, a poll's votes), here and in the open thread
        onUpdate(payload) {
            if (!payload || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            // a view-once message opened (phase 16): its state is each reader's own, read again
            if (payload.fields && payload.fields.viewOnceChanged) { this.rereadMessage(payload.eventSeq); return; }
            this.applyFields(payload.eventSeq, payload.fields);
        },
        rereadMessage(seq) {
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: seq }).then((page) => {
                const fresh = (page.eventList || []).find((event) => Number(event.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
                if (!fresh) return;
                this.events = this.events.map((event) => (Number(event.eventSeq) === Number(seq) ? fresh : event));
                this.threadView.events = this.threadView.events.map((event) => (Number(event.eventSeq) === Number(seq) ? fresh : event));
            }, () => null);
        },
        // ---- disappearing messages and view-once (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 16) ----
        // events that went at their time (this page's timer or the server's push): out of every list here, their files let go
        onExpired(payload) {
            if (!payload || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId) return;
            const seqs = new Set((payload.eventSeqList || []).map(Number));
            const before = payload.before != null ? Number(payload.before) : null;
            const gone = (event) => seqs.has(Number(event.eventSeq)) || (before != null && event.expireDate != null && Number(event.expireDate) <= before);
            const files = [];
            const keep = (list) => list.filter((event) => { if (!gone(event)) return true; (event.attachments || []).forEach((file) => files.push(file.chatAttachmentId)); return false; });
            this.events = keep(this.events);
            this.threadView.events = keep(this.threadView.events);
            this.pinned.list = keep(this.pinned.list);
            this.searchPane.results = keep(this.searchPane.results);
            Object.keys(this.tabs).forEach((name) => { if (this.tabs[name] && Array.isArray(this.tabs[name].list)) this.tabs[name].list = keep(this.tabs[name].list); });
            if (files.length && moqui.chat.releaseFiles) moqui.chat.releaseFiles(this.roomId, files);
            if (this.onceView.open && this.onceView.item && gone(this.onceView.item)) this.closeViewOnce();
        },
        leftText(item) { return fill(t('Disappears in {time}'), { time: moqui.chat.expiry.left(item.expireDate, moqui.chat.expiry.now(), t) }); },
        openTimer() {
            this.timerBox = { open: true, value: this.timerSeconds, busy: false };
        },
        saveTimer() {
            this.timerBox.busy = true;
            this.post('setRoomTimer', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, seconds: this.timerBox.value || 0 }).then((json) => {
                this.timerBox.busy = false;
                if (json.errors) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: json.errors }]); return; }
                if (this.room) this.room.messageTimerSeconds = json.seconds || null;
                this.timerBox.open = false;
            }, () => { this.timerBox.busy = false; });
        },
        // a view-once message here: closed (may open), opened (by me), sent (mine), gone
        viewOnceState(item) {
            const once = item.viewOnce || {};
            if (item.mine) return 'sent';
            if (once.gone) return 'gone';
            return once.openedByMe ? 'opened' : 'closed';
        },
        viewOnceText(item) {
            const once = item.viewOnce || {};
            const what = once.kind === 'video' ? t('Video') : t('Photo');
            if (item.mine) {
                if (once.recipientCount > 1 && once.openedCount) return fill(t('{what} · Opened by {count} of {total}'), { what, count: once.openedCount, total: once.recipientCount });
                return what + ' · ' + (once.openedCount ? t('Opened') : t('View once'));
            }
            if (once.openedByMe) return what + ' · ' + t('Opened');
            if (once.gone) return what + ' · ' + t('Expired');
            return what + ' · ' + t('View once');
        },
        openViewOnce(item) {
            const kept = item.viewOnceFile || null;
            this.post('openViewOnce', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq }).then((json) => {
                if (json.errors || !json.chatAttachmentId) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: json.errors || t('This view-once photo is no longer here') }]); return; }
                const url = this.url('viewOnceFile') + '?chatAttachmentId=' + encodeURIComponent(json.chatAttachmentId);
                const type = kept && kept.contentType ? kept.contentType : json.contentType;
                const fetched = fetch(url, { credentials: 'same-origin', cache: 'no-store' }).then((response) => {
                    if (!response.ok) throw new Error('status ' + response.status);
                    return response.arrayBuffer();
                }).then((data) => (this.sealed && kept && kept.sealed ? moqui.crypto.decryptFile(data, kept.sealed) : data));
                this.onceView = { open: true, url: null, kind: /^video\//i.test(type || '') ? 'video' : 'photo', item, until: json.until, secured: null };
                // what the app host answers: the note shows unless screenshots are blocked now
                moqui.chat.expiry.secureScreen('viewOnce', true).then((held) => { if (this.onceView.open) this.onceView.secured = held; });
                fetched.then((bytes) => {
                    if (!this.onceView.open) return;
                    this.onceView.url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([bytes], { type: moqui.chat.blobType ? moqui.chat.blobType(type) : type }));
                }, () => { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This view-once photo is no longer here') }]); this.closeViewOnce(); });
            });
        },
        // closed: the bytes go, the screen may be captured again, and the message reads Opened
        closeViewOnce() {
            if (this.onceView.url) URL.revokeObjectURL(this.onceView.url);
            const item = this.onceView.item;
            this.onceView = { open: false, url: null, kind: null, item: null, until: 0, secured: null };
            moqui.chat.expiry.secureScreen('viewOnce', false);
            if (item && item.viewOnce) item.viewOnce = Object.assign({}, item.viewOnce, { openedByMe: true });
            if (item) this.rereadMessage(item.eventSeq);
        },
        applyFields(seq, fields) {
            const payload = { eventSeq: seq, fields };
            const me = this.me.userId;
            if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.applyUpdate) {
                moqui.chat.applyUpdate(this.events, payload, me);
                moqui.chat.applyUpdate(this.threadView.events, payload, me);
            } else {
                [this.events, this.threadView.events].forEach((list) => {
                    const target = list.find((item) => Number(item.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
                    if (target) Object.assign(target, fields);
                });
            }
        },
        // the socket is back after it was closed: what came meanwhile, after the last event here
        onConnection(payload) {
            if (!payload || !payload.reconnected || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            this.reloadMeta();
            if (this.side === 'thread' && this.threadView.rootSeq != null) this.openThread(this.threadView.rootSeq, true);
            if (this.side === 'threads') this.loadThreads(false);
            if (this.tabs[this.side]) this.refreshTab(this.side);
            if (this.hasMoreAfter || !this.events.length) return;
            const last = this.events.reduce((max, event) => Math.max(max, Number(event.eventSeq)), 0);
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, afterSeq: last, limit: 200 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                const wasAtBottom = this.atBottom;
                const have = new Set(this.events.map((event) => Number(event.eventSeq)));
                const added = (page.eventList || []).filter((event) => !have.has(Number(event.eventSeq)));
                if (added.length) this.events = this.events.concat(added).sort((left, right) => Number(left.eventSeq) - Number(right.eventSeq));
                this.hasMoreAfter = !!page.hasMoreAfter;
                this.gapsOf(page, false, true);
                if (wasAtBottom) this.$nextTick(() => { this.scrollToBottom(); this.maybeMarkRead(); });
                else this.newBelow += added.filter((event) => event.type === 'message' && event.senderUserId !== this.me.userId).length;
            }, () => {});
        },
        // The desktop client's changes feeds changed this room's held messages (or were reset) while the page showed them:
        // the messages shown are read again from the store (up to 200), but those with a change of this page still waiting,
        // which keep what the page shows of it.
        onRoomsChanged(payload) {
            if (!payload || this.state !== 'ready' || !this.events.length) return;
            if (!payload.reset && !(payload.rooms || []).includes(this.roomId)) return;
            const seqs = this.events.map((event) => Number(event.eventSeq)).filter((seq) => seq > 0);
            if (!seqs.length) return;
            const first = Math.min(...seqs);
            const last = Math.max(...seqs);
            if (last - first >= 200) return;
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, afterSeq: first - 1, limit: 200 }).then((page) => {
                const waiting = new Set((moqui.chat.state.changes || []).filter((change) => change.chatRoomId === this.roomId && change.status !== 'failed')
                    .map((change) => change.eventSeq));
                const fresh = new Map((page.eventList || []).filter((event) => !waiting.has(Number(event.eventSeq))).map((event) => [Number(event.eventSeq), event]));
                this.events = this.events.map((event) => fresh.get(Number(event.eventSeq)) || event);
            }, () => {});
        },
        startReply(item) {
            this.replyTo = { eventSeq: item.eventSeq, senderName: item.senderName, snippet: this.snippetOf(item.event) };
            this.$nextTick(() => this.focusComposer());
        },
        cancelReply() { this.replyTo = null; },
        quickCreateText(kind, text) {
            const query = { kind };
            if (text) query[kind === 'request' ? 'requestName' : 'workEffortName'] = text;
            if (this.room && this.room.record && this.room.record.visible) {
                query.recordEntity = this.room.record.entity;
                query.recordId = this.room.record.id;
                query.recordTitle = this.room.record.title;
            }
            // the shell's quick-create kind of that name, from the apps the user may open
            const found = (this.$root.quickCreateItems || []).find((option) => option.kind === kind);
            if (!found) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: fill(t('Nothing here makes a {kind}'), { kind }) }]); return; }
            delete query.kind;
            this.openQuickCreate(found.url + (found.url.indexOf('?') > 0 ? '&' : '?') + moqui.objToSearch(query), found.label);
        },
        openQuickCreate(url, title) {
            this.$root.quickCreateTitle = title || '';
            this.$root.quickCreateUrl = this.$root.shellLoadPath ? this.$root.shellLoadPath(url) : url.replace(/^\/qapps/, '/apps');
            this.$root.quickCreateShow = true;
        },

        // ---- message actions ----
        hover(item, inThread) { if (!this.isTouch()) this.hoverKey = (inThread ? 't' : 'm') + item.eventSeq; },
        unhover(item, inThread) { const key = (inThread ? 't' : 'm') + item.eventSeq; if (this.hoverKey === key) this.hoverKey = null; },
        isHovered(item, inThread) { return this.hoverKey === (inThread ? 't' : 'm') + item.eventSeq; },
        tap(item, inThread) {
            if (!this.isTouch() || this.useBubbles) return;
            const key = (inThread ? 't' : 'm') + item.eventSeq;
            this.tapKey = this.tapKey === key ? null : key;
        },
        // a long press on a message (in bubbles, as on a phone) opens its actions as a sheet; a move or a short tap does not
        holdStart(item, inThread, event) {
            this.holdCancel();
            this.touchFrom = null;
            if (!this.useBubbles || (event.touches && event.touches.length > 1)) return;
            if (event.target && event.target.closest && event.target.closest('input, textarea, [contenteditable="true"], .q-btn, .m-chat-reaction, .m-chat-poll .q-item')) return;
            const touch = event.touches && event.touches[0];
            // a touch in what scrolls sideways (a wide code block or table) is that scroll, never a swipe
            if (touch && !this.scrollsSideways(event.target, event.currentTarget)) this.touchFrom = { x: touch.clientX, y: touch.clientY, item, inThread: !!inThread };
            this.holdTimer = setTimeout(() => { this.holdTimer = null; this.held = true; this.openSheet(item, inThread); }, HOLD_MS);
        },
        holdCancel() { if (this.holdTimer) { clearTimeout(this.holdTimer); this.holdTimer = null; } },
        // whether target, up to the message's row, is in a code block or table, or in an element that scrolls sideways
        scrollsSideways(target, row) {
            if (target && target.closest && target.closest('pre, table')) return true;
            for (let el = target; el && el !== row && el.nodeType === 1; el = el.parentElement) {
                const overflow = window.getComputedStyle(el).overflowX;
                if ((overflow === 'auto' || overflow === 'scroll') && el.scrollWidth > el.clientWidth + 1) return true;
            }
            return false;
        },
        // a move cancels the long press; in the room's timeline, one to the right is a swipe to reply, which the bubble
        // follows and which replies when let go past SWIPE_REPLY_PX (an up or down move is a scroll, not a swipe)
        holdMove(event) {
            this.holdCancel();
            const from = this.touchFrom;
            const touch = event.touches && event.touches[0];
            if (!from || !touch) return;
            const dx = touch.clientX - from.x;
            const dy = Math.abs(touch.clientY - from.y);
            if (!this.swipeKey) {
                if (dy > 16 && dy > dx) { this.touchFrom = null; return; }
                if (dx < 12 || dx < dy * 2 || from.inThread || !this.canPost || from.item.redacted || this.isEditing(from.item)) return;
                this.swipeKey = 'm' + from.item.eventSeq;
            }
            this.swipeDx = Math.max(0, Math.min(dx, SWIPE_REPLY_PX * 1.5));
        },
        holdEnd(event) {
            this.holdCancel();
            const from = this.touchFrom;
            const replying = !!(from && this.swipeKey && this.swipeDx >= SWIPE_REPLY_PX);
            this.touchFrom = null;
            this.swipeKey = null;
            this.swipeDx = 0;
            if (replying) {
                this.startReply(from.item);
                if (navigator.vibrate) { try { navigator.vibrate(10); } catch (e) { /* no vibration here */ } }
                if (event.cancelable) event.preventDefault();
                return;
            }
            // the press that opened the sheet is not also a click on what is under it
            if (this.held) { this.held = false; if (event.cancelable) event.preventDefault(); }
        },
        swipeStyle(item, inThread) {
            return !inThread && this.swipeKey === 'm' + item.eventSeq && this.swipeDx ? { transform: 'translateX(' + this.swipeDx + 'px)' } : null;
        },
        contextMenu(item, inThread, event) {
            if (this.pressGuard(event)) return;
            if (!this.useBubbles) return;
            event.preventDefault();
            if (!this.sheet.open) this.openSheet(item, inThread);
        },
        openSheet(item, inThread) {
            if (item.redacted || this.isEditing(item) || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            this.tapKey = null;
            this.sheet = { open: true, item, inThread: !!inThread };
            if (navigator.vibrate) { try { navigator.vibrate(10); } catch (e) { /* no vibration here */ } }
        },
        sheetDo(action) { this.sheet.open = false; action(); },
        // a message's actions, in the order of every menu of it (chat-message-menu): {key, icon, label, run, negative}, a
        // separator ({separator: true}) and the apps' actions (key apps: m-ext-actions)
        messageActions(item, inThread) {
            const list = [];
            const add = (key, icon, label, run, more) => list.push(Object.assign({ key, icon, label, run }, more || {}));
            if (this.canPost && !inThread) {
                add('reply', 'sym_o_reply', t('Reply'), () => this.startReply(item));
                add('thread', 'sym_o_forum', t('Reply in thread'), () => this.openThread(item.eventSeq));
            }
            add('copy', 'sym_o_content_copy', t('Copy text'), () => this.copyText(item));
            add('link', 'sym_o_link', t('Copy link'), () => this.copyLink(item));
            if (this.isMember && !this.sealed) add('forward', 'sym_o_forward', t('Forward…'), () => this.openForward(item));
            if (this.canEdit(item)) add('edit', 'sym_o_edit', t('Edit'), () => this.startEdit(item));
            if (this.canPost) add('pin', 'sym_o_keep', item.pinned ? t('Unpin') : t('Pin to the room'), () => this.pin(item, !item.pinned));
            if (this.isMember && !inThread) add('unread', 'sym_o_mark_chat_unread', t('Mark unread from here'), () => this.markUnreadFrom(item));
            if (this.access.canRead && item.eventSeq != null && !item.pending) {
                const reminder = this.reminderOf(item);
                add('remind', 'sym_o_alarm', reminder ? fill(t('Reminder at {time}…'), { time: this.whenText(reminder.remindDate) }) : t('Remind me…'), () => this.openRemind(item));
            }
            list.push({ key: 'sep-apps', separator: true });
            if (!this.sealed) list.push({ key: 'apps' });
            if (this.prefs.recordLink && !this.sealed) add('file', 'sym_o_add_link', t('File on a record…'), () => this.openFileOn(item));
            add('info', 'sym_o_info', t('Info'), () => this.openInfo(item, inThread));
            if ((item.reactions || []).length) add('reactions', 'sym_o_add_reaction', t('Who reacted'), () => this.showReactions(item));
            if (this.canRedact(item)) {
                list.push({ key: 'sep-delete', separator: true });
                add('delete', 'sym_o_delete', t('Delete message'), () => this.redact(item), { negative: true });
            }
            return list;
        },
        // ---- who reacted and who voted, by touch: a long press on a chip or an option; a tap still reacts or votes ----
        pressStart(what, event) {
            this.pressCancel();
            this.pressHeld = false;
            if (event.touches && event.touches.length > 1) return;
            this.pressTimer = setTimeout(() => {
                this.pressTimer = null;
                this.pressHeld = true;
                this.showPeople(what);
                if (navigator.vibrate) { try { navigator.vibrate(10); } catch (e) { /* no vibration here */ } }
            }, HOLD_MS);
        },
        pressCancel() { if (this.pressTimer) { clearTimeout(this.pressTimer); this.pressTimer = null; } },
        pressEnd(event) {
            this.pressCancel();
            if (!this.pressHeld) return;
            // the press that showed the people is not also a tap on the chip; a click that comes later is one
            if (event && event.cancelable) event.preventDefault();
            this.pressRelease();
        },
        // a press held long enough: the click that may follow it does nothing, for a moment
        pressRelease() {
            clearTimeout(this.pressReset);
            this.pressReset = setTimeout(() => { this.pressHeld = false; }, 400);
        },
        // a chip's or an option's own context menu (Android's long press, the menu key) or Shift+Enter: who reacted or voted,
        // once (a long press may have shown them already), and the click its key or touch may send is not a tap
        pressMenu(what) {
            if (this.pressHeld) return;
            this.pressCancel();
            this.pressHeld = true;
            this.pressRelease();
            this.showPeople(what);
        },
        // a context menu that belongs to a chip or option, or comes while one is pressed, is not the message's
        pressGuard(event) {
            const target = event && event.target;
            const own = !!(target && target.closest && target.closest('.m-chat-reaction, .m-chat-poll .q-item'));
            if (!own && !this.pressTimer && !this.pressHeld) return false;
            if (event && event.cancelable) event.preventDefault();
            return true;
        },
        // whether a long press just showed the people: the click that may follow it does nothing
        pressed() {
            const held = !!this.pressHeld;
            this.pressHeld = false;
            clearTimeout(this.pressReset);
            return held;
        },
        // a reaction chip's name: the emoji, how many, who, and the key that lists them
        reactionLabel(reaction) {
            return fill(t('{emoji} {count}: {names}. Shift+Enter shows who reacted'), { emoji: reaction.key, count: reaction.count, names: this.reactorsText(reaction) });
        },
        // Who reacted, from the message's menu: everyone with their emoji
        showReactions(item) {
            const byUser = {};
            const order = [];
            for (const reaction of item.reactions || []) for (const id of reaction.userIds || []) {
                if (!byUser[id]) { byUser[id] = []; order.push(id); }
                byUser[id].push(reaction.key);
            }
            if (!order.length) return;
            this.peopleBox = { open: true, title: t('Who reacted'),
                people: order.map((id) => ({ userId: id, name: id === this.me.userId ? t('You') : this.nameOf(id), detail: byUser[id].join(' ') })) };
        },
        showPeople(what) {
            const ids = what.kind === 'voters' ? (what.option.voterIds || []) : (what.reaction.userIds || []);
            const people = ids.map((id) => ({ userId: id, name: id === this.me.userId ? t('You') : this.nameOf(id) }));
            const title = what.kind === 'voters' ? fill(t('Voted for {option}'), { option: what.option.text || '' })
                : fill(t('Reacted with {emoji}'), { emoji: what.reaction.key });
            if (!people.length) {
                // an anonymous poll names no one
                if (what.kind === 'voters') moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: what.item.poll && what.item.poll.anonymous ? t('This poll is anonymous') : t('No votes yet') }]);
                return;
            }
            this.peopleBox = { open: true, title, people };
        },
        // ---- Info: the message read again (its delivery and the members' read markers as the server has them now) ----
        openInfo(item, inThread) {
            this.tapKey = null;
            const offline = noConnection();
            this.infoBox = { open: true, item, inThread: !!inThread || item.event.threadRootEventSeq != null, event: item.event, members: this.members, loading: !offline };
            if (offline) return;
            // the answer of the last Info asked (the box holds a reactive copy of the item, so it is not compared)
            const asked = this.infoAsked = (this.infoAsked || 0) + 1;
            moqui.request(this.url('timeline'), { params: { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, limit: 1 } }).then((result) => {
                const json = (result && result.json) || {};
                if (this.infoAsked !== asked || !this.infoBox.item) return;
                const fresh = (json.eventList || []).find((event) => Number(event.eventSeq) === Number(item.eventSeq));
                // only what Info shows: an encrypted room's event comes back sealed, and the item keeps its decrypted text
                if (fresh) this.infoBox.event = Object.assign({}, item.event, { sentDate: fresh.sentDate != null ? fresh.sentDate : item.event.sentDate,
                    delivery: fresh.delivery || null, threadRootEventSeq: fresh.threadRootEventSeq != null ? fresh.threadRootEventSeq : item.event.threadRootEventSeq });
                if (Array.isArray(json.memberList)) this.infoBox.members = json.memberList;
                this.infoBox.loading = false;
            }, () => { if (this.infoAsked === asked) this.infoBox.loading = false; });
        },
        isTouch() { return !!(this.$q.platform && this.$q.platform.has && this.$q.platform.has.touch) && this.$q.screen.lt.md; },
        showActions(item, inThread) {
            if (item.redacted || this.isEditing(item) || this.state !== 'ready') return false;
            const key = (inThread ? 't' : 'm') + item.eventSeq;
            return this.hoverKey === key || this.tapKey === key;
        },
        canEdit(item) { return item.mine && !item.redacted && !item.poll && !item.event.rich && this.canPost && Date.now() - item.sentDate < EDIT_WINDOW && this.bridgeCaps.edit; },
        canRedact(item) { return !item.redacted && this.isMember && (item.mine || (this.canModerate && !this.isDirect)) && this.bridgeCaps.delete; },
        externalText(person) { return fill(t('On {network}'), { network: person.networkName || t('another network') }); },
        // ---- a message's delivery to the room's bridges ----
        deliveryNames(item, state) {
            const list = ((item.event.delivery && item.event.delivery.destinations) || []).filter((destination) => !state || destination.state === state);
            return Array.from(new Set(list.map((destination) => destination.networkName || destination.bridgeName).filter((name) => name))).join(', ');
        },
        deliveryText(item) {
            const delivery = item.event.delivery;
            if (!delivery) return '';
            if (delivery.state === 'failed') {
                const failed = delivery.destinations.find((destination) => destination.state === 'failed') || {};
                return fill(t('Not delivered to {names}'), { names: this.deliveryNames(item, 'failed') }) + (failed.error ? ': ' + failed.error : '');
            }
            if (delivery.state === 'uncertain') return fill(t('May not have reached {names}'), { names: this.deliveryNames(item, 'uncertain') });
            if (delivery.state === 'pending') return fill(t('Sending to {names}'), { names: this.deliveryNames(item, 'pending') });
            // an RCS bridge's message that went as the fallback says so (Comms-Messaging §16)
            const fallback = delivery.destinations.length === 1 ? moqui.chat.pathName(delivery.destinations[0]) : '';
            if (fallback) return fill(t('Delivered to {network} as {path}'), { network: this.deliveryNames(item), path: fallback });
            if (delivery.destinations.length && delivery.destinations.every((destination) => destination.receipt === 'read')) return fill(t('Read on {names}'), { names: this.deliveryNames(item) });
            return fill(t('Delivered to {names}'), { names: this.deliveryNames(item) });
        },
        deliveryIcon(item) {
            const state = item.event.delivery && item.event.delivery.state;
            return { failed: 'sym_o_error', uncertain: 'sym_o_help', pending: 'sym_o_schedule' }[state] || 'sym_o_done_all';
        },
        deliveryClass(item) {
            const state = item.event.delivery && item.event.delivery.state;
            if (state === 'accepted' && (item.event.delivery.destinations || []).every((destination) => destination.receipt === 'read')) return 'text-primary';
            return state === 'failed' ? 'text-negative' : state === 'uncertain' ? 'text-warning' : 'm-muted';
        },
        canRetry(item) { return !!(item.event.delivery && item.event.delivery.retryable) && (item.mine || this.canModerate); },
        retryDelivery(item) {
            const destinations = (item.event.delivery.destinations || []).filter((destination) => destination.retryable);
            Promise.all(destinations.map((destination) => this.post('retryDelivery', { chatBridgeDeliveryId: destination.chatBridgeDeliveryId }))).then((answers) => {
                const refused = answers.find((json) => json && json.error);
                if (refused) { moqui.notifyMessages(null, [refused.error]); return; }
                destinations.forEach((destination) => { destination.state = 'pending'; destination.retryable = false; });
                Object.assign(item.event.delivery, { state: 'pending', retryable: false });
            }, () => {});
        },
        isEditing(item) { return !!this.editing && this.editing.seq === item.eventSeq; },
        startEdit(item) { if (!this.queues('chat-edit') && needsConnection()) return; this.tapKey = null; this.editing = { seq: item.eventSeq, body: item.event.body || '' }; },
        cancelEdit() { this.editing = null; this.$nextTick(() => this.focusComposer()); },
        editLast() {
            const me = this.me.userId;
            for (let i = this.events.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                const event = this.events[i];
                if (event.type !== 'message' || event.senderUserId !== me || event.redacted || event.poll) continue;
                if (Date.now() - Number(event.sentDate || 0) >= EDIT_WINDOW || !this.canPost) return false;
                if (!this.queues('chat-edit') && needsConnection()) return true;
                this.editing = { seq: Number(event.eventSeq), body: event.body || '' };
                this.$nextTick(() => this.scrollToSeq(Number(event.eventSeq), false));
                return true;
            }
            return false;
        },
        saveEdit(item, body) {
            // an encrypted edit keeps the message's files (their names, types and keys) in its ciphertext
            const kept = this.sealed ? moqui.chat.keptFiles((item.event && item.event.attachments) || item.attachments) : [];
            const sent = this.sealed ? moqui.chat.sealMessage(this.roomId, this.memberIds(), body, kept).then((sealed) => this.change('chat-edit', 'edit', { chatRoomId: this.roomId,
                eventSeq: item.eventSeq, encryptedJson: sealed.encryptedJson, mentionUserIds: sealed.mentionUserIds }), (err) => {
                // the edit stays open; asked, then saved again (§6.1 rule 3)
                this.sealRefused(err, () => this.saveEdit(item, body));
                throw err;
            })
                : this.change('chat-edit', 'edit', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, body });
            return sent.then((json) => (json.event && this.sealed ? moqui.chat.openEvent(this.roomId, json.event).then(() => json) : json)).then((json) => {
                if (json.event) {
                    applyEvent(this.events, json.event, this.me.userId);
                    if (this.threadView.rootSeq != null) applyEvent(this.threadView.events, json.event, this.me.userId, this.threadView.rootSeq);
                }
                this.editing = null;
                this.$nextTick(() => this.focusComposer());
                return json;
            });
        },
        react(item, key) {
            if (!this.canPost || (!this.queues('chat-react') && needsConnection())) return;
            this.tapKey = null;
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const reactions = item.event.reactions = item.event.reactions || [];
            let entry = reactions.find((reaction) => reaction.key === key);
            const mine = !!entry && entry.mine;
            // a reaction of this key still waiting in the app's outbox is taken back by dropping it: the server never had it
            const waiting = moqui.chat && moqui.chat.changesOf ? moqui.chat.changesOf(this.roomId, item.eventSeq)
                .filter((change) => change.kind === 'chat-react' && change.key === key) : [];
            if (waiting.some((change) => change.status === 'sending')) {
                moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('The reaction is being sent: change it once it shows') }]);
                return;
            }
            // shown at once; the push of the reaction (or of its removal) leaves it as it is
            if (mine) {
                entry.userIds = entry.userIds.filter((id) => id !== me);
                entry.count = Math.max(0, entry.count - 1);
                entry.mine = false;
                if (entry.count <= 0) reactions.splice(reactions.indexOf(entry), 1);
            } else {
                if (!entry) { entry = { key, count: 0, userIds: [], mine: false }; reactions.push(entry); }
                if (!entry.userIds.includes(me)) { entry.userIds.push(me); entry.count++; }
                entry.mine = true;
            }
            if (waiting.length) {
                waiting.forEach((change) => moqui.chat.discard(change.clientRef));
                return;
            }
            const note = { key, add: !mine };
            if (this.sealed) {
                // an encrypted reaction (C7): the key is encrypted; mine is taken back by its own eventSeq
                const taken = mine ? moqui.chat.myReaction(this.roomId, item.eventSeq, key, me) : null;
                if (mine && taken != null) this.change('chat-react', 'react', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, reactionEventSeq: taken }, note).catch(() => {});
                else if (!mine) moqui.chat.sealReaction(this.roomId, this.memberIds(), key).then((encryptedJson) => this.change('chat-react', 'react', { chatRoomId: this.roomId,
                    eventSeq: item.eventSeq, encryptedJson }, note), (err) => {
                    // not sent: taken off again, then asked (§6.1 rule 3) or said, never dropped silently
                    const shown = reactions.find((reaction) => reaction.key === key);
                    if (shown) {
                        shown.userIds = shown.userIds.filter((id) => id !== me);
                        shown.count = Math.max(0, shown.count - 1);
                        shown.mine = false;
                        if (shown.count <= 0) reactions.splice(reactions.indexOf(shown), 1);
                    }
                    this.sealRefused(err, () => this.react(item, key));
                }).catch(() => {});
                return;
            }
            this.change('chat-react', 'react', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, key }, note).catch(() => {});
        },
        // the options my vote has: the latest still waiting in the app's outbox, else the poll's as the server answered it
        myOptions(item) {
            const waiting = moqui.chat && moqui.chat.changesOf ? moqui.chat.changesOf(this.roomId, item.eventSeq)
                .filter((change) => change.kind === 'poll-vote' && change.status !== 'failed' && Array.isArray(change.optionIds)) : [];
            if (waiting.length) return waiting[waiting.length - 1].optionIds.slice();
            return item.poll.options.filter((other) => other.mine).map((other) => other.id);
        },
        // ---- a message's changes through the desktop client's outbox ----
        // the app's outbox takes this change of a message (a server at clientApi 4): it waits there, offline too; never on the web
        queues(kind) { return !!(moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.hostKinds && moqui.chat.state.hostKinds.includes(kind) && moqui.hostOutbox && moqui.hostOutbox()); },
        // A message's change (chat-edit, chat-redact, chat-react, poll-vote): through the app's outbox where it takes it,
        // resolving {queued: true} (it shows under the message until it is answered), else the transition name asked now.
        change(kind, name, params, note) {
            const queued = moqui.chat && moqui.chat.queueChange ? moqui.chat.queueChange(kind, params, note) : null;
            if (!queued) return this.post(name, params);
            return queued.catch((err) => {
                moqui.notifyMessages(null, (err && err.message) || t('This change cannot wait for the connection'));
                throw err;
            });
        },
        // the changes of a message waiting in the app's outbox (none on the web)
        changesOf(item) {
            void (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.changes);
            return moqui.chat && moqui.chat.changesOf && item && item.eventSeq > 0 ? moqui.chat.changesOf(this.roomId, item.eventSeq) : [];
        },
        changeText(change) {
            const what = { 'chat-edit': t('Edit'), 'chat-redact': t('Deletion'), 'chat-react': t('Reaction'), 'poll-vote': t('Vote') }[change.kind] || t('Change');
            if (change.status === 'sending') return fill(t('{what}: sending…'), { what });
            if (change.status === 'failed') return change.error ? fill(t('{what} not made: {error}'), { what, error: change.error }) : fill(t('{what} not made'), { what });
            if (change.status === 'held') return fill(t('{what}: waiting, sign in again to send it'), { what });
            return fill(this.offline || this.noConnection ? t('{what}: waiting for the connection') : t('{what}: waiting to send'), { what });
        },
        retryChange(change) { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.retry(change.clientRef); },
        // a change not made, dropped: a reaction shown at once is read again as the server has it
        discardChange(change) {
            if (!moqui.chat) return;
            moqui.chat.discard(change.clientRef).then(() => { if (change.kind === 'chat-react' || change.kind === 'poll-vote') this.rereadMessage(change.eventSeq); }, () => {});
        },
        // one message read again (the store's copy offline), in place
        rereadMessage(seq) {
            moqui.request(this.url('timeline'), { params: { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: seq, limit: 1 } })
                .then((result) => this.openPage(result.json || {}))
                .then((page) => {
                    const event = (page.eventList || []).find((one) => Number(one.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
                    if (!event) return;
                    [this.events, this.threadView.events].forEach((list) => {
                        const at = list.findIndex((one) => Number(one.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
                        if (at >= 0) list.splice(at, 1, event);
                    });
                }, (err) => console.info('Chat: the message was not read again', err && err.status));
        },
        // a message's change from the app's outbox answered: shown as the answer has it (the push may follow)
        onChangeAnswered(payload) {
            if (!payload || payload.chatRoomId !== this.roomId || this.state !== 'ready') return;
            const json = payload.json || {};
            const me = this.me.userId;
            if (payload.kind === 'chat-edit' && json.event) {
                Promise.resolve(this.sealed ? moqui.chat.openEvent(this.roomId, json.event) : null).then(() => {
                    applyEvent(this.events, json.event, me);
                    if (this.threadView.rootSeq != null) applyEvent(this.threadView.events, json.event, me, this.threadView.rootSeq);
                }, () => {});
            } else if (payload.kind === 'chat-redact') {
                this.applyRedaction(payload.eventSeq);
            } else if (payload.kind === 'poll-vote' && json.poll) {
                this.applyFields(payload.eventSeq, { poll: json.poll });
            } else if (payload.kind === 'chat-react') {
                // the server made it the other way than shown (a toggle it had already): the message read again as it has it
                const add = payload.note && payload.note.add;
                if (json.added != null && add != null && !!json.added !== !!add) this.rereadMessage(payload.eventSeq);
            }
        },
        applyRedaction(seq) {
            const target = this.events.concat(this.threadView.events).find((one) => Number(one.eventSeq) === Number(seq));
            const event = { type: 'redaction', eventSeq: -1, relatesToEventSeq: Number(seq), content: { target: 'message' }, sentDate: Date.now(), threadRootEventSeq: null };
            if (!target || target.threadRootEventSeq == null) applyEvent(this.events, event, this.me.userId);
            if (this.threadView.rootSeq != null) applyEvent(this.threadView.events, event, this.me.userId, this.threadView.rootSeq);
        },
        pin(item, pinned) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.tapKey = null;
            if (item.event) item.event.pinned = pinned;
            this.post('pin', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, pinned: pinned ? 'true' : 'false' }).then(() => {
                moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: pinned ? t('Pinned to the room') : t('Unpinned') }]);
                if (this.side === 'pinned') this.loadPinned();
            }, () => {});
        },
        redact(item) {
            if (!this.queues('chat-redact') && needsConnection()) return;
            this.confirm(t('Delete the message?'), t('It is removed for everyone; the room shows that a message was removed.')
                + (this.textMemberCount ? ' ' + t('Text members already got it as a text.') : ''), t('Delete'), true).then(() => {
                // through the app's outbox it shows as waiting under the message until it is answered
                this.change('chat-redact', 'redact', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq }).then((json) => {
                    if (!(json && json.queued)) this.applyRedaction(item.eventSeq);
                }, () => {});
            });
        },
        copyText(item) {
            const text = item.event.bodyText || plainOf(item.event.body);
            if (navigator.clipboard) navigator.clipboard.writeText(text || '').then(() => moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: t('Copied') }]), () => {});
        },
        copyLink(item) {
            const link = window.location.origin + this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(this.roomId) + '&eventSeq=' + item.eventSeq;
            if (navigator.clipboard) navigator.clipboard.writeText(link).then(() => moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: t('Link copied') }]), () => {});
        },
        // the record is made at once and the message filed on it (create#RecordFromChatMessage); the toast opens it
        openFileOn(item) { if (needsConnection()) return; this.tapKey = null; this.fileOn = { open: true, item, value: null, busy: false }; },
        fileOnRecord() {
            const value = String(this.fileOn.value || '');
            const at = value.indexOf('|');
            if (at <= 0) return;
            this.fileOn.busy = true;
            this.post('fileOnRecord', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: this.fileOn.item.eventSeq, recordEntityName: value.substring(0, at),
                recordId: value.substring(at + 1) }).then(() => { this.fileOn = { open: false, item: null, value: null, busy: false }; },
                () => { this.fileOn.busy = false; });
        },
        // a link in a message: a /qapps one opens in the canvas, any other in a new tab
        bodyClick(event) {
            const link = event.target && event.target.closest ? event.target.closest('a') : null;
            if (!link) return;
            const href = link.getAttribute('href') || '';
            event.preventDefault();
            // a room in Spam: its links do not open (Not spam first)
            if (this.filtered === 'spam') return;
            const origin = window.location.origin;
            const local = href.indexOf(origin + '/qapps') === 0 ? href.slice(origin.length) : href;
            if (local.indexOf('/qapps') === 0) this.$root.setUrl(local);
            else if (/^(https?:|mailto:|tel:)/i.test(href)) window.open(href, '_blank', 'noopener');
        },
        fileUrl(file, inline) {
            if (file && file.sealed) return file.blobUrl || '';
            return this.url('attachment') + '?chatAttachmentId=' + encodeURIComponent(file.chatAttachmentId) + (inline ? '&inline=true' : '');
        },
        // an encrypted room's file is fetched as ciphertext and decrypted here
        sealedUrl(file) { return this.url('attachment') + '?chatAttachmentId=' + encodeURIComponent(file.chatAttachmentId); },
        download(file) {
            if (file && file.sealed) {
                moqui.chat.openFile(this.sealedUrl(file), file, this.roomId).then((url) => this.downloadUrl(url, file.fileName || t('file')),
                    () => moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This file could not be decrypted') }]));
                return;
            }
            this.downloadUrl(this.fileUrl(file, false), file.fileName);
        },
        downloadUrl(href, name) {
            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.href = href;
            a.download = name || '';
            document.body.appendChild(a);
            a.click();
            setTimeout(() => document.body.removeChild(a), 0);
        },
        // the viewer, at file among the pictures and videos of list (the Media tab's, or a message's files): a swipe goes on
        preview(file, list) {
            const shown = (list || [file]).filter((one) => isImage(one) || isVideo(one));
            const index = Math.max(0, shown.indexOf(file));
            this.viewer = { open: true, list: shown.length ? shown : [file], index };
            this.openMedia(this.viewer.list[index]);
        },
        viewerStep(by) {
            const index = this.viewer.index + by;
            if (index < 0 || index >= this.viewer.list.length) return;
            this.viewer.index = index;
            this.openMedia(this.viewer.list[index]);
        },
        // a swipe of 50 px or more, more across than down: the next or the previous
        viewerTouch(event, start) {
            const point = (event.changedTouches || event.touches || [])[0];
            if (!point) return;
            if (start) { this.viewerSwipe = { x: point.clientX, y: point.clientY }; return; }
            const from = this.viewerSwipe;
            this.viewerSwipe = null;
            if (!from) return;
            const dx = point.clientX - from.x;
            if (Math.abs(dx) >= 50 && Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(point.clientY - from.y)) this.viewerStep(dx < 0 ? 1 : -1);
        },
        viewerClosed() { this.viewer = { open: false, list: [], index: 0 }; },
        // where a picture, video or sound plays from: the server's file, or an encrypted room's decrypted blob (once opened)
        mediaUrl(file) {
            if (!file) return '';
            if (file.sealed || file.encrypted) return file.blobUrl || '';
            return this.fileUrl(file, true);
        },
        // an encrypted room's file decrypted for its player or the viewer (nothing to do for a plain room's)
        openMedia(file) {
            if (!file || !(file.sealed || file.encrypted) || file.blobUrl) return;
            if (!file.sealed) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This file could not be decrypted') }]); return; }
            moqui.chat.openFile(this.sealedUrl(file), file, this.roomId).then((url) => { file.blobUrl = url; },
                () => moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This file could not be decrypted') }]));
        },
        hostOf(url) { try { return new URL(url).host; } catch (err) { return url; } },
        // a file of the Files pane in its message: in its thread when it is a reply there
        showFileInChat(file) {
            if (file.threadRootEventSeq != null) this.openThread(Number(file.threadRootEventSeq));
            else this.jumpTo(Number(file.eventSeq));
        },
        onDragOver(event) { if (this.canPost && event.dataTransfer && Array.from(event.dataTransfer.types || []).includes('Files')) this.dragOver = true; },
        onDrop(event) {
            this.dragOver = false;
            const files = Array.from((event.dataTransfer && event.dataTransfer.files) || []);
            const vm = this.side === 'thread' && this.composers && this.composers.thread ? this.composers.thread : this.composers && this.composers.main;
            if (files.length && vm && this.canPost) vm.upload(files);
        },

        // ---- the side pane ----
        openSide(name) {
            if (name === 'thread') return;
            // the panes the desktop client does not keep offline
            if (['search', 'threads', 'media', 'files', 'voice', 'links', 'reactions', 'pinned'].includes(name) && needsConnection()) return;
            this.side = name;
            if (name === 'pinned') this.loadPinned();
            if (name === 'threads') this.loadThreads(false);
            if (this.tabs[name]) this.loadTab(name, false);
            if (name === 'search' && !this.sealed) this.$nextTick(() => { const input = this.$el.querySelector('input[name="roomSearch' + this.uid + '"]'); if (input) input.focus(); });
        },
        closeSide() {
            if (this.side === 'thread') { this.threadView = { rootSeq: null, events: [], loading: false }; this.$emit('thread', null); }
            this.side = null;
        },
        openThread(seq, fromParent) {
            this.tapKey = null;
            this.side = 'thread';
            this.threadView = { rootSeq: Number(seq), events: [], loading: true };
            if (!fromParent) this.$emit('thread', Number(seq));
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, threadRootEventSeq: seq, limit: 200 }).then((page) => {
                if (this.threadView.rootSeq !== Number(seq)) return;
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                this.threadView.events = page.eventList || [];
                this.threadView.loading = false;
                this.$nextTick(() => {
                    const el = this.$refs.threadScroller;
                    if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
                    const vm = this.composers && this.composers.thread;
                    if (vm && !this.compact) vm.focus();
                });
            }, () => { this.threadView.loading = false; });
        },
        loadPinned() {
            this.pinned.loading = true;
            this.get('timeline', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, pinnedOnly: 'true', limit: 50 }).then((page) => {
                this.mergeNames(page.userNames);
                this.pinned = { list: page.eventList || [], loading: false };
            }, () => { this.pinned.loading = false; });
        },
        runSearch() {
            const text = String(this.searchPane.text || '').trim();
            if (this.sealed || !text || needsConnection()) return;
            this.searchPane.loading = true;
            this.get('search', { searchText: text, chatRoomId: this.roomId }).then((json) => {
                this.searchPane = { text, results: json.eventList || [], loading: false, searched: true };
            }, () => { this.searchPane.loading = false; });
        },
        // ---- the room's threads and files ----
        // the server's cursor is kept (date and root), since a pushed reply moves a thread to the top of the list here
        loadThreads(more) {
            const list = more ? this.threadsPane.list : [];
            const next = more ? this.threadsPane.next : null;
            this.threadsPane.loading = true;
            this.get('threads', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, mine: this.threadsPane.mine ? 'true' : 'false', beforeDate: next ? next.date : '',
                beforeEventSeq: next ? next.eventSeq : '', limit: 20 }).then((json) => {
                this.mergeNames(json.userNames);
                const seen = new Set(list.map((thread) => thread.eventSeq));
                const added = (json.threadList || []).filter((thread) => !seen.has(thread.eventSeq));
                this.threadsPane = Object.assign({}, this.threadsPane, { list: list.concat(added), hasMore: !!json.hasMore, loading: false,
                    next: json.hasMore && json.nextBeforeDate != null ? { date: json.nextBeforeDate, eventSeq: json.nextBeforeEventSeq } : null });
            }, () => { this.threadsPane.loading = false; });
        },
        lastReplyText(thread) {
            const who = thread.threadLastUserId === this.me.userId ? t('you') : this.nameOf(thread.threadLastUserId, thread.threadLastUserName).split(' ')[0];
            return fill(t('last reply {when} by {name}'), { when: shortWhen(thread.threadLastDate), name: who });
        },
        // a pushed reply moves its thread to the top with its new last reply; a thread not listed, or a removed message, reads the list again
        patchThreads(event) {
            const root = event.type === 'message' ? this.threadsPane.list.find((thread) => thread.eventSeq === Number(event.threadRootEventSeq)) : null;
            if (!root) { clearTimeout(this.threadsTimer); this.threadsTimer = setTimeout(() => this.loadThreads(false), 400); return; }
            const text = String(event.bodyText || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
            Object.assign(root, { threadReplyCount: root.threadReplyCount + 1, threadLastDate: event.sentDate, threadLastEventSeq: Number(event.eventSeq),
                threadLastUserId: event.senderUserId, threadLastUserName: event.senderName || null, lastSnippet: text.length > 100 ? text.slice(0, 99) + '…' : text });
            this.threadsPane.list = [root].concat(this.threadsPane.list.filter((thread) => thread !== root));
        },
        // ---- the details' tabs (Comms-Messaging §5.1): each a page at a time by the server's cursor, more as it scrolls ----
        // A tab's latest request wins (a token per tab): a filter changed, or the tab read again, while a page loads drops
        // that page's answer. A page of more never lists an item twice (a reaction taken back between pages).
        loadTab(name, more) {
            const tab = this.tabs[name];
            if (!tab || (more && (tab.loading || tab.next == null))) return;
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            const token = this.tabToken(name);
            tab.loading = true;
            this.fetchTab(name, more ? tab.next : '').then((page) => {
                if (roomId !== this.roomId || this.tabTokens[name] !== token) return;
                const current = this.tabs[name];
                const known = new Set(more ? current.list.map((item) => this.tabKey(name, item)) : []);
                const list = (more ? current.list : []).concat(page.list.filter((item) => !known.has(this.tabKey(name, item))));
                this.tabs[name] = Object.assign({}, current, { list, next: page.next, loading: false, loaded: true });
                this.$nextTick(() => this.fillTab(name));
            }, () => {
                if (roomId === this.roomId && this.tabTokens[name] === token) this.tabs[name] = Object.assign({}, this.tabs[name], { loading: false });
            });
        },
        // a pushed change: the tab's first page read again and merged at the top, so a tab scrolled far keeps its place;
        // what the first page no longer has, of the stretch it covers, is gone (a removed message, a reaction taken back)
        refreshTab(name) {
            const tab = this.tabs[name];
            if (!tab) return;
            if (!tab.loaded) { this.loadTab(name, false); return; }
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            const token = this.tabToken(name);
            this.fetchTab(name, '').then((page) => {
                if (roomId !== this.roomId || this.tabTokens[name] !== token) return;
                const current = this.tabs[name];
                const fresh = new Set(page.list.map((item) => this.tabKey(name, item)));
                // the first page is all there is, or what is older than its last item stays
                const last = page.list.length ? this.tabOrder(name, page.list[page.list.length - 1]) : null;
                const older = page.next == null ? [] : current.list.filter((item) => !fresh.has(this.tabKey(name, item))
                    && (last == null || this.tabOrder(name, item) < last));
                this.tabs[name] = Object.assign({}, current, { list: page.list.concat(older), next: page.next == null ? null : current.next, loading: false, loaded: true });
            }, () => null);
        },
        tabToken(name) {
            this.tabTokens = this.tabTokens || {};
            this.tabTokens[name] = (this.tabTokens[name] || 0) + 1;
            return this.tabTokens[name];
        },
        // an item of a tab: its key, and where it sorts (newest first)
        tabKey(name, item) {
            if (name === 'reactions') return String(item.eventSeq);
            if (name === 'links') return item.eventSeq + ' ' + item.url;
            return String(item.chatAttachmentId);
        },
        tabOrder(name, item) { return Number(name === 'reactions' ? item.latestReactionSeq || 0 : item.eventSeq || 0); },
        // one page of a tab, {list, next}
        fetchTab(name, cursor) {
            const roomId = this.roomId;
            const tab = this.tabs[name];
            if (name === 'links') {
                // an encrypted room's links are found here, in the messages this page has decrypted
                if (this.sealed) return Promise.resolve({ list: this.sealedLinks(), next: null });
                return this.get('links', { chatRoomId: roomId, beforeEventSeq: cursor, limit: 40 }).then((json) => ({ list: json.links || [], next: json.nextBeforeEventSeq ?? null }));
            }
            if (name === 'reactions') {
                return this.get('reactions', { chatRoomId: roomId, onlyToMe: tab.onlyToMe ? 'true' : 'false', beforeReactionSeq: cursor, limit: 40 }).then((json) => {
                    const list = json.messages || [];
                    // an encrypted room's: their text and reaction keys decrypted here, as the timeline's are
                    const opened = this.sealed && moqui.chat.openEvents ? moqui.chat.openEvents(roomId, list, (file) => this.sealedUrl(file)) : Promise.resolve(list);
                    return opened.then(() => ({ list: list.map((message) => (message.encrypted && message.bodyText != null
                        ? Object.assign(message, { snippet: shortText(message.bodyText) }) : message)), next: json.nextBeforeReactionSeq ?? null }));
                });
            }
            const kind = FILE_TABS[name];
            if (!this.sealed) {
                return this.get('files', Object.assign({ chatRoomId: roomId, beforeEventSeq: cursor, limit: 40 }, kind.params))
                    .then((json) => ({ list: json.fileList || [], next: json.nextBeforeEventSeq ?? null }));
            }
            // an encrypted room: the server knows no type, so its files are read (a few pages at most each time), their
            // details decrypted from their messages, and sorted into the tab here
            const found = [];
            const page = (before, left) => this.get('files', { chatRoomId: roomId, beforeEventSeq: before, limit: 40 }).then((json) =>
                this.openSealedFiles(roomId, json.fileList || []).then((files) => {
                    found.push(...files.filter((file) => kind.keeps(file)));
                    const next = json.nextBeforeEventSeq ?? null;
                    if (next != null && left > 1 && found.length < 12) return page(next, left - 1);
                    if (name === 'media') found.filter(isImage).forEach((file) => this.openMedia(file));
                    return { list: found, next };
                }));
            return page(cursor, 5);
        },
        // an encrypted room's files with their names, types and keys, from their messages decrypted (C7); a file whose
        // message cannot be read keeps none, and sorts as a file
        openSealedFiles(roomId, files) {
            const byMessage = {};
            files.forEach((file) => { (byMessage[file.eventSeq] = byMessage[file.eventSeq] || []).push(file); });
            return Promise.all(Object.values(byMessage).map((group) => {
                const first = group[0];
                if (!first.encryptedContent || !moqui.chat.openSealed) return null;
                return moqui.chat.openSealed(roomId, first.encryptedEventSeq || first.eventSeq, first.encryptedSentDate || first.sentDate,
                    first.senderUserId, first.encryptedContent).then((opened) => {
                    const sealedFiles = opened && !opened.error && opened.content && Array.isArray(opened.content['io.moqui.files']) ? opened.content['io.moqui.files'] : [];
                    group.forEach((file) => {
                        const one = sealedFiles.find((item) => item.chatAttachmentId === file.chatAttachmentId);
                        if (one) Object.assign(file, { fileName: one.name || null, contentType: one.type || null, fileSize: one.size || file.fileSize, sealed: one.file || null });
                    });
                }, () => null);
            })).then(() => files);
        },
        // the links of an encrypted room's messages loaded and decrypted here, the newest first
        sealedLinks() {
            const out = [];
            for (const event of this.events.slice().reverse()) {
                if (event.type !== 'message' || event.redacted || !event.body) continue;
                for (const url of linksIn(event.body)) out.push({ eventSeq: Number(event.eventSeq), url, title: null, siteName: null,
                    senderUserId: event.senderUserId || null, senderName: event.senderName || null, sentDate: event.sentDate, threadRootEventSeq: null });
            }
            return out;
        },
        // a pushed event that changes what a tab lists: it reads its first page again
        tabTouched(name, event) {
            if (event.type === 'redaction') return true;
            if (name === 'reactions') return event.type === 'reaction';
            if (name === 'links') return event.type === 'edit' || (event.type === 'message' && /https?:\/\//i.test(String(event.body || event.bodyText || '')));
            return event.type === 'message' && (event.attachments || []).length > 0;
        },
        // more as the tab scrolls near its end
        onTabScroll(event) {
            const el = event.target;
            if (el && el.scrollTop + el.clientHeight >= el.scrollHeight - 160) this.loadTab(this.side, true);
        },
        // a page that does not fill the tab: the next one at once
        fillTab(name) {
            const el = this.$el && this.$el.querySelector('.m-chat-tab');
            const tab = this.tabs[name];
            if (el && this.side === name && tab && tab.next != null && !tab.loading && el.scrollHeight <= el.clientHeight + 8) this.loadTab(name, true);
        },

        // ---- forward ----
        forwardedText(forwardOf) {
            return fill(t('Forwarded from {name} · {when}'), { name: this.nameOf(forwardOf.senderUserId, forwardOf.senderName), when: shortWhen(forwardOf.sentDate) });
        },
        openForward(item) { if (needsConnection()) return; this.tapKey = null; this.forward = { open: true, item, roomId: null, comment: '', busy: false }; },
        sendForward() {
            const target = this.forward.roomId;
            if (!target || !this.forward.item) return;
            const escape = (text) => String(text).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');
            const comment = String(this.forward.comment || '').trim();
            this.forward.busy = true;
            this.post('send', { chatRoomId: target, body: comment ? '<p>' + escape(comment).replace(/\n/g, '<br>') + '</p>' : '', forwardOfChatRoomId: this.roomId,
                forwardOfEventSeq: this.forward.item.eventSeq, clientRef: moqui.chat && moqui.chat.newClientRef ? moqui.chat.newClientRef() : '' }).then((json) => {
                this.forward = { open: false, item: null, roomId: null, comment: '', busy: false };
                if (json.event) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: t('Forwarded'), link: this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(target)
                    + '&eventSeq=' + json.eventSeq, linkText: t('Open') }]);
                if (target === this.roomId) this.onSent({ chatRoomId: target, threadRootEventSeq: null, json });
            }, () => { this.forward.busy = false; });
        },

        // ---- polls ----
        // ---- rich messages (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 13) ----
        openCard(threadRoot) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.cardBox = { open: true, threadRoot: threadRoot || null };
        },
        // a reply is mine to tap on another's message in a room with no outbound bridge; a link or a call always opens
        canTap(item, one) {
            if (!one || one.type !== 'reply') return true;
            return !item.mine && this.canPost && !this.roomBridges.some((bridge) => bridge.outbound !== false) && !(this.room && this.room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtExternal');
        },
        tapSuggestion(item, one, index, cardIndex) {
            if (one.type === 'url') { if (/^https?:\/\//i.test(one.url || '')) window.open(one.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer'); return; }
            if (one.type === 'dial') { if (/^\+[1-9]\d{3,14}$/.test(one.phone || '')) window.open('tel:' + one.phone, '_self'); return; }
            if (!this.canTap(item, one)) return;
            this.post('replySuggestion', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, index, cardIndex: cardIndex == null ? '' : cardIndex,
                clientRef: moqui.chat && moqui.chat.newClientRef ? moqui.chat.newClientRef() : '' }).then((json) => {
                if (json && json.eventSeq != null) this.onSent({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, threadRootEventSeq: item.event.threadRootEventSeq ?? null, json });
            }, () => {});
        },
        // a card from the composer (send#Rich): resolves true once sent
        sendRich(rich, attachmentIds, threadRoot) {
            return this.post('sendRich', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, richJson: JSON.stringify(rich), attachmentIds: (attachmentIds || []).join(','),
                threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot || '', clientRef: moqui.chat && moqui.chat.newClientRef ? moqui.chat.newClientRef() : '' }).then((json) => {
                if (!json || json.eventSeq == null) return false;
                this.onSent({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot, json });
                if (json.event && json.event.rich) this.applyFields(json.eventSeq, { rich: json.event.rich });
                return true;
            });
        },
        openPoll(threadRoot, question) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.pollBox = { open: true, threadRoot: threadRoot || null, question: question || '', options: ['', ''], multiple: 'N', anonymous: 'N', closes: '', busy: false };
        },
        optionLabel(index) { return fill(t('Option {n}'), { n: index + 1 }); },
        createPoll() {
            if (!this.canMakePoll) return;
            const box = this.pollBox;
            const closes = box.closes ? new Date(String(box.closes).replace(' ', 'T')).getTime() : null;
            if (closes != null && !(closes > Date.now())) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('A poll closes later than now') }]); return; }
            box.busy = true;
            const threadRoot = box.threadRoot;
            this.post('createPoll', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, question: String(box.question).trim(),
                optionsJson: JSON.stringify(box.options.map((text) => String(text || '').trim()).filter((text) => text)), multiple: box.multiple === 'Y' ? 'true' : 'false',
                anonymous: box.anonymous === 'Y' ? 'true' : 'false', closesDate: closes || '', threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot || '',
                clientRef: moqui.chat && moqui.chat.newClientRef ? moqui.chat.newClientRef() : '' }).then((json) => {
                this.pollBox = Object.assign({}, this.pollBox, { open: false, busy: false });
                this.onSent({ chatRoomId: this.roomId, threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot, json });
                if (json.event && json.event.poll) this.applyFields(json.eventSeq, { poll: json.event.poll });
            }, () => { this.pollBox.busy = false; });
        },
        pollOpen(poll) { return !!poll && !poll.closed && !(poll.closesDate && poll.closesDate <= this.tick); },
        canVote(item) { return this.canPost && this.pollOpen(item.poll); },
        canClosePoll(item) { return this.pollOpen(item.poll) && this.isMember && (item.poll.createdByUserId === this.me.userId || this.canModerate); },
        // my choice as it will be once a vote waiting in the app's outbox is counted
        optionIcon(item, option) {
            const mine = this.myOptions(item).map(Number).includes(Number(option.id));
            if (item.poll.multiple) return mine ? 'sym_o_check_box' : 'sym_o_check_box_outline_blank';
            return mine ? 'sym_o_radio_button_checked' : 'sym_o_radio_button_unchecked';
        },
        waitingVote(item) {
            return !!(moqui.chat && moqui.chat.changesOf) && moqui.chat.changesOf(this.roomId, item.eventSeq).some((change) => change.kind === 'poll-vote' && change.status !== 'failed');
        },
        optionShare(item, option) { return Number(option.voteCount || 0) / Math.max(1, Number(item.poll.voterCount || item.poll.totalVotes || 0)); },
        votersText(option) { return (option.voterIds || []).map((id) => (id === this.me.userId ? t('You') : this.nameOf(id))).join(', '); },
        pollFooter(poll) {
            const parts = [poll.voterCount === 1 ? t('1 vote') : fill(t('{count} votes'), { count: poll.voterCount || 0 })];
            if (poll.multiple) parts.push(t('choose any'));
            if (poll.anonymous) parts.push(t('anonymous'));
            if (!this.pollOpen(poll)) parts.push(t('closed'));
            else if (poll.closesDate) parts.push(fill(t('closes {when}'), { when: fullTime(poll.closesDate) }));
            return parts.join(' · ');
        },
        // my vote: one option (again takes it back), or in a poll of several choices this one added or taken out
        vote(item, option) {
            if (!this.canVote(item)) return;
            this.tapKey = null;
            // from my vote as it will be once what waits is counted
            const mine = this.myOptions(item).map(Number);
            const has = mine.includes(Number(option.id));
            const chosen = item.poll.multiple ? (has ? mine.filter((id) => id !== Number(option.id)) : mine.concat([Number(option.id)])) : (has ? [] : [Number(option.id)]);
            const params = { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, optionIds: chosen.join(',') };
            const queued = this.queues('poll-vote');
            if (!chosen.length && queued) {
                // a vote taken back (no option): the app's outbox keeps only a vote for options, so it is asked now, and
                // never ahead of a vote still waiting
                if (this.waitingVote(item)) { moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'info', message: t('Your vote is waiting to be counted: take it back once it is') }]); return; }
                if (needsConnection()) return;
            }
            (chosen.length ? this.change('poll-vote', 'votePoll', params) : this.post('votePoll', params)).then((json) => {
                if (json.poll) this.applyFields(item.eventSeq, { poll: json.poll });
            }, () => {});
        },
        closePoll(item) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.confirm(t('Close the poll?'), t('It takes no more votes; the votes stay.'), t('Close'), false).then(() => {
                this.post('closePoll', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq }).then((json) => {
                    if (json.poll) this.applyFields(item.eventSeq, { poll: json.poll });
                }, () => {});
            });
        },
        // the sender takes the link previews off their message, for good
        removePreviews(item) {
            this.post('removePreviews', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq }).then(() => this.applyFields(item.eventSeq, { linkPreviews: [] }), () => {});
        },

        addMembers() {
            const ids = this.addPeople.userIds || [];
            if (!ids.length) return;
            this.addPeople.busy = true;
            this.post('addMembers', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, userIds: ids.join(',') }).then(() => {
                this.addPeople = { userIds: [], busy: false };
                this.reloadMeta();
            }, () => { this.addPeople.busy = false; });
        },
        setRole(person, roleEnumId) { this.post('setRole', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, userId: person.userId, roleEnumId }).then(() => this.reloadMeta(), () => {}); },
        removeMember(person) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.confirm(t('Take out of the room?'), fill(t('{name} no longer sees the room or hears of it.'), { name: person.name }), t('Take out'), true).then(() => {
                const who = person.userId ? { userId: person.userId } : { chatActorId: person.chatActorId };
                this.post('removeMember', Object.assign({ chatRoomId: this.roomId }, who)).then(() => this.reloadMeta(), () => {});
            });
        },

        // ---- my settings in the room, the room's settings ----
        setLevel(level) {
            this.post('setNotification', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, notificationLevelEnumId: level }).then(() => {
                if (this.member) this.member.notificationLevelEnumId = level;
                this.$emit('changed');
            }, () => {});
        },
        toggleMute() {
            const muted = !(this.member && this.member.isMuted);
            this.post('setNotification', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, isMuted: muted ? 'true' : 'false' }).then(() => {
                if (this.member) this.member.isMuted = muted;
                this.$emit('changed');
            }, () => {});
        },
        // my own archive: the room leaves my list until a newer message (ChatRoomMember.archivedEventSeq)
        toggleArchive() {
            const archived = !this.archivedByMe;
            this.post('setNotification', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, archived: archived ? 'true' : 'false' }).then(() => {
                if (this.member) this.member.archivedEventSeq = archived ? this.events.reduce((max, event) => Math.max(max, Number(event.eventSeq) || 0), Number((this.room && this.room.lastEventSeq) || 0)) : null;
                this.$emit('changed');
            }, () => {});
        },
        togglePin() {
            const pinned = !(this.member && this.member.isPinned);
            this.post('setNotification', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, isPinned: pinned ? 'true' : 'false' }).then(() => {
                if (this.member) this.member.isPinned = pinned;
                this.$emit('changed');
            }, () => {});
        },
        join() { this.post('join', { chatRoomId: this.roomId }).then(() => { this.$emit('changed'); this.load(); }, () => {}); },
        // who becomes an owner when the last owner leaves, by the rule of remove#Member (ChatServices.xml): the
        // longest-standing moderator, else member; agents and outside actors never. The service decides in the end.
        ownerHeir() {
            if (this.isDirect || !this.isOwner) return null;
            const others = this.members.filter((person) => person.userId && !person.isAgent && person.userId !== this.me.userId)
                .slice().sort((a, b) => (a.joinedDate || 0) - (b.joinedDate || 0));
            if (!others.length || others.some((person) => person.roleEnumId === 'CmrOwner')) return null;
            return others.find((person) => person.roleEnumId === 'CmrModerator') || others[0];
        },
        leave() {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            const direct = this.isDirect;
            const heir = this.ownerHeir();
            const consequence = t('You no longer hear of its messages; a public room you can join again.');
            this.confirm(direct ? t('Hide this conversation?') : t('Leave the room?'),
                direct ? t('It comes back with the next message.')
                    : (heir ? consequence + ' ' + fill(t('You are its last owner: {name} becomes an owner.'), { name: heir.name || heir.userId }) : consequence),
                direct ? t('Hide') : t('Leave'), !direct).then(() => {
                this.post('leave', { chatRoomId: this.roomId }).then(() => this.$emit('left', this.roomId), () => {});
            });
        },
        openSettings() {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.settings = { open: true, roomName: this.room.roomName || '', topic: this.room.topic || '', visibility: this.room.visibilityEnumId || '',
                callE2ee: !!this.room.callE2eeRequired, verifiedOnly: !!this.room.verifiedDevicesOnly, busy: false };
        },
        // ---- the room's bridges (C1, a bridge administrator) ----
        directionText(direction) {
            return direction === 'CrbIn' ? t('Only in') : direction === 'CrbOut' ? t('Only out') : t('Both ways');
        },
        newBridge() {
            this.bridgeForm = { open: true, chatRoomBridgeId: null, chatBridgeId: null, externalRoomId: '', externalRoomName: '', externalRoomUrl: '', directionEnumId: 'CrbBoth', busy: false };
            moqui.request(this.url('bridgeChoices'), {}).then((result) => {
                this.bridgeChoices = ((result.json && result.json.bridgeList) || []).map((b) => ({ value: b.chatBridgeId, label: b.name + (b.networkName ? ' (' + b.networkName + ')' : '') }));
            }, () => { this.bridgeChoices = []; });
        },
        editBridge(bridge) {
            this.bridgeForm = { open: true, chatRoomBridgeId: bridge.chatRoomBridgeId, chatBridgeId: bridge.chatBridgeId, externalRoomId: '',
                externalRoomName: bridge.externalRoomName || '', externalRoomUrl: bridge.externalRoomUrl || '', directionEnumId: bridge.directionEnumId || 'CrbBoth', busy: false };
        },
        saveBridge() {
            const form = this.bridgeForm;
            form.busy = true;
            const params = { chatRoomId: this.roomId, externalRoomName: form.externalRoomName || '', externalRoomUrl: form.externalRoomUrl || '', directionEnumId: form.directionEnumId };
            if (form.chatRoomBridgeId) params.chatRoomBridgeId = form.chatRoomBridgeId;
            else Object.assign(params, { chatBridgeId: form.chatBridgeId, externalRoomId: form.externalRoomId });
            this.post('storeRoomBridge', params).then((json) => {
                form.busy = false;
                if (json.errors) { moqui.notifyMessages([], json.errors); return; }
                this.bridgeForm = Object.assign({}, form, { open: false });
                this.reloadMeta();
            }, () => { form.busy = false; });
        },
        endBridge(bridge) {
            this.confirm(t('End this bridge?'), t('Nothing more goes to it or comes from it; messages waiting to go are not sent.'), t('End'), true).then(() => {
                this.post('endRoomBridge', { chatRoomBridgeId: bridge.chatRoomBridgeId }).then((json) => {
                    if (json.errors) { moqui.notifyMessages([], json.errors); return; }
                    this.reloadMeta();
                }, () => {});
            }, () => {});
        },
        saveSettings() {
            const params = { chatRoomId: this.roomId, roomName: this.settings.roomName, topic: this.settings.topic || '' };
            if (this.isOwner && this.settings.visibility && this.settings.visibility !== this.room.visibilityEnumId) params.visibilityEnumId = this.settings.visibility;
            this.settings.busy = true;
            // the calls' encryption (W8) is its own setting, saved first
            const e2ee = !this.sealed && !!this.settings.callE2ee !== !!this.room.callE2eeRequired
                ? this.post('setCallEncryption', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, required: this.settings.callE2ee ? 'true' : 'false' }).then((json) => {
                    if (json.errors) { moqui.notifyMessages([], json.errors); throw json; }
                }) : Promise.resolve();
            // C7 hardening: the room's keys to verified devices only (ChatKeyServices; the browsers read it before the next message)
            const verified = this.sealed && !!this.settings.verifiedOnly !== !!this.room.verifiedDevicesOnly
                ? () => this.post('setVerifiedDevicesOnly', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, verifiedDevicesOnly: this.settings.verifiedOnly ? 'true' : 'false' }).then((json) => {
                    if (json.errors) { moqui.notifyMessages([], json.errors); throw json; }
                    if (moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.settingsChanged) moqui.crypto.settingsChanged();
                }) : () => null;
            e2ee.then(verified).then(() => this.post('updateRoom', params)).then(() => {
                this.settings = Object.assign({}, this.settings, { open: false, busy: false });
                this.reloadMeta();
                this.$emit('changed');
            }, () => { this.settings.busy = false; });
        },
        setArchived(archived) {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.confirm(archived ? t('Archive the room?') : t('Take the room out of the archive?'),
                archived ? t('An archived room is read only and leaves the members\' room lists.') : t('Its members can post again.'),
                archived ? t('Archive') : t('Take out'), archived).then(() => {
                this.post('updateRoom', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, archived: archived ? 'true' : 'false' }).then(() => {
                    this.settings.open = false;
                    this.reloadMeta();
                    this.$emit('changed');
                }, () => {});
            });
        },
        // the room in Chat in the desktop client's main window (moquiDesktop.openInShell), which holds the crypto device
        openInShell() {
            const desktop = window.moquiDesktop;
            const path = this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(this.roomId);
            if (desktop && typeof desktop.openInShell === 'function') desktop.openInShell(path).catch((err) => moqui.notifyMessages(null, (err && err.message) || String(err)));
            else this.openInChat();
        },
        openInChat() { this.$root.setUrl(this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(this.roomId)); },
        // Esc: an open dialog or menu closes itself; else the edit, then the top back layer (moqui.back: the side pane,
        // a thread), then mark the room read
        onEscape() {
            if (moqui.back && moqui.back.popupOpen()) return false;
            if (this.editing) { this.cancelEdit(); return true; }
            if (moqui.back ? moqui.back.pop({ popups: false, base: false, within: this.$el }) : (this.side && (this.closeSide(), true))) return true;
            this.markRead(true);
            return true;
        },
        // ---- Send later and Remind me (Comms-Messaging phase 15) ----
        whenText(at) { return moqui.chat.whenText(at, Date.now()); },
        // a long press on Send that opened its menu: a short vibration on a phone
        buzz() { if (this.useBubbles && navigator.vibrate) { try { navigator.vibrate(10); } catch (e) { /* no vibration here */ } } },
        reminderOf(item) { return item && item.eventSeq != null ? moqui.chat.reminderOf(this.scheduleState.reminderList, this.roomId, item.eventSeq) : null; },
        reminderText(item) { const reminder = this.reminderOf(item); return reminder ? fill(t('Reminder at {time}'), { time: this.whenText(reminder.remindDate) }) : ''; },
        askWhen(kind, title, note, current, onPick, onClear) { this.whenBox = { open: true, kind, title, note: note || '', current: current || null, onPick, onClear: onClear || null }; },
        whenPicked(at) { const box = this.whenBox; this.whenBox = Object.assign({}, box, { open: false }); if (box.onPick) box.onPick(at); },
        whenCleared() { const box = this.whenBox; this.whenBox = Object.assign({}, box, { open: false }); if (box.onClear) box.onClear(); },
        reloadSchedule() { return moqui.chat.loadSchedule((name) => this.url(name)); },
        openRemind(item) {
            const reminder = this.reminderOf(item);
            this.askWhen('remind', t('Remind me'), '', reminder, (at) => this.post('setReminder', { chatRoomId: this.roomId, eventSeq: item.eventSeq, remindDate: at }).then((json) => {
                if (json.chatMessageReminderId) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: fill(t('Reminder set for {time}'), { time: this.whenText(at) }) }]);
                return this.reloadSchedule();
            }, () => {}), reminder ? () => this.post('cancelReminder', { chatMessageReminderId: reminder.chatMessageReminderId }).then(() => this.reloadSchedule(), () => {}) : null);
        },
        // Send later from a composer: when, then the message scheduled (done clears the composer). In an encrypted room this
        // device keeps the draft, sealed, and the server only its time.
        openSendLater(message, done) {
            const note = this.sealed ? t('This device keeps the message and sends it at its time. It must be open then; if it is not, it sends it when it next opens.') : '';
            this.askWhen('send', t('Send later'), note, null, (at) => this.scheduleMessage(message, at, done));
        },
        scheduleMessage(message, at, done) {
            const threadRoot = message.threadRoot ? Number(message.threadRoot) : null;
            const replyTo = threadRoot ? null : this.replyTo;
            const where = { chatRoomId: this.roomId, sendDate: at, replyToEventSeq: replyTo ? replyTo.eventSeq : '', threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot || '' };
            const scheduled = () => {
                if (!threadRoot) this.replyTo = null;
                done();
                moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'success', message: fill(t('Scheduled for {time}'), { time: this.whenText(at) }) }]);
                return this.reloadSchedule();
            };
            if (!this.sealed) {
                return this.post('scheduleMessage', Object.assign(where, { body: message.body || '', chatAttachmentIds: (message.attachmentIds || []).join(',') }))
                    .then((json) => (json.chatScheduledMessageId ? scheduled() : null), () => {});
            }
            const deviceId = moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId ? moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId() : null;
            return this.post('scheduleMessage', Object.assign(where, { heldByDeviceId: deviceId || '' })).then((json) => {
                const id = json.chatScheduledMessageId;
                if (!id) return null;
                const draft = { body: message.body || '', replyToEventSeq: where.replyToEventSeq || null, threadRootEventSeq: threadRoot };
                return moqui.chat.keepHeld(id, draft, moqui.crypto.sealLocal).then(scheduled, (err) => {
                    // the draft could not be kept here: no placeholder either
                    console.error('A held message was not kept', err);
                    moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('This browser could not keep the message: it was not scheduled') }]);
                    return this.post('cancelScheduled', { chatScheduledMessageId: id }).then(() => this.reloadSchedule(), () => {});
                });
            }, () => {});
        },
        openScheduled() {
            this.scheduledBox.open = true;
            // this device's held drafts: their texts, opened here only
            for (const row of this.scheduledHere) {
                if (!this.isHolder(row) || this.heldTexts[row.chatScheduledMessageId] != null) continue;
                moqui.chat.openHeld(row.chatScheduledMessageId, moqui.crypto.openLocal).then((draft) => {
                    this.heldTexts = Object.assign({}, this.heldTexts, { [row.chatScheduledMessageId]: draft ? plainOf(draft.body) : t('The draft is not on this device') });
                }, () => { this.heldTexts = Object.assign({}, this.heldTexts, { [row.chatScheduledMessageId]: t('The draft does not open on this device') }); });
            }
        },
        isHolder(row) { return !!(row && row.held && moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId() === row.heldByDeviceId); },
        scheduledFailed(row) { return row.status === 'failed' || moqui.chat.heldStuck(row) || (row.status === 'scheduled' && row.reviewNeeded); },
        scheduledIcon(row) { return this.scheduledFailed(row) ? 'sym_o_error' : row.status === 'sent' ? 'sym_o_schedule' : row.held ? 'sym_o_devices' : 'sym_o_schedule_send'; },
        reasonText(code) {
            return t({ notMember: 'You are no longer in the room', archived: 'The room is archived', blocked: 'You blocked this conversation',
                accountDisabled: 'Your account is closed', noAccess: 'You no longer have the app', deviceGone: 'The draft was on a device that is gone',
                deviceAway: 'The device that keeps it has not been open since it was due',
                draftLost: 'The draft was lost on the device that held it' }[code] || 'The message could not be sent');
        },
        scheduledWhen(row) {
            if (row.status === 'failed') return fill(t('Not sent: {reason}'), { reason: this.reasonText(row.reasonCode) });
            if (row.status === 'sent' && row.sentAfterCancel) return fill(t('Sent after you cancelled it, at {time}'), { time: this.whenText(row.sentDate) });
            if (row.status === 'sent') return fill(t('Sent late, at {time}'), { time: this.whenText(row.sentDate) });
            if (row.deviceGone) return fill(t("Can't be sent: the draft was on {device}"), { device: row.heldByDeviceName || t('another device') });
            // a device not seen for a week: it fails once overdue that long
            if (row.deviceAway) return fill(t("Can't be sent from {device}: it has not been open for a week"), { device: row.heldByDeviceName || t('another device') });
            if (row.reviewNeeded) return t('Waiting for you: someone in the room has a new device or identity');
            if (row.held && !this.isHolder(row)) return fill(t('Sends {time}, from {device}'), { time: this.whenText(row.sendDate), device: row.heldByDeviceName || t('another device') });
            return fill(t('Sends {time}'), { time: this.whenText(row.sendDate) });
        },
        scheduledText(row) {
            if (!row.held) return row.bodyText || (row.files && row.files.length ? t('Files') : '');
            if (this.isHolder(row)) return this.heldTexts[row.chatScheduledMessageId] != null ? this.heldTexts[row.chatScheduledMessageId] : '…';
            return fill(t('Held on {device}'), { device: row.heldByDeviceName || t('another device') });
        },
        canEditScheduled(row) { return row.status === 'scheduled' && !row.deviceGone && (!row.held || this.isHolder(row)); },
        // a failed held one is not sent again: its draft went from this device
        canSendScheduled(row) { return row.held ? row.status === 'scheduled' && !row.deviceGone && this.isHolder(row) : row.status === 'scheduled' || row.status === 'failed'; },
        // a held message waiting for the sender's decision: the problems asked as the composer asks them, then sent
        reviewScheduled(row) {
            return moqui.chat.sendHeld(row, (name) => this.url(name), true).then((out) => {
                if (out && out.review) this.sealRefused(out.error, () => this.reviewScheduled(row));
                return this.reloadSchedule();
            }, (err) => { console.error('A held message was not sent', err); return this.reloadSchedule(); });
        },
        retimeScheduled(row) {
            this.askWhen('send', t('Change the time'), '', null, (at) => this.post('updateScheduled', { chatScheduledMessageId: row.chatScheduledMessageId, sendDate: at,
                deviceId: row.held ? moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId() || '' : '' }).then(() => this.reloadSchedule(), () => {}));
        },
        // a new text: the server's, or (held) this device's sealed draft
        saveScheduled(row, body) {
            if (!row.held) return this.post('updateScheduled', { chatScheduledMessageId: row.chatScheduledMessageId, body }).then(() => this.reloadSchedule());
            return moqui.chat.openHeld(row.chatScheduledMessageId, moqui.crypto.openLocal).then((draft) => moqui.chat.keepHeld(row.chatScheduledMessageId,
                Object.assign({}, draft || {}, { body }), moqui.crypto.sealLocal)).then(() => {
                this.heldTexts = Object.assign({}, this.heldTexts, { [row.chatScheduledMessageId]: plainOf(body) });
            });
        },
        sendScheduledNow(row) {
            const sent = row.held ? moqui.chat.sendHeld(row, (name) => this.url(name), true) : this.post('sendScheduledNow', { chatScheduledMessageId: row.chatScheduledMessageId });
            return Promise.resolve(sent).then((out) => {
                if (out && out.lost) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: this.reasonText('draftLost') }]);
                return this.reloadSchedule();
            }, (err) => { console.error('A scheduled message was not sent now', err); return this.reloadSchedule(); });
        },
        cancelScheduled(row) {
            return this.confirm(t('Cancel the message'), t('The scheduled message is deleted and not sent.'), t('Cancel the message'), true)
                .then(() => this.post('cancelScheduled', { chatScheduledMessageId: row.chatScheduledMessageId })).then(() => {
                    if (this.isHolder(row)) moqui.chat.dropHeld(row.chatScheduledMessageId);
                    return this.reloadSchedule();
                }, () => {});
        },
        dismissScheduled(row) { return this.post('dismissScheduled', { chatScheduledMessageId: row.chatScheduledMessageId }).then(() => this.reloadSchedule(), () => {}); },
        // a confirmation (Quasar's Dialog plugin): resolves on OK; Cancel, Esc or a click outside resolves nothing
        confirm(title, message, okLabel, danger) {
            return new Promise((resolve) => {
                this.$q.dialog({ title, message, ok: { label: okLabel || t('OK'), color: danger ? 'negative' : 'primary', unelevated: true, noCaps: true },
                    cancel: { label: t('Cancel'), flat: true, noCaps: true } }).onOk(() => resolve());
            });
        }
    },
    mounted() {
        this.composers = {};
        this.unsubscribe = [];
        // what Back closes (moqui.back): the message sheet, an edit, the side pane or thread
        if (moqui.back) {
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.side, () => this.closeSide()));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.editing, () => this.cancelEdit()));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.sheet.open, () => { this.sheet.open = false; }));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.peopleBox.open, () => { this.peopleBox.open = false; }));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.infoBox.open, () => { this.infoBox.open = false; }));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.back.track(this, () => this.viewer.open, () => { this.viewer.open = false; }));
        }
        if (moqui.chat) {
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('event', (payload) => this.onEvent(payload)));
            if (moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.onRoomKeys) this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.crypto.onRoomKeys(() => this.onRoomKeys()));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('read', (payload) => this.onReadSignal(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('room', (payload) => this.onRoomSignal(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('update', (payload) => this.onUpdate(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('expired', (payload) => this.onExpired(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('joinRequests', (payload) => { if (payload.chatRoomId === this.roomId) this.joinUi.count = Number(payload.pendingCount || 0); }));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('sent', (payload) => this.onSent(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('changed', (payload) => this.onChangeAnswered(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('rooms', (payload) => this.onRoomsChanged(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('connection', (payload) => this.onConnection(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('leftOut', () => { this.leftOutTick += 1; }));
            // a member's devices or identity changed (a new device, a verification): the room's trust again (§6.1 rule 3)
            if (moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.onTrust) this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.crypto.onTrust((userIds) => {
                if ((userIds || []).some((id) => id === this.me.userId || this.members.some((person) => person.userId === id))) this.loadTrust();
            }));
        }
        this.onVisibleBound = () => this.onVisible();
        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', this.onVisibleBound);
        this.ticker = setInterval(() => { this.tick = Date.now(); }, 1000);
        if (window.ResizeObserver) {
            this.resizer = new window.ResizeObserver(() => { if (this.$el && this.$el.clientWidth) this.width = this.$el.clientWidth; });
            this.resizer.observe(this.$el);
        }
        this.width = this.$el.clientWidth || 0;
        this.load();
    },
    beforeUnmount() {
        this.holdCancel();
        (this.unsubscribe || []).forEach((off) => off());
        document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', this.onVisibleBound);
        clearInterval(this.ticker);
        clearTimeout(this.readTimer);
        clearTimeout(this.highlightTimer);
        clearTimeout(this.anchorTimer);
        clearTimeout(this.threadsTimer);
        clearTimeout(this.tabTimer);
        if (this.resizer) this.resizer.disconnect();
        if (this.opened && moqui.chat) moqui.chat.closeRoom(this.roomId);
        this.typingStop();
    },
    template: roomTemplate
};

module.exports = {
    name: 'Chat',
    components: { 'chat-room': chatRoom },
    data() {
        return {
            loaded: false, height: 600, me: {}, prefs: {}, rooms: [], spamRooms: [], filteredCount: 0, filter: 'all', search: '', drafts: {}, roomId: null, seq: null, thread: null,
            newDirect: { open: false, userIds: [], busy: false, name: '', fromNumber: '', numbers: [] }, newRoom: { open: false, type: 'private', name: '', topic: '', userIds: [], busy: false },
            browse: { open: false, search: '', list: [], loading: false, listed: [] },
            // the folded groups of the rail, by key (kept per user: foldKey), the Activity or Threads feed and each direct
            // chat's mail line, by room
            folded: {}, feed: { view: null, list: [], next: null, loading: false, loaded: false, seq: 0 }, mailLines: {},
            // a dm link's unsaved message to people with no direct chat yet: {userIds, name, text, busy, encrypted}
            pendingDirect: null,
            // that message, sent by the room once createDirect made it: {roomId, body}
            firstMessage: null,
            // my other devices' requests to verify with this one (a new device being set up, §6.5), dismissed here, and those
            // devices by deviceId (their names and when they were added)
            dismissedOwn: {}, ownDevices: {}
        };
    },
    computed: {
        params() { return this.$root.currentParameters || {}; },
        // the unsaved direct chat's label: the room its first send makes, once encryptionDefault answered
        pendingLabel() {
            const pending = this.pendingDirect;
            if (!pending || pending.encrypted == null) return null;
            return moqui.chat.e2eeLabel({ roomTypeEnumId: 'CrtDirect', visibilityEnumId: 'CrvMembers', encrypted: pending.encrypted });
        },
        // another of my devices asks to verify with this one, open in Chat (not only on My devices)
        ownRequests() {
            const me = this.me && this.me.userId;
            const list = (moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.state && moqui.crypto.state.verifications) || [];
            return me ? list.filter((flow) => !flow.weStarted && flow.otherUserId === me && !flow.cancelled && !this.dismissedOwn[flow.flowId]) : [];
        },
        // below 1024 px the rail and the room are one pane (style-guide §3.8)
        stacked() { return this.$q.screen.lt.md; },
        base() { return this.$root.basePath + '/' + this.chatPath(); },
        linkBase() { return this.$root.linkBasePath + '/' + this.chatPath(); },
        myStatus() { return (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.state.me) || {}; },
        statusOptions() {
            return [{ value: 'online', dot: 'online', label: t('Online') }, { value: 'away', dot: 'away', label: t('Away') },
                { value: 'dnd', dot: 'dnd', label: t('Do not disturb') }, { value: 'invisible', dot: 'offline', label: t('Invisible') }];
        },
        myStatusText() {
            const me = this.myStatus;
            const option = this.statusOptions.find((item) => item.value === (me.status || 'online')) || this.statusOptions[0];
            return me.statusText || me.emoji ? ((me.emoji ? me.emoji + ' ' : '') + (me.statusText || '')) : option.label;
        },
        memberRooms() { return this.rooms.filter((room) => room.isMember); },
        // New direct message: what is picked (moqui.chat.pickKind), and phone numbers offered when the user has one that texts
        pickKind() { return moqui.chat.pickKind(this.newDirect.userIds); },
        pickParameters() { return { numbers: (this.newDirect.numbers || []).length ? 'true' : '' }; },
        // the phone's own contacts with a number, as the picker's extra options (the mobile app only; plans/Comms-Messaging.md §9)
        contactOptions() { return (this.newDirect.numbers || []).length && moqui.chat && moqui.chat.contactOptions ? moqui.chat.contactOptions : null; },
        pickHint() {
            const kind = this.pickKind;
            if (kind === 'number') return t('A text from your number: the conversation with this number opens.');
            if (kind === 'numbers') return t('A group text from your number: one conversation with these numbers.');
            if (kind === 'mixed') return t('A text goes to phone numbers only: start it without the people.');
            if (kind === 'group') return t('A group chat; with a name it is a room, which can take more people later.');
            return t('One person, or several for a group message. A conversation you already have with them opens again.');
        },
        filterItems() {
            const unread = this.memberRooms.filter((room) => this.countsOf(room).unread || this.countsOf(room).mentions).length;
            const mentions = this.memberRooms.filter((room) => this.countsOf(room).mentions).length;
            const archived = this.memberRooms.filter((room) => this.archivedByMe(room)).length;
            const phone = this.memberRooms.some((room) => room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtExternal');
            return [{ value: 'all', label: t('All') }, { value: 'unread', label: t('Unread'), count: unread }, { value: 'mentions', label: t('Mentions'), count: mentions },
                { value: 'activity', label: t('Activity') }, { value: 'threads', label: t('Threads') },
                { value: 'direct', label: t('Direct') }, { value: 'rooms', label: t('Rooms') }, { value: 'records', label: t('Records') }]
                .concat(phone || this.filter === 'phone' ? [{ value: 'phone', label: t('Phone') }] : [])
                .concat(this.filteredCount || this.filter === 'spam' ? [{ value: 'spam', label: t('Spam & blocked'), count: this.filteredCount }] : [])
                .concat(archived || this.filter === 'archived' ? [{ value: 'archived', label: t('Archived'), count: archived }] : []);
        },
        // Activity and Threads replace the rooms in the rail, until a search there finds rooms
        feedShown() { return (this.filter === 'activity' || this.filter === 'threads') && !String(this.search || '').trim(); },
        // Activity: each item; Threads: one row per thread (find#ChatThreads), its latest reply first
        feedRows() { return this.feed.view === this.filter ? this.feed.list : []; },
        mailLabel() { return moqui.chat.e2eeLabel({ mail: true }); },
        shownRooms() {
            const text = String(this.search || '').trim().toLowerCase();
            // Spam & blocked: the rooms out of sight, read when the chip is chosen (rooms?filter=spam)
            return (this.filter === 'spam' ? this.spamRooms : this.rooms).filter((room) => {
                const counts = this.countsOf(room);
                // my own archive (ChatRoomMember.archivedEventSeq): only under Archived, or found by a search
                if (this.filter !== 'spam' && (this.filter === 'archived' ? !this.archivedByMe(room) : (!text && this.archivedByMe(room)))) return false;
                if (this.filter === 'unread' && !(counts.unread || counts.mentions)) return false;
                if (this.filter === 'mentions' && !counts.mentions) return false;
                if (this.filter === 'direct' && room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtDirect') return false;
                if (this.filter === 'rooms' && !(room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtPrivate' || room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtPublic')) return false;
                if (this.filter === 'records' && room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtRecord') return false;
                if (this.filter === 'phone' && room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtExternal') return false;
                if (text) {
                    const hay = [room.displayName, room.topic, room.record && room.record.title, room.lastMessage && room.lastMessage.snippet].join(' ').toLowerCase();
                    if (hay.indexOf(text) < 0) return false;
                }
                return true;
            });
        },
        // All: Pinned, then Recent, Phone (the rooms of a phone number, CrtExternal) and Bridged (rooms a bridge carries to
        // another network), each folding (Comms-Messaging §3); a group's label shows when there is more than one
        groups() {
            const shown = this.shownRooms;
            if (this.filter !== 'all' || String(this.search || '').trim()) return [{ key: 'found', label: null, rows: shown }];
            const pinned = shown.filter((room) => room.isPinned);
            const rest = shown.filter((room) => !room.isPinned);
            const phone = rest.filter((room) => room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtExternal');
            const bridged = rest.filter((room) => room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtExternal' && room.bridged);
            const recent = rest.filter((room) => room.roomTypeEnumId !== 'CrtExternal' && !room.bridged);
            const out = [];
            const add = (key, label, rows) => {
                if (!rows.length) return;
                const unread = rows.filter((room) => this.countsOf(room).unread || this.countsOf(room).mentions).length;
                out.push({ key, label, rows, unread });
            };
            add('pinned', t('Pinned'), pinned);
            add('recent', t('Recent'), recent);
            add('phone', t('Phone'), phone);
            add('bridged', t('Bridged'), bridged);
            if (out.length === 1 && out[0].key === 'recent') out[0].label = null;
            return out;
        }
    },
    watch: {
        // a request from another of my devices: its name and when it was added, read once (moqui.crypto.setupStatus)
        ownRequests(list) {
            if (!(list || []).some((flow) => flow.otherDeviceId && !this.ownDevices[flow.otherDeviceId]) || !moqui.crypto || !moqui.crypto.setupStatus) return;
            moqui.crypto.setupStatus().then((status) => {
                const known = Object.assign({}, this.ownDevices);
                ((status && status.otherDevices) || []).forEach((device) => { known[device.deviceId] = device; });
                this.ownDevices = known;
            }, () => null);
        },
        // New room's Encrypted follows the default for the people picked, until the user sets it (§6.5)
        'newRoom.userIds'(ids) { if (this.newRoom.open) this.newRoomDefault(ids); },
        // Activity and Threads read their feed when shown
        filter(value) { if (value === 'activity' || value === 'threads') this.loadFeed(false); if (value === 'spam') this.loadSpam(); },
        // a room change opens that room; the screen is not remounted for it
        '$root.currentParameters': { handler() { if (this.isCurrent()) this.applyParams(); }, deep: true }
    },
    methods: {
        t,
        fill,
        shortWhen,
        chatPath() {
            const list = this.$root.currentPathList || [];
            const at = list.indexOf('Chat');
            return at > 0 && list[at - 1] !== 'Panel' ? list.slice(0, at + 1).join('/') : 'Comms/Chat';
        },
        isCurrent() { const list = this.$root.currentPathList || []; return list[list.length - 1] === 'Chat' && list[list.length - 2] !== 'Panel'; },
        url(name) { return this.base + '/' + name; },
        go(target) { if (target) this.$root.setUrl(target); },
        get(name, params) {
            return moqui.request(this.url(name), { params: params || {} }).then((result) => result.json || {}, (err) => {
                if (moqui.unreachable && moqui.unreachable(err)) needsConnection(); else moqui.handleAjaxError(err);
                throw err;
            });
        },
        post(name, params) {
            if (needsConnection()) return Promise.reject({ status: 0, offline: true });
            return moqui.request(this.url(name), { method: 'POST', params: params || {} }).then((result) => {
                const json = result.json || {};
                if (json.messageInfos && json.messageInfos.length) moqui.notifyMessages(json.messageInfos, json.errors);
                return json;
            }, (err) => {
                if (moqui.unreachable && moqui.unreachable(err)) needsConnection(); else moqui.handleAjaxError(err);
                throw err;
            });
        },
        roomIcon(room) { return moqui.chat.roomIcon(room); },
        // the room's E2EE label (moqui.chat.e2eeLabel): a row shows its lock when it is end to end only
        labelOf(room) { return moqui.chat.e2eeLabel(room); },
        bridgeText(room) {
            const names = (room.bridgeNetworkNames || []).join(', ');
            return room.notConnected ? fill(t('Not connected to {names}: messages wait here'), { names }) : fill(t('Also on {names}'), { names });
        },
        archivedByMe(room) { return moqui.chat.isArchived(room); },
        countsOf(room) { return moqui.chat.countsOf(room); },
        snippetOf(room) { return moqui.chat.roomSnippet(room, this.me.userId); },
        clearLabel(value) { return t(CLEAR_LABELS[String(value)] || CLEAR_LABELS['0']); },
        clearFilters() { this.filter = 'all'; this.search = ''; },

        // ---- the groups' folding, kept per user in this browser (under the storage scope: an account's in the desktop app) ----
        foldKey() { return moqui.scopedKey ? moqui.scopedKey('moqui.chat.folded.' + (this.me.userId || '')) : 'moqui.chat.folded.' + (this.me.userId || ''); },
        readFolded() {
            let value = null;
            try { value = JSON.parse(window.localStorage.getItem(this.foldKey()) || 'null'); } catch (err) { value = null; }
            this.folded = value && typeof value === 'object' && !Array.isArray(value) ? value : {};
        },
        toggleFold(key) {
            const next = Object.assign({}, this.folded);
            if (next[key]) delete next[key]; else next[key] = true;
            this.folded = next;
            try { window.localStorage.setItem(this.foldKey(), JSON.stringify(next)); } catch (err) { /* kept for this page only */ }
        },

        // ---- Activity (find#ChatActivity, the activity transition) and Threads (find#ChatThreads, myThreads) ----
        // the rows of a page: a key each, and a thread's as its last reply (who wrote it, when, its text)
        feedItems(view, items) {
            if (view !== 'threads') return items.map((item) => Object.assign(item, { key: [item.kind, item.chatRoomId, item.eventSeq].join(':') }));
            return items.map((item) => Object.assign(item, { key: 'thread:' + item.chatRoomId + ':' + item.threadRootEventSeq, kind: 'thread',
                actorUserId: item.lastUserId, actorName: item.lastUserName, date: item.lastDate, snippet: item.lastSnippet || item.rootSnippet,
                eventSeq: item.lastEventSeq, messageEventSeq: item.lastEventSeq }));
        },
        feedRequest(view, cursor) {
            return view === 'threads' ? this.get('myThreads', { limit: 40, cursor }) : this.get('activity', { limit: 40, cursor });
        },
        // the first page (more false) or the next by the cursor; an encrypted room's text decrypted here
        loadFeed(more) {
            const view = this.filter;
            if (view !== 'activity' && view !== 'threads') return;
            const feed = this.feed;
            if (more && (feed.view !== view || feed.next == null || feed.loading)) return;
            const seq = ++feed.seq;
            // another view's list is not shown under this one; the same view's stays until its first page is read again
            if (!more && feed.view !== view) { feed.view = view; feed.list = []; feed.next = null; feed.loaded = false; }
            feed.loading = true;
            this.feedRequest(view, more ? feed.next : null).then((json) => this.openFeed(this.feedItems(view, json.items || [])).then((list) => {
                if (seq !== feed.seq) return;
                feed.list = more ? feed.list.concat(list.filter((item) => !feed.list.some((other) => other.key === item.key))) : list;
                feed.next = json.nextCursor == null ? null : json.nextCursor;
                feed.view = view;
                feed.loading = false;
                feed.loaded = true;
                this.$nextTick(() => this.fillFeed());
            })).catch(() => { if (seq === feed.seq) { feed.loading = false; feed.loaded = true; } });
        },
        // what is new at the top: the first page read again and merged above the rows already loaded (a thread moves up with
        // its new reply), so the pages scrolled to stay
        refreshFeedTop() {
            const view = this.filter;
            const feed = this.feed;
            if ((view !== 'activity' && view !== 'threads') || feed.view !== view || feed.loading) return;
            const seq = feed.seq;
            this.feedRequest(view, null).then((json) => this.openFeed(this.feedItems(view, json.items || [])).then((list) => {
                if (seq !== feed.seq || feed.view !== view) return;
                const fresh = new Set(list.map((item) => item.key));
                feed.list = list.concat(feed.list.filter((item) => !fresh.has(item.key)));
            })).catch(() => null);
        },
        // an encrypted room's items: the message's text and a reaction's key, decrypted in this page (moqui.chat.openSealed);
        // one this device cannot read says so
        openFeed(items) {
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const sealed = items.filter((item) => item.encrypted && moqui.chat.openSealed);
            return Promise.all(sealed.map((item) => {
                // a reaction is to my message; the rest are the actor's own messages (a thread's, its last reply)
                const sender = item.kind === 'reaction' ? me : item.actorUserId;
                const text = item.encryptedContent ? moqui.chat.openSealed(item.chatRoomId, item.encryptedEventSeq || item.messageEventSeq, item.encryptedSentDate || item.date,
                    sender, item.encryptedContent).then((opened) => {
                    item.text = opened && !opened.error && opened.content ? shortText(opened.content.body) : null;
                    item.unreadable = item.text == null;
                }, () => { item.unreadable = true; }) : Promise.resolve();
                const key = item.reactionEncrypted ? moqui.chat.openSealed(item.chatRoomId, item.eventSeq, item.reactionSentDate || item.date, item.actorUserId,
                    item.reactionEncrypted).then((opened) => { item.reactionKey = opened && !opened.error && opened.content ? opened.content.key || null : null; }, () => null) : Promise.resolve();
                return Promise.all([text, key]);
            })).then(() => items, () => items);
        },
        onFeedScroll(event) {
            const el = event.target;
            if (el && el.scrollTop + el.clientHeight >= el.scrollHeight - 160) this.loadFeed(true);
        },
        // a page that does not fill the list: the next one at once
        fillFeed() {
            const el = this.$el && this.$el.querySelector('.m-chat-feed');
            if (el && this.feed.next != null && !this.feed.loading && el.scrollHeight <= el.clientHeight + 8) this.loadFeed(true);
        },
        feedIcon(item) {
            return { mention: 'sym_o_alternate_email', reply: 'sym_o_reply', threadReply: 'sym_o_forum', thread: 'sym_o_forum', reaction: 'sym_o_add_reaction',
                reminder: 'sym_o_alarm' }[item.kind] || 'sym_o_chat';
        },
        // ---- scheduled messages and reminders (Comms-Messaging phase 15) ----
        // read, then this device's drafts of rows it no longer holds waiting dropped, and its due ones sent
        loadSchedule() {
            return moqui.chat.loadSchedule((name) => this.url(name)).then((schedule) => {
                const deviceId = moqui.crypto && moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId ? moqui.crypto.thisDeviceId() : null;
                if (schedule && schedule.loaded && deviceId) moqui.chat.pruneHeld(schedule.scheduledList, deviceId);
                return this.sendHeldDue();
            });
        },
        // this device's held messages that are due (an encrypted room's), one at a time; one that fails waits for the next look
        sendHeldDue() {
            const crypto = moqui.crypto;
            if (this.heldBusy || !crypto || !crypto.thisDeviceId || !moqui.chat.sendHeld) return;
            const due = moqui.chat.dueHeld(moqui.chat.state.schedule.scheduledList, crypto.thisDeviceId(), Date.now());
            if (!due.length) return;
            this.heldBusy = true;
            due.reduce((chain, row) => chain.then(() => moqui.chat.sendHeld(row, (name) => this.url(name), false).then((out) => {
                // a verified person's new device or identity: the sender decides, from the room's scheduled list
                if (out && out.review) moqui.notifyMessages([{ type: 'warning', message: t('A scheduled message waits for you: someone in the room has a new device or identity') }]);
            }).catch((err) => console.error('A held message was not sent; it is tried again', err))), Promise.resolve())
                .then(() => { this.heldBusy = false; return moqui.chat.loadSchedule((name) => this.url(name)); });
        },
        // the reminders at the top of Activity: the pending ones, soonest first
        reminderRows() { return this.filter === 'activity' && moqui.chat ? (moqui.chat.state.schedule.reminderList || []) : []; },
        reminderWhen(row) { return moqui.chat.whenText(row.remindDate, Date.now()); },
        reminderRoom(row) { return row.roomName || (moqui.chat.state.roomNames || {})[row.chatRoomId] || ''; },
        reminderSnippet(row) { return row.encrypted ? t('Encrypted message') : row.gone ? t('Message removed') : (row.snippet || ''); },
        openReminder(row) { this.openFeedItem({ chatRoomId: row.chatRoomId, messageEventSeq: row.eventSeq }); },
        cancelReminder(row) { return this.post('cancelReminder', { chatMessageReminderId: row.chatMessageReminderId }).then(() => moqui.chat.loadSchedule((name) => this.url(name)), () => {}); },
        feedTitle(item) {
            const name = item.actorName || t('Someone');
            if (item.kind === 'thread') {
                // "and others": more than one other person replied (by people, not by replies)
                if (item.actorUserId === this.me.userId) return item.replierCount > 0 ? t('You and others replied in a thread') : t('You replied in a thread');
                return item.replierCount > 1 ? fill(t('{name} and others replied in a thread'), { name }) : fill(t('{name} replied in a thread'), { name });
            }
            if (item.kind === 'mention') return fill(t('{name} mentioned you'), { name });
            if (item.kind === 'reply') return fill(t('{name} replied to you'), { name });
            if (item.kind === 'threadReply') return fill(t('{name} replied in a thread'), { name });
            if (item.kind === 'reaction') return item.reactionKey ? fill(t('{name} reacted {key} to your message'), { name, key: item.reactionKey }) : fill(t('{name} reacted to your message'), { name });
            if (item.kind === 'reminder') return fill(t("Reminder: {name}'s message"), { name });
            return name;
        },
        feedText(item) {
            if (item.encrypted) return item.text != null ? item.text : (item.unreadable ? t('Encrypted message') : '');
            return item.snippet || '';
        },
        // the message: in its room, at it; a thread reply, or a thread, in its thread
        openFeedItem(item) {
            const params = { chatRoomId: item.chatRoomId };
            const root = item.threadRootEventSeq;
            if (item.kind === 'thread' || (root != null && Number(root) !== Number(item.messageEventSeq))) { params.eventSeq = root; params.thread = root; }
            else params.eventSeq = item.messageEventSeq;
            this.$root.setUrl(this.linkBase + '?' + moqui.objToSearch(params));
        },
        // A push that concerns the feed shown: of someone else, a message or an edit that mentions me or replies to me, a
        // reply in a thread, or a reaction (Activity), and a reply in a thread (Threads). What is new is merged at the top.
        feedTouched(event) {
            if (!this.feedShown || !event || event.senderUserId === this.me.userId) return;
            const me = this.me.userId;
            const inThread = event.type === 'message' && event.threadRootEventSeq != null;
            const concerns = this.filter === 'threads' ? inThread
                : event.type === 'reaction' || inThread || ((event.type === 'message' || event.type === 'edit')
                    && (((event.mentions || []).includes(me)) || (!!event.replyTo && event.replyTo.senderUserId === me)));
            if (!concerns) return;
            clearTimeout(this.feedTimer);
            this.feedTimer = setTimeout(() => this.refreshFeedTop(), 600);
        },

        // ---- the mail line of a person's direct chat (find#DirectChatMail, the mailLines transition) ----
        loadMail() {
            if (noConnection()) return;
            moqui.chat.mailLines(this.url('mailLines')).then((lines) => { this.mailLines = lines; });
        },
        mailOf(room) { return room && room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtDirect' ? this.mailLines[room.chatRoomId] || null : null; },
        mailText(mail) { return fill(t('Email: {subject}'), { subject: mail.subject || t('(no subject)') }); },

        // ---- the room in the URL ----
        applyParams() {
            const p = this.params;
            if (!p.dm) this.pendingDirect = null;
            if (p.dm) { this.openDirectLink(String(p.dm).split(','), p.dmName ? String(p.dmName) : ''); return; }
            if (p.recordEntity && p.recordId) { this.openRecordRoom(p.recordEntity, p.recordId); return; }
            this.roomId = p.chatRoomId || null;
            this.seq = p.eventSeq ? Number(p.eventSeq) : null;
            this.thread = p.thread ? Number(p.thread) : null;
        },
        openRoom(id) {
            if (!id) return;
            if (id === this.roomId && !this.seq) return;
            this.$root.setUrl(this.linkBase + '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(id));
        },
        // the room a dm or record link found, in place of that link in the history
        replaceRoom(id) {
            const target = this.linkBase + (id ? '?chatRoomId=' + encodeURIComponent(id) : '');
            // a root with a history of its own (the desktop client's shell) replaces its entry itself
            if (this.$root.replaceUrl) { this.$root.replaceUrl(target); return; }
            this.$root.setUrl(target, null, null, false);
            try { window.history.replaceState(null, document.title, target); } catch (err) { /* the history stays */ }
        },
        closeRoom() { this.$root.setUrl(this.linkBase); },
        setThread(seq) { this.$root.setParameters({ thread: seq || null }); },
        onLeft(id) { if (this.roomId === id) this.closeRoom(); this.scheduleRooms(); },
        onRoomRead(id) {
            if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.state.unread[id] = { unread: 0, mentions: 0 };
            const room = this.rooms.find((item) => item.chatRoomId === id);
            if (room) { room.unreadCount = 0; room.mentionCount = 0; }
        },

        // ---- the rooms ----
        loadRooms() {
            return this.get('chatData').then((json) => {
                this.me = json.me || {};
                this.prefs = json.prefs || {};
                this.rooms = json.roomList || [];
                this.filteredCount = Number(json.filteredCount || 0);
                if (this.filter === 'spam') this.loadSpam();
                // a phone room's numbers by their names: the phone's contacts, the apps' call-context (plans/Comms-Messaging.md §9)
                if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.nameRooms) moqui.chat.nameRooms(this.rooms);
                if (moqui.chat) this.rooms.forEach((room) => {
                    if (room.isMember && room.chatRoomId !== this.roomId) moqui.chat.state.unread[room.chatRoomId] = { unread: room.unreadCount || 0, mentions: room.mentionCount || 0 };
                    if (room.otherUserId && room.presence && !moqui.chat.state.presence[room.otherUserId]) moqui.chat.state.presence[room.otherUserId] = { presence: room.presence, at: Date.now() };
                });
                if (!this.loaded) this.readFolded();
                this.loaded = true;
                // the people's mail lines: one request for the page, shared with the panel (moqui.chat.mailLines)
                if (this.rooms.some((room) => room.roomTypeEnumId === 'CrtDirect')) this.loadMail();
            }, () => { this.loaded = true; });
        },
        // A dm link: the direct chat of exactly those people when there is one, else an unsaved message to them whose first
        // send makes it (moqui.chat.directRoomFor; the rooms are read first)
        openDirectLink(userIds, name) {
            const ids = (userIds || []).map((id) => String(id).trim()).filter((id) => id);
            if (!ids.length) { this.replaceRoom(null); return; }
            const ready = this.roomsReady || Promise.resolve();
            ready.then(() => {
                const params = this.params;
                if (String(params.dm || '') !== ids.join(',')) return;
                const found = moqui.chat.directRoomFor(this.rooms, ids, this.me.userId);
                if (found) { this.pendingDirect = null; this.replaceRoom(found); return; }
                this.roomId = null;
                const kept = this.pendingDirect && this.pendingDirect.userIds.join(',') === ids.join(',') ? this.pendingDirect.text : '';
                const pending = { userIds: ids, name, text: kept, busy: false, encrypted: null };
                this.pendingDirect = pending;
                this.get('encryptionDefault', { userIds: ids.join(',') }).then((json) => {
                    if (this.pendingDirect && this.pendingDirect.userIds.join(',') === ids.join(',')) this.pendingDirect.encrypted = json.encrypted === true;
                }, () => null);
            });
        },
        // the unsaved message's Send: the direct chat made now, the message sent in it, and the room shown in place of the link
        sendPendingDirect() {
            const pending = this.pendingDirect;
            const text = pending ? String(pending.text || '').trim() : '';
            if (!pending || !text || pending.busy || needsConnection()) return;
            pending.busy = true;
            const escape = (line) => line.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
            const body = text.split(/\n{2,}/).map((part) => '<p>' + part.split('\n').map(escape).join('<br>') + '</p>').join('');
            this.post('createDirect', { userIds: pending.userIds.join(',') }).then((json) => {
                if (!json || !json.chatRoomId) { pending.busy = false; return; }
                // the room sends it once shown, through its own send: sealed there in an encrypted room (§6.5)
                this.firstMessage = { roomId: json.chatRoomId, body };
                this.pendingDirect = null;
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.replaceRoom(json.chatRoomId);
            }, () => { pending.busy = false; });
        },
        scheduleRooms() { clearTimeout(this.roomsTimer); this.roomsTimer = setTimeout(() => this.loadRooms(), 400); },
        // the rooms in Spam & blocked (find#Rooms filter spam), named as the rail's are
        loadSpam() {
            return this.get('rooms', { filter: 'spam' }).then((json) => {
                this.spamRooms = json.roomList || [];
                if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.nameRooms) moqui.chat.nameRooms(this.spamRooms);
            }, () => {});
        },
        sortRooms() {
            this.rooms.sort((left, right) => {
                if (left.isMember !== right.isMember) return left.isMember ? -1 : 1;
                if (left.isPinned !== right.isPinned) return left.isPinned ? -1 : 1;
                return (right.lastEventDate || 0) - (left.lastEventDate || 0);
            });
        },
        // a push of the page's chat store: the room's last message and its place in the rail
        onEvent(payload) {
            const event = payload && payload.event;
            if (!event) return;
            this.feedTouched(event);
            const room = this.rooms.find((item) => item.chatRoomId === payload.chatRoomId);
            if (!room) { this.scheduleRooms(); return; }
            const me = this.me.userId;
            room.lastEventSeq = Math.max(Number(room.lastEventSeq || 0), Number(event.eventSeq));
            if (event.type === 'message' && event.threadRootEventSeq == null) {
                const text = String(event.bodyText || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
                room.lastMessage = { eventSeq: event.eventSeq, senderUserId: event.senderUserId, senderName: event.senderName, sentDate: event.sentDate,
                    snippet: event.encrypted ? null : (text.length > 140 ? text.slice(0, 139) + '…' : text) || (event.attachments || []).map((file) => '📎 ' + file.fileName).join(', '),
                    redacted: false, encrypted: !!event.encrypted };
                room.lastEventDate = event.sentDate;
            } else if (event.type === 'edit' && room.lastMessage && Number(event.editsEventSeq) === Number(room.lastMessage.eventSeq)) {
                room.lastMessage.snippet = String(event.bodyText || '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
            } else if (event.type === 'redaction' && room.lastMessage && Number(event.relatesToEventSeq) === Number(room.lastMessage.eventSeq)) {
                this.scheduleRooms();
            }
            if (event.type === 'message' && event.senderUserId !== me && room.chatRoomId !== this.roomId) {
                const mentioned = (event.mentions || []).includes(me);
                const wants = mentioned || ((room.notificationLevelEnumId || 'CnlAll') === 'CnlAll' && !room.isMuted);
                if (wants && this.prefs.sounds !== false && !(moqui.chat && moqui.chat.quiet())) chime();
            }
            this.sortRooms();
        },
        onRoomSignal() { this.scheduleRooms(); },
        onReadSignal(payload) {
            if (!payload || (payload.userId && payload.userId !== this.me.userId)) return;
            if (payload.all) this.rooms.forEach((room) => { room.unreadCount = 0; room.mentionCount = 0; });
            else {
                const room = this.rooms.find((item) => item.chatRoomId === payload.chatRoomId);
                if (room) { room.unreadCount = 0; room.mentionCount = 0; }
            }
        },
        readDrafts() {
            const out = {};
            const prefix = draftPrefix();
            storage.keys(prefix).forEach((key) => { const id = key.slice(prefix.length); if (id.indexOf(':') < 0) out[id] = true; });
            this.drafts = out;
        },
        markAllRead() {
            this.post('markAllRead', {}).then(() => {
                if (moqui.chat) Object.keys(moqui.chat.state.unread).forEach((id) => { moqui.chat.state.unread[id] = { unread: 0, mentions: 0 }; });
                this.rooms.forEach((room) => { room.unreadCount = 0; room.mentionCount = 0; });
            }, () => {});
        },
        moveRoom(step, unreadOnly) {
            const list = this.shownRooms.filter((room) => !unreadOnly || this.countsOf(room).unread || this.countsOf(room).mentions || room.chatRoomId === this.roomId);
            if (!list.length) return false;
            const at = list.findIndex((room) => room.chatRoomId === this.roomId);
            let next = at < 0 ? (step > 0 ? 0 : list.length - 1) : at + step;
            if (unreadOnly && at >= 0) {
                next = -1;
                for (let i = at + step; i >= 0 && i < list.length; i += step) if (list[i].chatRoomId !== this.roomId) { next = i; break; }
            }
            if (next < 0 || next >= list.length) return true;
            this.openRoom(list[next].chatRoomId);
            return true;
        },

        // ---- my status ----
        setStatus(status) { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.setStatus({ status }); },
        usePreset(preset) {
            if (!moqui.chat) return;
            const clear = String(preset.clearAfter || '0');
            const params = { statusText: preset.text || '', emoji: preset.emoji || '' };
            if (clear === '0') params.clearAfterMinutes = 0;
            else params.clearAt = /^\d+$/.test(clear) ? Number(clear) : clear;
            moqui.chat.setStatus(params);
        },
        clearStatus() { if (moqui.chat) moqui.chat.setStatus({ clearStatus: true }); },

        // ---- new conversations ----
        openNewDirect() {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.newDirect = { open: true, userIds: [], busy: false, name: '', fromNumber: '', numbers: this.newDirect.numbers || [] };
            // the numbers the user may text from, read again each time
            this.get('textNumbers').then((json) => {
                this.newDirect.numbers = moqui.chat.numberOptions(json.numberList);
                if (!this.newDirect.fromNumber && this.newDirect.numbers.length) this.newDirect.fromNumber = this.newDirect.numbers[0].value;
            }, () => {});
        },
        // Start in New direct message: the number's room, a named room, or the direct chat (moqui.chat.startChat)
        startPicked() {
            const pick = { values: this.newDirect.userIds || [], name: this.newDirect.name, fromNumber: this.newDirect.fromNumber };
            // one Start at a time: a second would race the first to make the same room
            if (moqui.chat.pickKind(pick.values) === 'none' || this.newDirect.busy) return;
            this.newDirect.busy = true;
            moqui.chat.startChat((name, params) => this.post(name, params), pick).then((json) => {
                this.newDirect.busy = false;
                if (!json || !json.chatRoomId) return;
                this.newDirect.open = false;
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.openRoom(json.chatRoomId);
            }, () => { this.newDirect.busy = false; });
        },
        openNewRoom() {
            if (needsConnection()) return;
            this.newRoom = { open: true, type: 'private', name: '', topic: '', userIds: [], busy: false, encrypted: false, touched: false };
            this.newRoomDefault([]);
        },
        newRoomDefault(ids) {
            const asked = (ids || []).join(',');
            this.get('encryptionDefault', { userIds: asked }).then((json) => {
                if (this.newRoom.open && !this.newRoom.touched && (this.newRoom.userIds || []).join(',') === asked) this.newRoom.encrypted = json.encrypted === true;
            }, () => null);
        },
        dismissOwn(flow) { this.dismissedOwn = Object.assign({}, this.dismissedOwn, { [flow.flowId]: true }); },
        // whom an own request is from: the device's name and when it was added, not its id
        ownWho(flow) {
            const device = this.ownDevices[flow.otherDeviceId];
            if (!device) return t('another of your devices');
            const name = device.displayName || t('another of your devices');
            return device.createdDate ? fill(t('{name}, added {when}'), { name, when: moqui.chat.dateTime(device.createdDate) }) : name;
        },
        // New direct message's people (or those given) in their direct chat, made or found now
        startDirect(userIds) {
            const ids = (userIds || this.newDirect.userIds || []).map((id) => String(id).trim()).filter((id) => id);
            if (!ids.length || this.newDirect.busy) return;
            this.newDirect.busy = true;
            this.post('createDirect', { userIds: ids.join(',') }).then((json) => {
                Object.assign(this.newDirect, { open: false, userIds: [], busy: false, name: '' });
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.openRoom(json.chatRoomId);
            }, () => { this.newDirect.busy = false; });
        },
        createRoom() {
            this.newRoom.busy = true;
            // untouched, the server decides (everyone has a crypto device, §6.5); a public room is never encrypted
            const chosen = this.newRoom.type === 'public' ? 'false' : this.newRoom.touched ? (this.newRoom.encrypted ? 'true' : 'false') : '';
            this.post('createRoom', { roomTypeEnumId: this.newRoom.type, roomName: this.newRoom.name, topic: this.newRoom.topic || '',
                memberUserIds: (this.newRoom.userIds || []).join(','), encrypted: chosen }).then((json) => {
                this.newRoom = { open: false, type: 'private', name: '', topic: '', userIds: [], busy: false, encrypted: false };
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.openRoom(json.chatRoomId);
            }, () => { this.newRoom.busy = false; });
        },
        openRecordRoom(recordEntity, recordId) {
            this.post('recordRoom', { recordEntity, recordId }).then((json) => {
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.replaceRoom(json.chatRoomId);
            }, () => this.replaceRoom(null));
        },
        openBrowse() { if (needsConnection()) return; this.browse = { open: true, search: '', list: [], loading: false, listed: [] }; this.loadBrowse(); },
        loadBrowse() {
            this.browse.loading = true;
            this.get('listedRooms', { searchText: this.browse.search || '' }).then((json) => { this.browse.listed = json.roomList || []; }, () => {});
            this.get('rooms', { joinableOnly: 'true', searchText: this.browse.search || '' }).then((json) => {
                this.browse.list = json.roomList || [];
                this.browse.loading = false;
            }, () => { this.browse.loading = false; });
        },
        viewBrowsed(room) { this.browse.open = false; this.openRoom(room.chatRoomId); },
        // a listed private room: a join request for its moderators, with an optional note (Comms-Messaging §18.3 phase 17)
        askToJoin(room) {
            this.$q.dialog({ title: fill(t('Ask to join {room}'), { room: room.roomName || '' }), message: t('A note for the moderators (optional)'), cancel: true,
                prompt: { model: '', type: 'text', attrs: { maxlength: 200 } } }).onOk((note) => {
                this.post('requestJoin', { chatRoomId: room.chatRoomId, note: note || '' }).then((json) => { if (json.outcome) room.pending = true; }, () => {});
            });
        },
        joinBrowsed(room) {
            this.post('join', { chatRoomId: room.chatRoomId }).then(() => {
                this.browse.open = false;
                this.scheduleRooms();
                this.openRoom(room.chatRoomId);
            }, () => {});
        },

        // ---- the page ----
        measure() {
            const box = this.$el && this.$el.querySelector ? this.$el.querySelector('.m-chat') : null;
            if (!box || !box.getBoundingClientRect) return;
            const top = box.getBoundingClientRect().top + (window.scrollY || 0);
            const footer = document.querySelector('.q-footer');
            this.height = Math.max(this.stacked ? 420 : 480, window.innerHeight - top - (footer ? footer.offsetHeight : 0) - 6);
            this.$nextTick(() => {
                const over = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
                if (over > 0 && over < 80 && this.height - over >= (this.stacked ? 420 : 480)) this.height -= over;
            });
        },
        escape() { const room = this.$refs.room; return room ? room.onEscape() : false; },
        registerKeys() {
            if (!moqui.keymap || !moqui.keymap.registerScope) return;
            const key = (keys, label, run, action, when) => ({ keys, label, action: action || keys, when, run: (event) => run(event) !== false });
            this.unregisterKeys = moqui.keymap.registerScope('Chat', [
                key('Alt+Up', t('Previous room'), () => this.moveRoom(-1, false), 'previousRoom'),
                key('Alt+Down', t('Next room'), () => this.moveRoom(1, false), 'nextRoom'),
                key('Alt+Shift+Up', t('Previous unread room'), () => this.moveRoom(-1, true), 'previousUnreadRoom'),
                key('Alt+Shift+Down', t('Next unread room'), () => this.moveRoom(1, true), 'nextUnreadRoom'),
                key('Esc', t('Mark the room read and close the side pane'), () => this.escape(), 'markRoomRead', () => !this.$root.trayOpen && !!this.$refs.room),
                key('Shift+Esc', t('Mark every room read'), () => { this.markAllRead(); return true; }, 'markAllRead')
            ]);
        }
    },
    mounted() {
        this.measure();
        this.onResize = () => this.measure();
        window.addEventListener('resize', this.onResize);
        this.onDraft = () => this.readDrafts();
        window.addEventListener('boss-chat-draft', this.onDraft);
        this.readDrafts();
        moqui.drafts.ready().then(() => this.readDrafts());
        this.unsubscribe = [];
        if (moqui.chat) {
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('event', (payload) => this.onEvent(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('room', (payload) => this.onRoomSignal(payload)));
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('read', (payload) => this.onReadSignal(payload)));
            // a room's last message disappeared (phase 16): the list reads its rooms again
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('expired', (payload) => { if (payload && this.rooms.some((room) => room.chatRoomId === payload.chatRoomId)) this.scheduleRooms(); }));
        }
        this.registerKeys();
        this.roomsReady = this.loadRooms();
        this.roomsReady.then(() => this.$nextTick(() => this.measure()));
        // this browser's crypto device, made in idle time once the rooms show, so new chats can be encrypted (§6.5)
        this.roomsReady.then(() => { if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.makeDeviceSoon) moqui.chat.makeDeviceSoon(); });
        // scheduled messages and reminders (phase 15): read now and on each change; this device's held ones go when due
        if (moqui.chat && moqui.chat.loadSchedule) {
            this.roomsReady.then(() => this.loadSchedule());
            this.unsubscribe.push(moqui.chat.on('schedule', () => this.loadSchedule()));
            this.heldTimer = setInterval(() => this.sendHeldDue(), 60000);
        }
        this.applyParams();
        setTimeout(() => this.measure(), 300);
    },
    beforeUnmount() {
        window.removeEventListener('resize', this.onResize);
        window.removeEventListener('boss-chat-draft', this.onDraft);
        (this.unsubscribe || []).forEach((off) => off());
        if (this.unregisterKeys) this.unregisterKeys();
        clearTimeout(this.roomsTimer);
        clearTimeout(this.feedTimer);
        clearInterval(this.heldTimer);
    }
};
</script>
